window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4801,"title":"Chapter 4801 Impure","paragraphs":["Chapter 4801 Impure","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli had never expected that they would be lucky enough to enter a small cosmos by chance!","Moreover, the environment in this small universe was completely different from what they had seen in the ancient books.","Generally, the energy contained in a small universe was of a single attribute. It was either Heaven and Earth Profound Qi or Devil Qi. Of course, there might be other attributes of energy, but it was not recorded in the ancient records of the Ancient God Clan.","The space they were in now could accommodate so many energies of different attributes at the same time, and they could even coexist so harmoniously with each other...It could really be described as unheard of.","The two of them quietly observed the surrounding environment for a while and thought at the same time, The energy here is so abundant, and it has all kinds of attributes. For cultivators like us who cultivate at the same time, it is definitely a holy land for cultivation! In the future, we will be able to cultivate the Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual with half the effort.”","Hearing this, Li Moying’s brows raised slightly,” Wifey, you’re actually so impatient to cultivate the ” Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual “. Could it be that your husband has been too cold to you during this period of time, causing you to be so dissatisfied and even used this kind of method to vaguely remind me?”","“What?”","Huang Yueli went into a blank for a moment before she suddenly understood and her face turned red as she couldn’t help but stretch out her little claws and gave Li Moying’s chest a hard smack,” You, you, you...What are you thinking about? The cultivation technique I’m talking about is a normal cultivation technique, not that...”","“What about that?” Li Moying intentionally leaned closer and asked,” I didn’t seem to have said anything right? Li ‘er, your face is so red, could it be that you’re thinking of something impure?”","His thin lips were almost touching her soft face.","Huang Yueli glared at him and puffed up her cheeks,” You...You know it very well! When I said it was beneficial for cultivation, I meant that the Evil Qi here was dense. We could cultivate evil techniques with half the effort, not...It’s not what you think!”","In the past, although they had been secretly cultivating the ” Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual,” apart from the Dual Cultivation Method, the two of them hadn’t advanced very quickly in other aspects.","Because in the area where the Gods and Devil Beasts gathered, there was almost no Evil Qi in the air.","“What?”","Huang Yueli went into a blank for a moment before she suddenly understood and her face turned red as she couldn’t help but stretch out her little claws and gave Li Moying’s chest a hard smack,” You, you, you...What are you thinking about? The cultivation technique I’m talking about is a normal cultivation technique, not that...”","“What about that?” Li Moying intentionally leaned closer and asked,” I didn’t seem to have said anything right? Li ‘er, your face is so red, could it be that you’re thinking of something impure?”","His thin lips were almost touching her soft face.","Huang Yueli glared at him and puffed up her cheeks,” You...You know it very well! When I said it was beneficial for cultivation, I meant that the Evil Qi here was dense. We could cultivate evil techniques with half the effort, not...It’s not what you think!”","In the past, although they had been secretly cultivating the ” Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual,” apart from the Dual Cultivation Method, the two of them hadn’t advanced very quickly in other aspects.","Because in the area where the Gods and Devil Beasts gathered, there was almost no Evil Qi in the air.","In the past, although they had been secretly cultivating the ” Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual,” apart from the Dual Cultivation Method, the two of them hadn’t advanced very quickly in other aspects.","Because in the area where the Gods and Devil Beasts gathered, there was almost no Evil Qi in the air."]},{"number":4802,"title":"Chapter 4802 There’s Someone!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4802 There’s Someone!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The two of them had been trapped in the Devil Territory for nearly a month.","In other words, for such a long time, because of the huge pressure, the two of them did not have any chance to get close.","Now that he finally managed to come out of that damned place, Li Moying only wanted to hug his wife to celebrate.","Who knew that before he could even kiss his wife’s little face, he was cruelly and mercilessly pushed away.","Young Lord Li’s face could not hold on any longer and instantly became aggrieved,” Li ‘er, what are you doing?”","Thinking back to that time when the two of them had not gotten married, Huang Yueli was mesmerized by his face. Every time he used a little bit of his charm, she would be able to coax Li ‘er over and at least a couple of kisses would definitely not be a problem.","But now?","He was actually pushed away!","Could it be that because they were an old couple, he had lost his attraction towards Li ‘er?","Huang Yueli didn’t notice the strange expression of the man beside her but turned her head with a face full of vigilance, looking up and down left and right.","“Husband, there’s someone here, really! I heard some movement just now. It seemed like someone was talking.”","Li Moying was stunned for a moment before he regained his senses and became vigilant,” What did you say? Someone was there? That’s impossible, right? This was a newly opened small universe, and it was completely separated from the God Realm. We are the owners of this space now. Without our consent, no one can enter.”","Huang Yueli naturally understood this logic and for a moment, she started to doubt her own judgement.","She frowned slightly.” That’s right. This isn’t a Profound Realm, but a small universe. Outsiders shouldn’t be able to enter. Then... Did I hear wrongly? But I clearly heard someone talking, and I could tell that it was a man’s voice!”","Li Moying smiled as he replied,” Of course you heard wrongly. There are so many different types of energy gathered in this small universe. When the energy flows, there will be sounds. It’s not a big deal, so there’s no need to be so nervous.”","Huang Yueli thought about it and it made sense. Furthermore, she had released her divine perception to probe the surroundings and discovered that other than a large amount of energy of various attributes, there wasn’t any living person’s aura so she gradually relaxed.","“Alright, looks like I heard wrong.”","“Alright, don’t worry. If you have time to think about it, why don’t you seize the time and cultivate with me...”","The smile on Li Moying’s lips gradually deepened as his voice turned deeper and deeper.","He slowly inched closer to Huang Yueli and inched closer bit by bit as he blew a breath into her ear,” Li ‘er, cultivate properly and don’t slack off. You really haven’t worked hard recently. It’s better for your husband to supervise you...”","The man’s magnetic voice echoed in her ears. That handsome face was right in front of her, and her nose was filled with a familiar masculine scent.","Huang Yueli’s small face once again turned slightly red.","It was a beautiful day, and there was no one around. The atmosphere was just right.","Li Moying took the opportunity to stretch out his arm and hooked it around her slender waist as he lowered his head towards her.","Huang Yueli was very cooperative this time as she obediently raised her head.","Just as the two of them were about to kiss, a voice suddenly sounded.","“Eh? They’re going to kiss again! They’re so loving!”","This time around, even Li Moying heard it clearly.","The two of them immediately quivered and separated."]},{"number":4803,"title":"Chapter 4803 Who’s There","paragraphs":["Chapter 4803 Who’s There","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Although this sound was very soft and almost inaudible, cultivators with slightly lower cultivation might not be able to detect it at all.","However, to the two of them, this voice was very clear. It was absolutely impossible for them to have misheard it.","At this moment, no matter how thick-headed a person was, they could no longer have any thoughts of being in love.","There was actually someone else besides them in this seemingly absolutely safe and secretive little universe!","This wasn’t surprise, but fear!","“There really is someone! How could this be? How did she get in? Could it be that she was trapped in the Devil Territory with us earlier?” Li Moying frowned and protected Huang Yueli in his embrace as he raised his head to observe the surrounding situation vigilantly.","“No, we’ve been in the Devil Territory for so long. If there are other living people, it’s impossible for us not to notice them.”","In the Devil Territory, other than the Devil Beasts that could survive in the void, no matter what race it was, whether it was the Ancient God Clan, the Human Race, or the Devil Clan, they all needed to borrow a certain amount of energy to ensure their own safety.","Therefore, if there were living people, they would definitely come to the grey fog in the central region.","The grey fog was only so big. With an additional person, it was very easy to sense it.","However, they knew nothing about it. This was absolutely illogical!","Li Moying’s heart was filled with doubts and for a moment, he didn’t act rashly.","And not only was Huang Yueli unable to answer his question, on the contrary, she was even more shocked than him,” This isn’t the main point. The main point is, what I heard earlier, was clearly a man’s voice? Why did it become a woman’s now? Could it be...Are there two more people here?”","One person was already scary enough, and now, there were two of them!","Li Moying couldn’t remain calm anymore as he couldn’t help but ask,” Are you sure you didn’t hear wrongly? Maybe it was a woman’s voice, but you didn’t hear it clearly just now.”","Huang Yueli shook her head,” How could I have misheard? I’m very sure that it was a man who spoke just now. Moreover, that voice sounded a little familiar...But I can’t remember where I’ve heard it before.”","“Familiar?” Li Moying raised his brows.","The two of them looked around for a while, trying to find traces of other people.","However, the area of this small universe was very large, and one could not see the end at a glance. The ground spread out in all directions, and it was unknown where it led to.","The light paths formed by various energies in the sky intertwined with each other, covering the ground with a layer of dazzling light and shadow, making it difficult for people to determine the specific situation around them.","Although they did not find anything, the two of them did not feel any danger approaching after staying in the same place for so long.","Huang Yueli had already calmed down by now. After pondering for a moment, she said:” Why don’t we go around and investigate? I don’t know how big this small universe is. It’s good for us to confirm the size of the space first.” However, the area of this small universe was very large, and one could not see the end at a glance. The ground spread out in all directions, and it was unknown where it led to.","The light paths formed by various energies in the sky intertwined with each other, covering the ground with a layer of dazzling light and shadow, making it difficult for people to determine the specific situation around them.","Although they did not find anything, the two of them did not feel any danger approaching after staying in the same place for so long.","Huang Yueli had already calmed down by now. After pondering for a moment, she said: ” Why don’t we go around and investigate? I don’t know how big this small universe is. It’s good for us to confirm the size of the space first.”"]},{"number":4804,"title":"Chapter 4804 Holy Armament","paragraphs":["Chapter 4804 Holy Armament","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Earlier when Huang Yueli and Li Moying woke up, there was a desert beneath their feet and they had spontaneously imagined that the entire small universe was in such an environment.","However, in fact, only the area in the center did not have any vegetation.","As they moved away from the center and gradually moved to the edge, some green plants began to appear on the ground, like moss.","As they continued to walk further out, the types of plants became more and more complicated.","From the moss to the short shrubs, then to the small tree that was as tall as a person, until...","Huang Yueli raised her head and looked at the lush forest that had already formed a stretch, her face filled with amazement,” Heavens, this is really too spectacular! It’s simply unimaginable!”","The plants in the small universe were very similar to the plants they had seen in the God Realm, but there were also differences.","The biggest feature was that the energy in the small universe was so abundant that it was almost overflowing. Therefore, all kinds of energy could even attach to the surface of these plants, forming a layer of halo.","Different types of energy were deposited on the leaves, showing different colors.","The taller the tree, the more energy it could absorb.","The small moss from before only emitted a faint light, looking like countless fireflies.","However, every tree in the forest before him had an extremely dazzling light. Every leaf reflected different halos, flowing with light and colorful colors, and was dazzling.","It was as if he had entered a fairyland.","Even with Li Moying’s extremely cold and prudent character, when he saw this scene, he couldn’t hide the astonishment on his face as he stood rooted to the spot.","After a long while, Huang Yueli regained her senses.","She quickly walked into the forest, stood on her tiptoes, and plucked a leaf from a big tree in front of her.","The leaf that was emitting a crimson glow lay quietly on her fair palm, like a ball of fire burning in her palm.","Huang Yueli sighed,” What dense fire attributed Profound Qi! The energy contained in this leaf was several times higher than the highest grade fire attribute crystal. If we can bring it out of the small cosmos and use it to refine profound artifacts, we can definitely refine magic artefacts.”","There was a saying in the Immortal Realm that only a Profound Life Realm expert could refine a Holy Armament. Moreover, they had to use their own blood essence to refine it. Therefore, they could only refine it once in their lives. The only Holy Armament was the life Spirit of this expert.","However, Huang Yueli felt that things like Holy Armaments should not only be refined once, this was illogical.","The biggest reason why it couldn’t be refined was probably because the quality of the heavenly resources in the Immortal Realm wasn’t good enough, and the energy it contained wasn’t enough. Only by mixing it with the blood essence of a Profound Life Realm expert could it be upgraded to the quality of a Holy Armament.","Also, because every cultivator’s blood essence was related to strength and lifespan, it was impossible to extract it indefinitely. Therefore, every expert weighed the pros and cons and only refined one. If they had more, the gains would not make up for the losses.","However, what if there were materials of a higher grade and purer energy?","Then could he get rid of the blood essence of the Profound Life Realm and directly refine it into a Holy Armament?","Huang Yueli had always had this thought but unfortunately, this kind of material didn’t exist at all so she couldn’t even give it a try so she could only think about it in her mind.","However, it was different after entering this small universe."]},{"number":4805,"title":"Chapter 4805 Tatched Hut","paragraphs":["Chapter 4805 Tatched Hut","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Even every single blade of leaf in this small universe contained pure energy, which was purer than the natural treasures she had come into contact with before.","As a Spirit Armament Master, Huang Yueli had already started to let her imagination run wild as she came up with dozens of different refining plans.","If she could really use these leaves, branches, flowers and the like to refine Spirit Armaments, the quality of Spirit Armaments would definitely soar!","Although, whether or not she could really refine a Holy Armament in the end still needed to be tested in practice.","However, just seeing such hope made her extremely excited.","But Huang Yueli still remembered the purpose of the two of them coming over so she quickly suppressed the excitement in her heart. She turned to Li Moying and said,” The sound we heard earlier, it doesn’t feel like it came from the depths of the forest. Let’s not enter the forest. Let’s go to other places to take a look first.”","Li Moying nodded his head,” That’s right, I have the same intention too.”","Since there were plants in this small universe, there might be animals as well. Although they hadn’t seen them yet, it didn’t mean that they didn’t exist.","If the two of them took the risk to enter the forest and attracted the attack of some magical beasts, then they would be in big trouble.","To be on the safe side, it was better to find the source of those two voices before making a move.","The two of them walked along the periphery of the forest for a while.","As the two of them moved forward, the surrounding environment also changed.","The forest gradually became sparse, but the terrain began to become steep.","The two of them walked past a small hill and saw cliffs and waterfalls. They were even more amazed.","Suddenly, Huang Yueli pointed ahead and exclaimed,” Husband, look over there! Is that... Is that a thatched hut? It looks like a thatched hut that is inhabited!”","Li Moying followed the direction of her finger and his brows immediately knitted together.","” That’s right, it really is a thatched hut. However, how can there be one in this small universe?”","Whether it was the undulating terrain, the flowing colors in the sky, or even the beautiful trees and shrubs, all of them could be said to be a unique environment formed by the combined effects of the black crystal and the Empyrean Devil Crystal.","However, this tatched hut...","This was definitely not something that could be formed naturally. Someone must have built it.","However, the small universe they were in now should have been formed in the explosion a few days ago. Even if someone else had really entered the small universe, it was impossible for them to build a tatched hut in such an exquisite manner in just a few days.","Huang Yueli pursed her lips as she stared at the straw hut for a while before she suddenly said: ” This tatched hut...looks a little familiar.”"]},{"number":4806,"title":"Chapter 4806 My Husband","paragraphs":["Chapter 4806 My Husband","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The two of them took large strides and soon arrived at the door of the thatched hut.","The structure of this thatched hut was very complete.","Not only was there a large courtyard outside the house, but there was also a bamboo fence outside the courtyard, and the door was tightly shut.","Huang Yueli walked closer and her footsteps paused.","The bamboo door in front of her was like a piece of paper to a cultivator with her cultivation. No matter how tightly it was closed, she only needed to push it gently to open it.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t immediately break the door down but instead stretched out her hand to lightly knock on the door.","“Master, Disciple Huang Yueli was late due to some reason and missed the time that we agreed on, please forgive her. However, I brought my husband here this time. He also cultivates the Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual like me, so he can be considered your disciple.”","As she said that, Huang Yueli turned her head to look at Li Moying.","Li Moying understood and immediately raised his voice,” Disciple Li Moying greets Master.”","Not long after, a low male voice came from the door.","“Come in.”","Hearing this voice, Huang Yueli’s eyes flashed with joy.","It seemed that she had not guessed wrongly. There was indeed someone in this thatched hut. Moreover, it was none other than Saint Iniquitous Shadow, who was in the Profound Life Realm and had a master-disciple relationship with her!","Previously when she was trapped in the Infernal domain, Huang Yueli had been worried, not knowing how Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s current situation was.","Could it be that even the last trace of divine sense had disappeared, so he could not control the mechanism in the Cave Dwelling, causing him to be swallowed by the Energy Void?","Now, it seemed that Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s consciousness had not completely disappeared.","This was great news.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying walked side by side through the courtyard as they walked towards the thatched hut.","There were a lot of flowers and plants in this courtyard, which was different from what the two of them had seen in the small universe outside. Moreover, there were living spirit beasts!","However, the two of them had no time to look at it carefully. They glanced at it hurriedly and went straight into the thatched hut.","The living room was spotless, but the furnishings were very simple. There was only a table, two chairs, and a few cabinets.","A tall man sat on a chair beside the table.","His facial features were handsome and resolute, and his eyes were overbearing. Just his gaze alone made the two of them tremble.","The appearance of a true expert was no longer important. cultivators with lower cultivation levels could not even see his appearance clearly. They could only feel the incomparably sharp aura on his body.","However, his intimidating aura didn’t scare Huang Yueli.","As soon as she entered, she smiled.” Master, I’m relieved to see that you’re safe and sound. How is it? Are you surprised to see your disciple?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow didn’t have a smile on his face. He glanced at her coldly and snorted. It was indeed a pleasant surprise. I thought that you had long forgotten that you had a master. Even if my divine sense dies, I won’t be able to see my disciple return.”","“Ahem, how could that be?”","Huang Yueli coughed twice guiltily as she hurriedly pulled her husband out as a shield.","“Master, I haven’t introduced him to you yet. This is my Husband!”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s gaze swept across Li Moying’s face as he replied indifferently,” Haha, no need to introduce. I can tell.”","Just now, his little disciple was about to kiss this handsome young man. Now, she was holding hands and was unwilling to let go. He was not blind. How could he not know this person’s identity?"]},{"number":4807,"title":"Chapter 4807 Abominable","paragraphs":["Chapter 4807 Abominable","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli pulled her husband’s hand and stood shoulder to shoulder with him in front of Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","“Master, I was in a hurry to leave last time because I wanted to save him. Look, isn’t he as good-looking and powerful as I said? Even his talent is higher than mine?”","Huang Yueli still remembered how Saint Iniquitous Shadow had stopped her with a look of pity when she left the cave dwelling and even said a bunch of words to dissuade her.","What he meant was that she was a peerless genius, yet she was already married at such a young age. It was simply too thoughtless.","With her talent, ordinary people were not worthy of her. She was afraid that a wild man had taken advantage of her young age and used flowery words to deceive her.","If it wasn’t for the fact that Saint Iniquitous Shadow was only left with his spirit body in the cave and couldn’t stop her, perhaps he would have personally jumped out to break up the couple.","Although Huang Yueli had defended her husband at that time, bragging about Li Moying’s innate talent, ability and looks to the skies, but Saint Iniquitous Shadow obviously didn’t believe her. Although he didn’t say it directly, but looking at that pitiful gaze, he had clearly treated her as an ignorant young lady who was blinded by love!","Alright, she was indeed...","However, her Husband’s excellence was also true!","Huang Yueli had made up her mind at that moment to bring her husband to Saint Iniquitous Shadow and let him take a good look. Her taste in choosing her husband was as outstanding as her innate talent.","Now, she finally had the chance to show off her Husband.","“Ke ke, I think...”","The corners of Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s lips twitched as his cold gaze swept past Li Moying.","He had long made up his mind that no matter what kind of person his little disciple’s Husband was, no matter how outstanding his talent was, he would never praise him!","After all, Huang Yueli had left the cave dwelling in a hurry because of this brat.","She had promised to save him in three months, but what happened? She didn’t know that she would come back after leaving.","With his intelligence and wisdom that had lived for tens of thousands of years, of course, he knew with his toes that this pretty boy outside must have bewitched his disciple. That was why such an outstanding and cute little disciple would throw her master to the back of her mind.","This was simply...abominable!"]},{"number":4808,"title":"Chapter 4808 A True Genius","paragraphs":["Chapter 4808 A True Genius","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This youth that stood before him was really just like what Huang Yueli had said, a god grade genius whose innate talent wasn’t inferior to hers.","Furthermore, no idea what kind of fortuitous encounter he had, to actually already be Dao Profound Realm cultivation.","Much higher than Huang Yueli.","And his age...","Originally, Saint Iniquitous Shadow thought that a cultivator with such talent and cultivation was definitely not young. No matter what, he was at least fifty years old.","Although in the eyes of the Ancient God Clan, fifty years old was just an adult and was still considered a teenager, considering that his little disciple’s bone age was less than twenty years old, even if he was only fifty years old, it was enough to accuse this brat of being an old cow eating young grass.","However, when Saint Iniquitous Shadow took a closer look, he realised that Li Moying was only three to four years older than Huang Yueli.","With a Dao Profound Realm practitioner’s lifespan of easily over a thousand years, the two people’s bone age really looked about the same so no matter how much they exaggerated it, there was no way to say that Li Moying was an old bull.","Moreover, this brat not only had shocking talent in cultivation cultivation, the Evil Qi in his body had also been cultivated to an exceptionally pure level, not the slightest bit inferior to Huang Yueli’s.","But when Huang Yueli first cultivated the ” Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual “, it was him, as her Master, who personally guided her, opening up her meridians and laying down her foundation.","As for Li Moying?","He was outside the Cave Dwelling, so he could only rely on himself to study the cultivation technique to cultivate.","To be able to cultivate to such a level...Wouldn’t his talent in the path of evil cultivation be even more outstanding than his little disciple?","There was nothing wrong with their talent or age, so they could only find a breakthrough in their relationship.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow frowned and coughed.” Kid, what’s your name?”","Li Moying didn’t say a word as he stood quietly on the spot, allowing Saint Iniquitous Shadow to probe.","It was until he heard his question that he took a step forward and cupped his hands towards him,” Greetings Master, Disciple’s name is Li Moying, a member of Cloudy Qilin Clan.”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was holding a teacup, wanting to drink some water to moisten his throat. When he heard the word ” Master,” he almost spat out the tea.","“Cough cough...” He almost choked and coughed for a while before he recovered.” What master? Who is your master? Did I allow you to call me master?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s face was filled with disdain.","Li Moying didn’t seem to be bothered as he gave a slight smile and replied respectfully,” According to the rules of the God Realm, since my wife is your disciple, as your husband, I naturally have to follow suit and call you Master. Could it be that Master doesn’t want my wifey as your disciple anymore?”","“Don’t talk nonsense!” Saint Iniquitous Shadow immediately retorted.","What a joke. His spirit body had been trapped in this Cave Dwelling for more than 100,000 years before he found such a talented disciple."]},{"number":4809,"title":"Chapter 4809 No Reason To Nitpick","paragraphs":["Chapter 4809 No Reason To Nitpick","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Is that so? There’s such a thing?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow frowned, feeling even more displeased.","Did this kid have the respect that he should have when he saw a senior expert? Why was he so arrogant?","He actually said something, and this kid immediately retorted. He didn’t even put him, his master, in his eyes!","No, who was his master?","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was racking his brains, thinking of how to continue making things difficult for Li Moying.","Unexpectedly, this time around, Huang Yueli couldn’t sit still anymore. She walked to Li Moying’s side and spoke first,” Master, don’t you remember? I clearly told you last time that my husband and I not only met and got married in the Lower Realm, but we also have a relationship of two lifetimes! When we were in the Lower Realm, we obtained the remnant scroll of the Soul Splitting Technique that you left behind. My husband used this remnant scroll to save me. Otherwise, my soul would have long dissipated...”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was still pulling a long face because his little disciple was unhappy that a brat was talking back to him.","Suddenly, when he heard the words “Soul Splitting Technique”, a crack appeared on his tense face.","Because the array formation had collapsed and he had been swept into the Devil Territory, his spirit body had been severely damaged and his memory had also deviated.","It was only at this moment that he suddenly remembered.","Initially Huang Yueli and Li Moying had the Ancient God Clan bloodline and had been cultivating cultivation methods but they were able to absorb the Evil Qi that he released outside the cave dwelling’s transmission array and thus fell into this cave dwelling. That was because the two of them had already cultivated the Soul Splitting Technique twenty years ago!","Moreover, these two people in front of him were the only peerless geniuses who had successfully used the Soul Splitting Technique other than him in so many years.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow fell silent.","He gave a cold snort as he swept a glance at Li Moying. Although he still couldn’t stand him, but he couldn’t find any reason to nitpick anymore.","To be able to execute the Soul Splitting Technique for Huang Yueli and endure the pain of his soul being torn apart, it meant that his feelings for Huang Yueli were so deep that no one could compare to it.","To be able to bet his life and soul for such an almost impossible glimmer of hope, it showed that this kid had amazing courage.","And in the end, he was able to successfully execute the Soul Splitting Technique and save his beloved woman. This could only mean that Li Moying’s innate talent in deviant cultivation was outstanding, a peerless genius that might not even be seen once in a hundred thousand years, not inferior to his innate talent in cultivation.","Facing such a young junior, even if Saint Iniquitous Shadow wanted to be thick-skinned and take advantage of his seniority, he would be too embarrassed to say that he was not worthy of his disciple.","Huang Yueli had been secretly observing Saint Iniquitous Shadow and when she saw that his expression had softened, she hurriedly gave Li Moying a look.","Li Moying understood and immediately took a step forward as he bowed,” Master, this disciple was rude earlier.”","“Don’t call me...”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was still a little unwilling and felt disgruntled.","However, before he could finish speaking, he was interrupted by a sweet female voice."]},{"number":4810,"title":"Chapter 4810 Brother Hong","paragraphs":["Chapter 4810 Brother Hong","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When they were interrupted for the second time, both of them thought they heard a female voice.","However, when they arrived at the thatched hut, they only saw Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","Thinking back to the fact that they had been in Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave dwelling before they had fallen into the void, they assumed that the person who had spoken was Saint Iniquitous Shadow himself.","As for the female voice...Perhaps the abnormal energy fluctuations in the small universe had affected their hearing?","It was only at this moment when they heard this voice again that Huang Yueli and Li Moying realised that in this small universe, there was actually a woman as well!","The two of them turned around in surprise and saw a secret door at the back of the living room open. A woman in a light green dress walked out.","This woman was unusually delicate. Her slender waist was so thin that it seemed like it could break at any time. When she walked, the clothes on her body seemed a little loose.","Her skin was so fair that it was almost transparent. Her chin was sharp, and her eyes were watery. Although her exact age could not be seen like Saint Iniquitous Shadow, she was a very beautiful woman.","However, she did not look very healthy.","When Huang Yueli saw this, she seemed to have understood something and before the other party could walk in front of her, she had already shouted out: ” Master’s wife! Are you the legendary Master’s Wife? You’re really as beautiful as I imagined. You’re so compatible with Master!”","Almost the instant she saw this lady, Huang Yueli reacted.","The reason why Saint Iniquitous Shadow would leave behind such a cultivation method was because he was the same as Li Moying, to save the life of his beloved woman, he had torn apart his own primordial spirit?","The woman who appeared in his Cave Dwelling, other than her master’s wife, how could there be anyone else?","Moreover, this woman even intimately called Saint Iniquitous Shadow ” Brother Hong “!","Tsk tsk, she was too embarrassed to call her husband “brother”.","Sure enough, upon hearing Huang Yueli’s address, the lady’s fair face immediately turned slightly red.","However, she quickly concealed her loss of composure and took on the attitude of a Mistress as she turned her head towards Huang Yueli with a gentle smile,” You must be Li ‘er? Brother Hong has been talking about you for the past few days. He said that you are the most outstanding genius he has ever seen. Now it seems that it is indeed correct.”","Huang Yueli had heard too many of such praises."]},{"number":4811,"title":"Chapter 4811 A Different Side","paragraphs":["Chapter 4811 A Different Side","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The woman glanced at Saint Iniquitous Shadow and took the teacup from him. She took a sip and said,” Why can’t I come out?” I haven’t come out for tens of thousands of years, and now I can’t even look at my little disciple and her husband?”","After Saint Iniquitous Shadow delivered the tea, he pushed a plate of snacks to the woman.","Hearing the woman’s impatient ridicule, not only did he not show any signs of anger, but he even smiled in an especially flattering manner.","“My Darling, what are you saying? It’s fine if you want to see anyone. I’m not... Are you worried about your health? You’ve always been weak. If...”","“What if?” The woman turned her head and glared at him.” Stop saying those ominous words. I was weak in the past. Now that I’m in this small universe, I’m very good.”","“Yes, yes, yes. My Darling Wife is right.”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow seemed to disagree, but after hesitating for a while, he nodded with a smile and went along with the woman.","Only then was the lady satisfied as her line of sight once again turned towards Huang Yueli and Li Moying as she waved at the two of them.","“Don’t stand there, you two. Come and sit down. Come, have some tea and snacks. The tea leaves made from the Frost Heaven Treasure Leaf are not available outside. I only found one more than a hundred thousand years ago and later planted it in my Cave Dwelling. Come, have a taste. Don’t stand on ceremony.”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying didn’t react for a long time.","In fact, the two of them were already stunned.","Judging from the way Saint Iniquitous Shadow acted just now, both of them felt that he was a powerful, stubborn, and bad-tempered senior expert who had a cold and distant aura.","He never expected that the moment his Wife appeared, Saint Iniquitous Shadow would become a completely different person.","His shameless actions and words perfectly explained what it meant to be a wife slave.","She simply couldn’t watch anymore!","Huang Yueli who had once followed Saint Iniquitous Shadow to cultivate for a period of time felt as though she had taken in a fake Master.","If Saint Iniquitous Shadow had looked like this when they entered the straw hut, she would not have dared to recognize him. She would have thought that a strange uncle had entered and quickly fled with her husband.","Upon hearing Master’s wife’s call, the two of them came back to their senses and quickly walked to the table to sit down.","Huang Yueli didn’t stand on ceremony as she took two cups and poured a cup of tea for herself and Li Moying.","It was still alright when she was pouring tea for herself but when she was pouring tea for Li Moying, Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s eyes almost popped out as though he really wanted to stop her.","In fact, the two of them were already stunned.","Huang Yueli didn’t stand on ceremony as she took two cups and poured a cup of tea for herself and Li Moying.","It was still alright when she was pouring tea for herself but when she was pouring tea for Li Moying, Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s eyes almost popped out as though he really wanted to stop her."]},{"number":4812,"title":"Chapter 4812 In Her Eyes","paragraphs":["Chapter 4812 In Her Eyes","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The woman was stunned for a moment before she frowned unhappily.” What are you doing? Why did you interrupt me? Are you deliberately going against me?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was glared at by his wife, and the aura he had when he retorted just now instantly disappeared.","He subconsciously shrunk his neck.” Cough cough, Wife, you...” Don’t be angry. I’m not going against you, but...But the thing you said, I don’t... I can’t agree!”","“But what? I haven’t even finished speaking, and you already know what I’m going to say?” The woman became even more unhappy.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow hesitated for a moment before saying, How can I not know what you’re thinking? You just want to take that brat Li Moying in as your disciple and make him our disciple right?”","The woman blinked.” So you know? In that case, there’s no need for me to waste my breath. Hurry up and prepare to let Mo ‘er take him as her master!”","Hearing this, Saint Iniquitous Shadow almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","Alright, he had been talking for a long time but Wife didn’t listen to a single word and directly ignored his opinion, directly letting Li Moying take her as his master!","Moreover, he even called Mo’er over as if the brat was really their disciple.","Was there a mistake?","But no matter how dissatisfied Saint Iniquitous Shadow was, he didn’t dare to make his wife unhappy. He could only turn his head and use a warning gaze to glare fiercely at Li Moying, trying to let this brat know that if he dared to take Li Moying as his master without permission, just you wait!","Even if a Profound Life Realm expert only released a small amount of his aura, it was already extremely powerful.","The small living room was filled with Evil Qi, and the temperature kept rising, as if it could burn at any time.","Even Dao Profound Realm cultivators found it very hard to withstand such pressure too.","However, Li Moying’s expression didn’t change at all, not even turning his head to look at Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","After hearing the woman’s words, he immediately stood up and took half a step forward. He knelt down in front of her and bowed to her.","Disciple Li Moying greets Master’s wife, please instruct me.”","The woman smiled from ear to ear and hurriedly gestured for him to stand up,” Quickly get up, quickly get up, don’t be so polite. From now on, you and Li ‘er are my and Brother Hong’s disciples. With your talent, I’m afraid we won’t be able to teach you much in cultivation cultivation. However, you still have a lot to learn in the path of evil cultivation.”","It wasn’t that she didn’t know that Saint Iniquitous Shadow was blowing his beard and glaring at her, but she couldn’t help but find it funny.","She naturally knew why her husband was unhappy. It was nothing more than because he couldn’t stand Li Moying’s arrogance and didn’t put him, a senior expert, in his eyes.","Adding on to the fact that Huang Yueli didn’t rush back to the cave dwelling in time, she had put it all on Li Moying’s head, so naturally she found him to be an eyesore.","But in her opinion, Li Moying was definitely the most ideal disciple.","The woman smiled from ear to ear and hurriedly gestured for him to stand up,” Quickly get up, quickly get up, don’t be so polite. From now on, you and Li ‘er are my and Brother Hong’s disciples. With your talent, I’m afraid we won’t be able to teach you much in cultivation. However, you still have a lot to learn in the path of evil cultivation.”","It wasn’t that she didn’t know that Saint Iniquitous Shadow was blowing his beard and glaring at her, but she couldn’t help but find it funny.","She naturally knew why her husband was unhappy. It was nothing more than because he couldn’t stand Li Moying’s arrogance and didn’t put him, a senior expert, in his eyes.","Adding on to the fact that Huang Yueli didn’t rush back to the cave dwelling in time, she had put it all on Li Moying’s head, so naturally she found him to be an eyesore.","But in her opinion, Li Moying was definitely the most ideal disciple."]},{"number":4813,"title":"Chapter 4813 Yin Niang","paragraphs":["Chapter 4813 Yin Niang","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were shrewd people and they had long seen through who was the one making the decisions in this cave dwelling.","Therefore, even though Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s expression was getting uglier and uglier, the two of them didn’t take it to heart.","Anyway, he had Master’s wife to back him up!","The two of them chatted happily with Master’s wife.","Huang Yueli was still secretly pondering in her heart, Master’s wife’s character was just as they had imagined, very gentle and kind, her voice was neither too slow nor too fast, one look and one could tell that she was a good tempered lady from a noble family.","She wondered how she had been dealt with by a man with a bad temper like her master.","“Oh, right, I forgot to introduce myself just now.” The woman smiled and said lightly,” You all know my identity. Brother Hong and I are husband and wife. However, before I cultivated the evil path, I was also a cultivator of the God Clan. I was born in the Empyrean Fox Clan. My real name is Yin Niang.”","Hearing these words, Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as she felt a little surprised.","She did not expect that their master’s wife was actually from the Empyrean Fox Clan. She had not expected this at all at the beginning.","The Empyrean Fox Clan was considered a weaker clan among the Gods Race and the number of people in the clan had always been very small. In contrast, the number of geniuses in the younger generation was also much less than the Cloudy Qilin Clan and Sacred Phoenix Clan. Hence, the number of top notch experts was pitifully small.","As a cultivator of the Empyrean Fox Clan, it was already very rare for Yin Niang to successfully advance to the Profound Life Realm, at least the middle stage.","It seemed that Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s technique was indeed very powerful. The speed of two people cultivating together would be faster than one person.","Hearing these words, Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as she felt a little surprised.","She did not expect that their master’s wife was actually from the Empyrean Fox Clan. She had not expected this at all at the beginning.","The Empyrean Fox Clan was considered a weaker clan among the Gods Race and the number of people in the clan had always been very small. In contrast, the number of geniuses in the younger generation was also much less than the Cloudy Qilin Clan and Sacred Phoenix Clan. Hence, the number of top notch experts was pitifully small.","As a cultivator of the Empyrean Fox Clan, it was already very rare for Yin Niang to successfully advance to the Profound Life Realm, at least the middle stage.","It seemed that Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s technique was indeed very powerful. The speed of two people cultivating together would be faster than one person."]},{"number":4814,"title":"Chapter 4814 Want a Daughter","paragraphs":["Chapter 4814 Want a Daughter","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Yin Niang only laughed out loud when Saint Iniquitous Shadow disappeared behind the door.","“Really...How old are you? You’re still throwing a tantrum at me.”","As she said that, she turned to look at Huang Yueli and Li Moying,” Your Master is just a little childish sometimes but it’s not that he really wants to go against you. Don’t take it to heart.”","When Li Moying heard that, he hurriedly said,” Master’s wife is really too polite. Master is after all an elder so even if he were to say a few words to us, it’s something that should be done.”","His words came from the bottom of his heart.","Although with his innate talent and temper, in his heart, he had never been bullied. If it was someone else who had such an attitude towards him, he would have long brought Huang Yueli away.","However, Saint Iniquitous Shadow was different.","Regardless of whether he admitted it or not, but ever since the day he learned the Soul Splitting Technique from the remnant page, Saint Iniquitous Shadow was already his and Huang Yueli’s master.","Furthermore, Li Moying himself was extremely grateful to Saint Iniquitous Shadow. If it wasn’t for the secret technique he had left behind, he wouldn’t have been able to save Huang Yueli. Most likely, he would have already followed Huang Yueli and committed suicide decades ago. How could he live like this now, where he was inseparable from his beloved Li ‘er?","Because of this, no matter what Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s attitude was, he would treat him as a disciple for the rest of his life.","When Yin Niang heard this, she was even more satisfied with Li Moying as she couldn’t help but smile and nod her head.","“It’s fine as long as you understand. Your master doesn’t have any ill intentions, it’s just... I just treat Li ‘er as my daughter and can’t bear to see you get married at such a young age!”","Hearing that, Huang Yueli was stunned,” Ah? It was... Is that so?”","She had not thought of this initially but now that she thought back, the attitude of Saint Iniquitous Shadow was really similar to the way her father had acted when he knew about her engagement with Li Moying.","That was to pick on her husband and find him an eyesore no matter how she looked at him.","“That’s right. I could tell just now.” Yin Niang smiled and said. “Speaking of which, before your master and I transformed into spirit bodies, we once thought of having a child. It would be best if it was a daughter. We talked about it for more than a thousand years, but unfortunately, because my body was too weak, we never succeeded. After that... There were some accidents, and we only left our spirit bodies in the Cave Dwelling. Naturally, it’s even more impossible. However, he still has an obsession in his heart. When he saw such a beautiful and cute little girl like you, he definitely had some feelings for you.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was slightly startled.","For some reason, although Yin Niang was smiling when she spoke, she could hear a trace of sadness and regret in her voice.","Moreover, there were indeed many things that Yin Niang did not understand.","As an expert in the Profound Life Realm, not only did he need to be filled with Evil Qi to reach such a level of cultivation, but the toughness of his physical body was also the foundation.","There was no lack of Profound Life Realm experts like Yin Niang in history. They looked thin and weak, but that was all they looked like.","Therefore, Huang Yueli finally understood that Yin Niang’s weak body wasn’t just what she showed, but it was real!","Could it be that she had encountered some powerful enemy after entering the Profound Life Realm and was heavily injured?","Also, the first time she entered the cave dwelling, Huang Yueli thought that Saint Iniquitous Shadow had only left a trace of consciousness in the cave dwelling but now all the signs showed that Saint Iniquitous Shadow and Yin Niang were complete spirit bodies, just like Little Wang Cai in the Sky Phoenix Ring."]},{"number":4815,"title":"Chapter 4815 Sulking","paragraphs":["Chapter 4815 Sulking","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Combined with what Yin Niang had just said, it seemed that she and Saint Iniquitous Shadow had encountered some danger and had no choice but to leave their spirit bodies in the Cave Dwelling.","What exactly...What happened?","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were extremely puzzled but Yin Niang didn’t seem to be planning to elaborate so as juniors, it wasn’t appropriate for the two of them to probe further.","Yin Niang warmly welcomed the two of them.","Huang Yueli had her fill and seeing that Saint Iniquitous Shadow still hadn’t returned, she couldn’t help but feel worried,” Master’s wife, Master he...” Was he really angry? There shouldn’t be any problems if he stayed in the backyard, right? Why don’t I bring my husband over and apologize to Master?”","” No need.” Yin Niang smiled and shook her head.” He just likes to sulk. He’ll be fine in a while.”","Actually, based on Yin Niang’s understanding of her husband, Saint Iniquitous Shadow might have already calmed down and was hiding in the backyard, laughing secretly.","After all, his little disciple couldn’t run away now. He had also kidnapped a male disciple who was also a top genius. It was enough to pass on his cultivation technique and even carry it forward.","Such a good thing that came knocking on his door could not be found even if one held a lantern.","It was just that Saint Iniquitous Shadow was too proud to lose his dignity in front of the juniors.","Huang Yueli pondered for a moment and understood as she temporarily threw the matter of Saint Iniquitous Shadow to the back of her mind and thought of another important matter.","“By the way, Master’s wife, I haven’t had the chance to ask you. What happened between you and Master in the cave? Why did Moying and I arrive a few months late and the cave dwelling turned into a Devil Territory? And how did you all appear in this small universe?”","From the moment she stepped into the Devil Territory, these questions had been lingering in her mind.","After seeing Saint Iniquitous Shadow couple, he was even more confused.","Yin Niang thought for a moment and said,” In fact, I’ve been sleeping all this time. I don’t know what’s happening in the cave. I didn’t even feel anything when you acknowledged Brother Hong as your master. So, if you want to know the changes in the cave, it’s best to ask your master.”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she subconsciously turned her head and exchanged a glance with Li Moying who was beside her.","Both of them could not hide the surprise in their eyes.","Yin Niang’s spirit body was actually in a dormant state in the Cave Dwelling!","Now that Huang Yueli recalled it, when she had entered Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave twice, she had indeed not detected Yin Niang’s presence at all. Including the person who guided her to cultivate the ” Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual “, it was only Saint Iniquitous Shadow alone and she had never heard a second voice.","It should be because Yin Niang was hibernating.","However, Yin Niang was already in her spirit body state, yet she still wanted to hibernate...","Could it be...","Yin Niang thought for a moment and said,” In fact, I’ve been sleeping all this time. I don’t know what’s happening in the cave. I didn’t even feel anything when you acknowledged Brother Hong as your master. So, if you want to know the changes in the cave, it’s best to ask your master.”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she subconsciously turned her head and exchanged a glance with Li Moying who was beside her.","Both of them could not hide the surprise in their eyes.","Yin Niang’s spirit body was actually in a dormant state in the Cave Dwelling!","Now that Huang Yueli recalled it, when she had entered Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave twice, she had indeed not detected Yin Niang’s presence at all. Including the person who guided her to cultivate the ” Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual “, it was only Saint Iniquitous Shadow alone and she had never heard a second voice.","It should be because Yin Niang was hibernating.","However, Yin Niang was already in her spirit body state, yet she still wanted to hibernate...","Could it be..."]},{"number":4816,"title":"Chapter 4816 Blessing in Disguise","paragraphs":["Chapter 4816 Blessing in Disguise","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hearing Yin Niang’s words, Huang Yueli and Li Moying finally came to a realization.","At the same time, he was secretly thankful for his luck.","When Huang Yueli had thrown the Empyrean Devil Crystal into the Energy Void, she had already given up on any hope and it was even more impossible for her to think that she would be able to save Saint Iniquitous Shadow and Yin Niang. At that time, she had completely staked everything on this, thinking that since she was going to die anyway, she might as well cause a huge commotion.","Unexpectedly, it was a blessing in disguise.","Not only did she and Li Moying successfully survive, even Yin Niang’s spirit body had regained consciousness.","Such luck...Even she couldn’t believe it.","Huang Yueli sighed inwardly and asked again:” Then, Master’s wife, your and Master’s cave dwelling, has it been moved into the small universe? Will it still collapse in the future?”","” That’s right,” Yin Niang said.” The entire Cave Dwelling has already fused with the small universe during the explosion. Your master and I will be living in this small universe.” However, you don’t have to worry about the cave dwelling running out of energy. The energy in this small universe is abnormally abundant. There’s no need to gather energy through the array. Just the energy in the air can maintain the operation of the cave dwelling. As long as a small universe could be formed, it could exist stably for hundreds of millions of years. I’m afraid that when our spirit bodies dissipate, there won’t be any more problems with this Cave Dwelling.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli felt a little relieved but she recalled another matter.","“But, in this way, won’t you and Master be trapped in this small universe? To stay here for tens of thousands of years...Is there no way to let your spirit bodies leave this place? Reconstructing a physical body in the God Realm?”","Yin Niang was startled when she heard that and immediately shook her head with a smile as her gaze towards Huang Yueli became even gentler.","“As expected, taking in a female disciple is more concerned about Master. However, I’m afraid we can’t get out. I’ve only heard of the Phoenix Clan’s Nirvana Ritual, but this is a secret technique of the Phoenix Clan. It’s impossible for it to be passed on to outsiders, so we naturally can’t learn it. Moreover, the Phoenix Clan also needs to sacrifice enough sacrifices to reach nirvana. The stronger the phoenix is, the more sacrifices it needs. What are the cultivation levels of your master and I? Even if we can obtain the secret technique, it’s impossible for us to have so many sacrifices.”","Hearing these words, Huang Yueli could only swallow back the words that were originally at the tip of her tongue.","Although the secret technique of the Nirvana Ritual was not to be passed on to outsiders, with her relationship with the Phoenix Clan, she could still think of a way to obtain it. It was not impossible.","However, this was the first time she had heard of the sacrifice Yin Niang mentioned.","From Yin Niang’s tone, it seemed that a Profound Life Realm expert would need a lot of sacrifices to reach Nirvana. The Phoenix Clan’s experts could not continue to reach Nirvana indefinitely.","However, when little Wang Cai was reborn, she did not seem to notice the problem with this sacrifice.","Now that he thought about it, it might be because her Wang Cai was a good-for-nothing who only knew how to eat and drink. It did not need many sacrifices.","Although the secret technique of the Nirvana Ritual was not to be passed on to outsiders, with her relationship with the Phoenix Clan, she could still think of a way to obtain it. It was not impossible.","However, this was the first time she had heard of the sacrifice Yin Niang mentioned.","From Yin Niang’s tone, it seemed that a Profound Life Realm expert would need a lot of sacrifices to reach Nirvana. The Phoenix Clan’s experts could not continue to reach Nirvana indefinitely.","However, when Little Wang Cai was reborn, she did not seem to notice the problem with this sacrifice.","Now that he thought about it, it might be because her Wang Cai was a good-for-nothing who only knew how to eat and drink. It did not need many sacrifices."]},{"number":4817,"title":"Chapter 4817 Pointers","paragraphs":["Chapter 4817 Pointers","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment before replying:” I...” Should I know? Master’s wife, please give me some pointers?”","Listening to the tone of Master’s wife, he felt that she seemed to have asked a very stupid question...","Yin Niang could not help but laugh when she saw her frightened expression. No wonder her husband took in a little disciple as if he was raising a daughter. This little girl looked too cute.","Although her talent and strength were shocking, because she was still young, her small face still had a trace of childlike innocence. Her stunned appearance was cute and looked like a young animal.","It would be great if he really had such a daughter.","However, now that he had taken her in as his little disciple, it was also fine.","A gentle smile appeared on Yin Niang’s face.” I can’t give you any pointers. Aren’t you and Mo ‘er the masters of this small universe? Logically speaking, you should know the way out. Why are you asking me? It’s impossible for your master and I to go out.”","Their spirit bodies were already about to dissipate. They had relied on the abundant Evil Qi in the small universe to pull them back at the critical moment. Once they left this place, their spirit bodies would probably dissipate instantly. How could they dare to take this risk? Naturally, he did not even think about going out.","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was even more confused,” Moying and I are the masters of the small universe? We didn’t create this small universe, but the fragments of the Empyrean Devil Crystal and the Energy Void fused with the Great Dao of the world. Isn’t it ownerless?”","Although there were very few records about the small universe in the ancient records, but from the few words, Huang Yueli could deduce that the small universes of those ancient top powers in history were all opened up by them through extremely complicated methods, or refined from the naturally formed energy spaces in the world.","She and Li Moying had never done anything before. Even the Empyrean Devil Crystal, after she brought it back, she didn’t refine it.","After the explosion, she and Li Moying had both fainted and towards the formation of the small universe, it could be said that they didn’t contribute much, let alone refine it...","How could they become the master of a small universe?","When Yin Niang heard Huang Yueli’s question, the smile on her lips deepened,” This...I don’t know about Master’s wife, but if you’re not the masters of the small universe, you can’t appear here as living people. Only Master can enter this kind of alternate dimension. Even if your master and I are spirit bodies, we can’t enter. It’s all thanks to you that we can be absorbed into the small universe.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was even more confused,” Moying and I are the masters of the small universe? We didn’t create this small universe, but the fragments of the Empyrean Devil Crystal and the Energy Void fused with the Great Dao of the world. Isn’t it ownerless?”","Hearing this, they were both stumped as they looked at each other with bewilderment and shock. Their jaws remained open and only after a long while did they take a big gulp to swallow their saliva.","This...this was simply too incredible, wasn’t it?!","They...they had actually gained a small universe?This was truly what was meant by gaining an opportunity in adversity!","Taking in the full load of information that has just transpired, they slowly began to think back carefully on how this might have come about.","Li Moying’s brows were furrowed deeply as he delved deeply in contemplation."]},{"number":4818,"title":"Chapter 4818 Luck","paragraphs":["Chapter 4818 Luck","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes.","Yin Niang’s words were so mysterious, but she still roughly understood what Master’s wife meant.","It was nothing more than to say that they, god grade genius, should have such good luck.","Although she still felt that this statement was a little unreliable, but if she really thought about it carefully, for her and Li Moying to be able to walk till today, other than their innate cultivation speed being faster than others, their luck was indeed much better than ordinary people.","Let’s not talk about anything else, just take that time when Li Moying displayed the Soul Splitting Technique.","If it wasn’t for the fact that she coincidentally had the Sky Phoenix Ring, this peerless secret treasure, if it was someone else, even if they had the same innate talent, strength as Li Moying, it would be impossible for them to succeed and the two of them would have long become a pair of mandarin ducks who wound up with the same fate.","And the matter of her obtaining the Sky Phoenix Ring could only be attributed to luck.","” Alright, don’t think too much about it. To be able to obtain such a large and rich small universe is something that even a peak Profound Life Realm expert could only dream of. Why are you still worrying about it?”","Yin Niang looked at Huang Yueli’s tilted head, blinking her big eyes in deep thought and almost couldn’t help but stretch out her hand to pinch her face.","Tsk tsk, a god-grade genius was indeed good.","Not only was she so talented, but she was also so cute. She really wanted to kidnap her home!","Hearing Yin Niang’s words, Huang Yueli shook her head,” Mm, right, Master’s wife you’re right. Encountering such a good thing, I’ll just be secretly happy! But the problem is, my husband and I still don’t know how to leave this place. We still have a lot of things to deal with in the God Realm. We can’t stay here forever, right?”","The two of them actually wouldn’t starve to death in the small universe. Moreover, their cultivation speed was several times faster than in the outside world.","However, the two of them represented their own families. It was fine if they eloped for a period of time, but if they really disappeared forever, who knew what big trouble they would cause.","Perhaps the Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan would really formally declare war on each other and the God Realm convention would be destroyed because of this.","Let’s not talk about these faraway things, just talk about the near ones. Her Senior Brother was still waiting for her and Li Moying to return."]},{"number":4819,"title":"Chapter 4819 Sigh, Men...","paragraphs":["Chapter 4819 Sigh, Men...","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli’s entire body stiffened as she stopped in her tracks.","She thought that her footsteps were light and she was hiding behind the rockery, so Saint Iniquitous Shadow wouldn’t be able to find her.","Unexpectedly, although he seemed to be concentrating on reading the book in his hands, he had actually pricked up his ears and heard her and Li Moying’s movements clearly...","The older the ginger, the spicier it was.","Since she had already been exposed, Huang Yueli couldn’t just turn around and run away. She could only pull her husband and turn around, slowly walking out from behind the rockery, towards the front of Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave abode was perfectly replicated in the small universe, and it took up a huge area.","The scenic lake and farm in the cave abode were all here.","At this moment, Saint Iniquitous Shadow was sitting in a pavilion by the lake, drinking tea and reading a book.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged a glance and walked to the front of the pavilion as they cupped their hands together in greeting.","“Master.”","“Master.”","When Huang Yueli spoke up, Saint Iniquitous Shadow didn’t utter a word but when Li Moying called him ” Master “, he immediately gave a cold snort,” I don’t dare, I don’t dare . Why don’t I remember having a disciple like you?”","That tone was filled with disgust.","Huang Yueli was speechless.","What kind of grudge was this? Wasn’t her husband too pitiful? Saint Iniquitous Shadow still couldn’t accept the fact that he had a new disciple...","It was said that the older an old man was, the more childish his personality was. The ancients were not deceiving them!","Saint Iniquitous Shadow still didn’t know that his little disciple had already categorized him as an ” old man.” Seeing her obediently lowering her head, his heart softened.","“What’s wrong? You finally remembered that you have a master?”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes and immediately took the initiative to walk forward. Smiling, she said: ” Master, what are you saying? My master is so wise, divine, and elegant. How can I not remember? In my heart, you are the number one expert in the entire God Realm! The tallest man who is 2.8 meters tall!”","Before her voice faded, Huang Yueli felt a divine sense sweeping past her back.","The corners of her lips curled up, and she almost couldn’t help but laugh out loud.","She had just praised her master, but her husband was unhappy again.","It was obvious that because she praised Saint Iniquitous Shadow as the number one expert in the God Realm, Li Moying was not convinced and was unhappy.","Sigh, men...","Huang Yueli sighed in her heart but since she had a request from Saint Iniquitous Shadow, she had to continue to shoot this rainbow fart. She could only wait until she got out to think of a way to appease her husband.","When Saint Iniquitous Shadow heard this, he was extremely pleased. Especially with his sharp divine senses, he could sense Li Moying’s dissatisfaction and instantly, he felt his entire body relaxing.","“Yes, as expected of my good disciple. You do have good taste. Back then, when your master, I, was roaming the God Realm, which expert of the same generation wasn’t defeated by me? They would run away when they saw me, and they couldn’t even find anyone who could fight me. Sigh, being invincible is really lonely...”","“May I ask Master, since you’re already invincible, why did you become a spirit body? Could it be that this is a special cultivation method for us, evil cultivators?”","Li Moying’s voice slowly came from outside the pavilion.","The smile on Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s face froze.","Immediately following that, his face showed a trace of embarrassment as he turned around and glared at Li Moying,” Stinking brat, what do you mean by that? Are you doubting your master’s strength?”"]},{"number":4820,"title":"Chapter 4820 Whose side are you on?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4820 Whose side are you on?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hearing Li Moying’s words, even Huang Yueli’s eyes widened.","She didn’t expect her husband to be so ruthless. He was stepping on Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s sore spot!","He even stepped on it steadily and accurately!","No wonder Saint Iniquitous Shadow didn’t like him.","Now, she wanted to take back her words. It wasn’t just Saint Iniquitous Shadow who was childish. Her husband wasn’t the least bit inferior either...","Could it be that all talented men were so childish?","Huang Yueli instantly fell into a deep daze...","On the other side, Li Moying had already walked in from outside the pavilion and stood beside Huang Yueli. He turned to look at Saint Iniquitous Shadow, his face filled with innocence.","“Master, you’ve misunderstood. How would I dare to doubt your strength? I really just want to know what kind of cultivation methods we evil cultivators have...Master, aren’t you thinking too much?”","“You’re the one who’s thinking too much. I think you did it on purpose!”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was already displeased when he saw the brat’s face. Seeing his innocent expression, he wanted to hit him even more.","Why is he so good-looking? Was it useful for a man to be good-looking?","Oh, it worked...The purpose was to kidnap his little disciple!","Li Moying’s expression was one of shock after he had been scolded as he shrunk behind Huang Yueli,” Master, this disciple really didn’t do it on purpose. I didn’t expect you to be so angry. Could it be...”","“What do you mean? Shut up!”","When Saint Iniquitous Shadow heard the word ” could it be?”, he almost jumped up.","This was called bringing up the pot. He clearly knew that he didn’t want to mention this matter, but this brat was still making things difficult for him for a while and not thinking about it for a while...If this wasn’t intentional, then what was?","“Brat, who allowed you to call me that? Have I admitted that you are my disciple?” Saint Iniquitous Shadow was afraid that he would continue to ask, so he decided to strike first to gain the upper hand. He reprimanded him,” Don’t try to get close to me. My wife accepted you as her disciple. That’s her business. I haven’t even said anything!”","Before he could finish his sentence, he saw Li Moying’s expression which seemed like he wanted to say something but stopped. His intuition told him that something was wrong,” You little brat, what kind of evil idea are you harboring again?”","This time around, before Li Moying could speak, Huang Yueli who had been watching the show from the side had already stepped out with a smile.","“Master, that’s not right. Didn’t you just ask my husband why he doubted Master’s strength? If you didn’t already acknowledge his identity, why did you call yourself master?”","“What are you talking about? When did I say such a thing...”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow subconsciously retorted, but he suddenly stopped halfway through his sentence. The words he had just blurted out suddenly appeared in his mind.","[Little brat... How dare you doubt Master’s strength?]","His face stiffened as he coughed,”That was me just now...” A slip of the tongue, it was definitely a slip of the tongue! You can’t count!”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes,” Master, you’re wrong. A dignified Life Profound Realm expert, how can you go back on your word?”","“When did I go back on my word? You... Whose side are you on? How can you ruin Master’s reputation like this?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow realised that he couldn’t refute her and his face turned red. In his exasperation, he could only question Huang Yueli.","Who knew that Huang Yueli was smiling as she stood beside Li Moying and even hugged the brat’s arm,” Of course I’m standing on my husband’s side! Master, aren’t you standing on Master’s wife’s side when something happens?”"]},{"number":4821,"title":"Chapter 4821 Heartbroken","paragraphs":["Chapter 4821 Heartbroken","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Saint Iniquitous Shadow almost choked!","His little disciple actually...He didn’t even hesitate and chose to stand on that brat’s side!","Was there a mistake? She didn’t even pretend to hesitate for a moment?","Did she not think that her master would lose face if she did this?","What was even more outrageous was that she actually asked such a question!","Originally, he could still put on the airs of a Master and properly educate his little disciple, telling her that ” Husband is like clothes, Master is like hands and feet ” but now that Huang Yueli used Yin Niang as an example, how would he dare to spout nonsense?","If his wife heard this and thought that he did not put his wife first and wanted to throw a tantrum at him, he would be miserable!","Saint Iniquitous Shadow glared at Huang Yueli as he was so angry that his beard stood up.","But Huang Yueli had an innocent expression on her face and even deliberately asked: ” Master, am I wrong?”","“Yes, yes, yes, you’re right! If Master were to encounter such a situation, of course, he would also choose your master’s wife.” Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s voice seemed to come out of his teeth.","Fortunately, she was not his biological daughter but a disciple he picked up halfway.","If his biological daughter had been so angry at him since she could speak at the age of one, he would have been angered to death.","As soon as Saint Iniquitous Shadow finished speaking, a gentle and genial laugh rang out.” Husband, you’ve really touched Mother Yin. Mother Yin has indeed chosen the right person to marry you.”","Seeing Yin Niang suddenly appear from among the flowers, Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s entire body shivered, and he secretly rejoiced.","Fortunately, his desire to live had defeated his desire to strike a blow to the brat and he did not say anything wrong. Otherwise, if Yin Niang really heard him, he would not be able to bear the consequences!","Seeing Yin Niang appear, Huang Yueli and Li Moying hurriedly turned around and cupped their hands towards her.","Yin Niang smiled and said,” Have a seat. I’ve been with your master for so many years, and I’ve only accepted you two as my disciples. You’re like my own children. There’s no need to be so polite.”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow frowned. He wanted to say something, but under his wife’s glare, he held it back.","Only then was Yin Niang satisfied. Her sharp gaze became gentle again. She said gently,” Brother Hong, Li ‘er said that she had something to ask you. I can guarantee that your cultivation is extraordinary and you have a wide range of knowledge. No matter what questions they have, you will be able to answer them...”"]},{"number":4822,"title":"Chapter 4822: The Big Bang","paragraphs":["Chapter 4822: The Big Bang","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli hurriedly asked: ” Master, do you already know what happened?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow nodded slightly.” That’s right. I have indeed guessed a little...”","When the other three people present heard this, they subconsciously looked at him. Their eyes widened, waiting for him to reveal the secret behind this.","However, not only did Saint Iniquitous Shadow not answer, he even put down the teacup in his hand and stood up with his hands on the table, stretching his body.","“Argh, I’m getting old. I get tired easily in the afternoon. Once I’m tired, I can’t think...Let me take a nap first before coming back...”","“Sleep? Why would a Life Profound Realm cultivator need so much sleep? Napping? Tell me first. The weather in this small universe changes slowly and is completely different from the God Realm. How do you distinguish between morning, afternoon, and night?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was about to leave when he felt his clothes tighten.","Yin Niang pulled him back with a displeased expression and exposed him without any politeness.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s forehead started to sweat.","Was there a mistake? His wife was actually starting to tear him down now!","He was clearly the head of the family, the person with the highest status and cultivation in the family!","How did he end up like this?","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was depressed, but he didn’t dare to go against Yin Niang. He could only let her pull his ear and sit back on the chair with a stiff face.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were secretly laughing in their hearts.","Their master’s wife looked so gentle on the surface, but she did not expect her to be so fierce at home. She was completely different from the Empyrean Fox women she had seen before.","It was no wonder that he could deal with a top expert like Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow had been lectured by his wife in front of his two disciples and had lost all his face, so he secretly pushed all the blame onto Li Moying.","He gulped down several cups of tea, and under Yin Niang’s constant urging, he finally spoke reluctantly.","“The matter of the small universe is actually not difficult to explain. As far as I know, the small universes that appeared in the history of the God Realm were basically all created out of thin air by top-notch experts who forcefully tore through space with their peerless cultivation. The space they tore apart naturally formed an exit, and it was completely controlled by the master of the small universe. However, your situation is different.”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow glanced at the two of them and couldn’t help but say with envy,” Your luck really isn’t simple. You don’t have the ability to tear space, but by chance, you encountered the explosion caused by the collision of the Empyrean Devil Crystal and the energy void. The explosion formed a small universe and dragged the two of you in.”"]},{"number":4823,"title":"Chapter 4823: 4821","paragraphs":["Chapter 4823: 4821","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Saint Iniquitous Shadow nodded slowly.” Not bad. At least you know where you stand.”","Hearing this reply, Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s expressions turned even uglier.","What was going on?","They had gone through thousands of difficulties and dangers before successfully escaping from the Devil Territory. They thought that they had benefited from this disaster and picked up a small universe for nothing.","And the result?","He was actually trapped in this small universe?","However, there were still a lot of things waiting for the two of them to deal with in the God Realm!","Huang Yueli bit her lips and asked: ” Master, then...” What about my husband and I? We... We can’t stay here forever. You know our identities. If we disappear from the God Realm, who knows what kind of chaos it will be! We have to get out!”","As she spoke, she suddenly thought of something.” Oh right, Master, when you found out that we couldn’t leave, you clearly smiled...You actually know how to get us out of here, don’t you?”","Huang Yueli looked at Saint Iniquitous Shadow with anticipation.","Although Saint Iniquitous Shadow was a little tsundere, but Huang Yueli was very clear in her heart that her Master wouldn’t really harm them.","If his two disciples were to be trapped here forever, he would definitely not be able to smile.","It was rare for Saint Iniquitous Shadow to not act arrogantly. He nodded generously.” Yes, that’s right. If you want to leave, there must be a way. Besides, I guess you’ve already guessed it, right? “It’s because you’re not strong enough that you’re trapped. As long as you can cultivate to the point where you can tear open space and open a passageway, you’ll naturally be able to leave.”","This point, Huang Yueli and Li Moying naturally thought of it at the first instance.","But...","“Master, you...are you serious? If we want to tear space, we have to at least reach the Profound Life realm. Do...Do we have to advance to the Profound Life Realm before we can leave this place? How much time will this take!”","Huang Yueli’s face turned green.","Even though she was very confident in her husband’s and her own talent, this was not an ordinary goal, but...He had to reach the Profound Life Realm!","In the history of the God Realm, almost all the Profound Life Realm experts were Divine grade geniuses. Even so, those who could reach the Profound Life Realm in their lifetime could be counted on one hand.","Even a peerless genius like Saint Iniquitous Shadow had spent more than eighty years to reach the Profound Life Realm.","If this was the standard, wouldn’t it mean that...They would be trapped here for at least 50 to 60 years!","By the time they got out, her Senior Brother might have already reincarnated and cultivated to the tenth stage realm before ascending again...","Huang Yueli’s lips twitched,” Master, don’t scare me. I don’t believe that there’s no other way to leave. By the way, aren’t you and Master’s wife Life Profound Realm experts? As long as you guys take action and tear open the space to build a passage, we can still get out, right?”","“Your dream is quite beautiful!” Saint Iniquitous Shadow crossed his arms and raised his chin. Only the master of the small universe can open up the passage to the small universe. Your master’s wife and I don’t even have bodies. We’re just spirit bodies that are placed in the small universe. No matter how strong we are, we can’t damage the small universe at all!”"]},{"number":4824,"title":"Chapter 4824: The only way was to rely on themselves","paragraphs":["Chapter 4824: The only way was to rely on themselves","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","If it was just Saint Iniquitous Shadow who said so, it was impossible for her to send her master to scare them.","However, even Yin Niang did not deny it, so it could only be true.","If she and Li Moying wanted to get out, the only way was to rely on themselves.","Huang Yueli had already started to calculate in her mind how much time they would need to breakthrough to the Life Profound Realm.","However, the conclusion was still uncertain.","If one could even calculate the time needed to advance, there would be no unlucky cultivators in the world who were stuck at the bottleneck of advancement.","Li Moying’s expression was as black as the bottom of a pot.","Even if there wasn’t Liu Buyan waiting for them to save him outside, and there wasn’t the enmity between the two great god clans that had accumulated for hundreds of thousands of years waiting for the two of them to settle, he couldn’t accept being trapped here for decades.","Moreover, he was trapped because he was not strong enough!","For a peerless genius like him, what made him even more depressed than being trapped was admitting that his strength was insufficient.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow himself was a peerless genius who had grown up by trampling on his peers. He was also a man so how could he not guess Li Moying’s thoughts?","After he finished speaking, he crossed his arms and leaned back on the chair, his face filled with pride as he looked at Li Moying from the corner of his eyes.","“That’s why, my good disciple, don’t think about it anymore. It’s better for you to accept reality as soon as possible and cultivate well with me. “Anyway, your talent with the brat is not bad. There are all kinds of energy in this small universe. Not only can you cultivate evil techniques, but your martial arts won’t fall behind. Under the mutual promotion of the two cultivation techniques, my cultivation speed will definitely be faster than in the God Realm. If things go well, I might be able to breakthrough before long.”","Huang Yueli frowned slightly as she turned her head to look at Saint Iniquitous Shadow, not believing that he would actually console them.","However, Yin Niang clearly did not realize how serious a blow she had given her disciples. She continued to glare at her husband.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow immediately cowered. He had just straightened his back and looked arrogant, but now he only cared about covering his ears and begging for mercy."]},{"number":4825,"title":"Chapter 4825: But...","paragraphs":["Chapter 4825: But...","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Ahhh, Ahhh! Dear wife, be gentler, be gentler! In front of my disciple, leave me some face...”","“Then hurry up and tell the truth!” Yin Niang snorted coldly.","“Alright, alright, alright. I’ll talk. I’ll talk, alright?” Saint Iniquitous Shadow hurriedly said. I don’t have any intention of hiding it from them. It’s just that I didn’t have the time to say it...”","“Do you think I don’t know what you’re thinking?” Only then did Yin Niang slowly release her hand.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s ears turned red, but he did not dare to be angry with his wife. He could only pretend that nothing had happened and cough a few times. I didn’t lie to you just now. What I said was the truth. If you want to leave, you can only rely on yourself...”","Yin Niang’s gaze swept over his face. Saint Iniquitous Shadow did not dare to delay any longer and quickly said,”But...” However! The difficulty of leaving isn’t as high as you think. You don’t have to reach the Profound Life Realm to leave. Therefore, if we’re lucky, we might be able to leave soon.”","Huang Yueli was stunned when she heard that as her face was filled with puzzlement,” I don’t need to reach Life Profound Realm? However, from what I read in the ancient records, all the experts who have opened up their small universes are at least at the middle stage of the Profound Life Realm...”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow explained,”That’s because they have to rely on their own strength to forcefully open up a space from the God Realm. However, your situation is different. You only need to open up a passageway and not open up another space. The difficulty is reduced by more than 90%. In addition, the energy concentration in this small universe is much higher than the God Realm. If you circulate your cultivation techniques in this small universe, your power will also increase by several times.”","Huang Yueli finally understood as her face instantly revealed a joyous expression,” So that’s the case. From the looks of it, not only do we not need to reach Life Profound Realm, we might only need to reach Middle Dao Profound Realm cultivation to be able to leave? However...”","She thought about it carefully and suddenly calmed down again.” However, wanting to raise a minor realm in the Dao Profound Realm, the difficulty isn’t small either. Without three to five years, I might not be able to succeed either...”","Three to five years sounded much shorter than thirty to fifty years.","But to her and Li Moying, it was still a little too long."]},{"number":4826,"title":"Chapter 4826: It’s... You!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4826: It’s... You!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Saint Iniquitous Shadow choked again, and then he coughed violently, almost coughing himself to death.","After a long while, she barely managed to control herself as she turned around and glared at Huang Yueli,” You...You, you, you... Your master said so many things, and you only heard this one sentence?”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes,” But in Master’s earlier words, only this sentence is useful?”","The rest were all verbal attacks on her husband. If it were anyone else, she would have rushed over and beaten him up, but her master said...Ahem, then she could only pretend that she didn’t hear it.","After all, he couldn’t beat her...","“You... You...” Saint Iniquitous Shadow clasped his hands in front of his heart. At this moment, he was beginning to rejoice that he was a spirit body. Otherwise, he would have been angered to death by these two little ghosts.","It seemed that when he and his wife were unable to get pregnant, it was not that the heavens were playing tricks on them, but that they were empathetic.","I really shouldn’t have complained back then.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t seem to have noticed his ashen face as she continued to ask excitedly: ” Master, you haven’t said anything yet. Is my husband the most talented genius in the entire history of the God Realm?”","“No, of course not!” Saint Iniquitous Shadow snapped back to his senses.","“But, didn’t you just say...” Huang Yueli frowned in confusion.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow snorted coldly. Ahhh!”","Before he could finish, Yin Niang patted him again.” What nonsense! Can’t you talk to the children properly?”","“Forget it. I knew I shouldn’t count on you. Let me say it.” Yin Niang gave him a look of disdain and directly pushed him to the side, turning her head to look at Huang Yueli,” Li ‘er ah, actually your Master didn’t lie to you. The most talented genius in the God Realm is indeed not Mo’ er, but...You!”","“Ah?” Huang Yueli was instantly stunned,” Me?”","“That’s right.” Yin Niang smiled.” Your husband can only be ranked behind you. At most, he can be considered second.” To be honest, I’m not sure if your martial arts talent can be ranked first or second, but your physiques are special. Not only can you cultivate evil techniques, but you can also sense Devil Qi. Such a physique combined with your talent is indeed something that your master and I have never heard of.”","“Devil Qi?” Huang Yueli was even more confused,” But we haven’t cultivated the devil race’s cultivation method before? When you enter the Devil territory, you will also feel uncomfortable...”","Yin Niang pointed outside the window. Under the pitch-black night sky, many light figures were constantly moving. The brightest one was formed by green Devil Qi.","“You couldn’t in the past, but after you used the Empyrean Devil Crystal to construct this small universe, you can absorb and release devilish Qi through it. Your physique should have changed a little. Didn’t you notice? The concentration of Devil Qi in the small universe is the strongest. As a god race, you’ve stayed here for so long, but you don’t feel uncomfortable at all. This is abnormal in itself.”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment and after thinking about it, she realised that something was amiss.","The density of the Devil Qi in this small universe was almost comparable to the underground cave where they were trapped last time.","At that time, the two of them were inside and even breathing felt uncomfortable. They relied on the support of the evil qi in their bodies to walk to the end.","But now...","She had been in here for so long, but she did not even realize that there was so much Devil Qi around them."]},{"number":4827,"title":"Chapter 4827: No Backlash","paragraphs":["Chapter 4827: No Backlash","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli frowned slightly as she asked in puzzlement: ” In that case, my husband and I can now cultivate the devil race’s cultivation method without incurring any backlash?”","In fact, it was not that the Ancient God Clans themselves could not cultivate the Devil Race’s cultivation methods. It was just that the Devil Qi and Heaven and Profound Qi were mutually exclusive. In history, there were records of cultivators who forcefully cultivated the Devil Race’s cultivation methods. Without exception, they all suffered serious backlash. If it was light, their cultivation would regress, and if it was serious, they would die on the spot.","For example, during the martial arts competition in the God Realm, in order to silence her, Huang Sanbai had tricked the Sacred Phoenix Race’s young genius, Huang Beicheng, into cultivating a devil race cultivation technique that could forcefully raise his cultivation.","In the end, not only did Huang Beicheng suffer heavy injuries, but his natural talent directly fell from top Heaven Rank to Earth Rank. Originally, he could definitely reach late-stage Dao Profound Realm’s top genius. This way, he probably had no fate to step into Dao Profound Realm’s threshold in this lifetime.","If she and Li Moying didn’t suffer any backlash when they cultivated the devil race’s cultivation method after the transformation of the small universe...","Huang Yueli’s eyes instantly lit up.","However, Yin Niang poured a bucket of cold water on her.” After all, you’re from the God Clan. Now that you’ve cultivated the evil arts, even if there won’t be any backlash, I don’t recommend you to come into contact with the Devil Clan’s arts. It might not be a good thing for you to mix so many kinds of arts at the same time. Even if you don’t go berserk, it’ll be a huge trouble for you if you can’t control it and expose it to others.”","If the deviant cultivation method was exposed, although it would inevitably lead to trouble, but with Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s identities, they could still think of ways to clear their names.","However, once the Devil cultivation technique was leaked...","Even the bloodline of the two gods would probably be questioned. If they were not careful, they would become the public enemy of the God Realm. It was really not worth it.","Huang Yueli immediately understood,” That’s indeed the case. Master’s wife is really thoughtful.”","Yin Niang smiled.” Actually, as long as you can open up the passageway to the small universe, you can use the Devil Qi in the small universe. You don’t need to master the Devil race’s cultivation method, let alone waste time on it.”","Huang Yueli nodded her head repeatedly,” That’s right, the most important thing now is to open the passageway quickly. However, this will take several years...”","She couldn’t bring herself to smile at the thought of having to cultivate here for the next four to five years.","Yin Niang burst out laughing.” You guys were still deceived by your master. Although this spatial passageway indeed required at least middle-stage Dao Profound Realm strength, you guys were different from the other small universe masters. There are two of you! With the two of them working together and combining the two, the cultivation required can be further reduced.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli came to a sudden realization as she couldn’t help but turn to look at Li Moying.","Her husband was pleasantly surprised.","She couldn’t bring herself to smile at the thought of having to cultivate here for the next four to five years."]},{"number":4828,"title":"Chapter 4828: 4826","paragraphs":["Chapter 4828: 4826","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Saint Iniquitous Shadow had never thought that he was the one who targeted Li Moying first, picking on his little disciple’s husband.","The two of them knew that it was useless to curry favor with him, so they had no choice but to give up.","Yin Niang found it funny. She personally poured a cup of tea for Saint Iniquitous Shadow and barely managed to appease her husband.","After that, she turned towards Huang Yueli and the rest,” Of course there are secret techniques but you don’t need to be anxious. It’s already getting late so why don’t you rest here and start cultivating tomorrow. This is the first time your Master and I are taking in disciples so we need to discuss and see how we should teach you.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli subconsciously looked out the window.","The environment in the small universe was completely different from the God Realm. She thought that there would not be any changes in the day and night.","Unexpectedly, the sky outside the window had really darkened. The circulating energy beams in the air gradually turned into scattered spots of light.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying had just encountered a huge change and after suddenly entering the small universe, they didn’t have the time to adapt to it. When they heard Yin Niang mention it, they felt sleepy all over.","The two of them quickly nodded in agreement.","Yin Niang gave them an empty room in the thatched hut and arranged for them to stay.","Initially, ever since Huang Yueli woke up, Li Moying had the intention to get close to his wife. Earlier in the empty space in the small universe, they almost kissed but was interrupted by Saint Iniquitous Shadow and Yin Niang.","But now, the two of them were living in Master and Mistress ‘cave, which was only a wall away from Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s room. Naturally, they couldn’t do anything bad.","Li Moying was extremely depressed as he grabbed Huang Yueli and kissed her a few times before he reluctantly fell asleep.","Huang Yueli had been thinking about the matters of the God Realm and initially thought that she would suffer from insomnia. But she had not expected that she would sleep exceptionally well tonight, falling asleep the moment she touched the pillow.","Furthermore, when she woke up the next day, she could clearly feel that the Profound Energy and Evil Qi in her body had increased a little."]},{"number":4829,"title":"Chapter 4829: Soul Splitting Technique","paragraphs":["Chapter 4829: Soul Splitting Technique","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying wasn’t in a hurry initially as he sat beside his dear wife with a relaxed and indifferent expression, waiting for Huang Yueli to finish reading first.","But when he heard these few words, his expression suddenly changed as he immediately went to Huang Yueli’s side, looking at the book in her hands together with her.","At the top of the first page of the book were the words “Soul Splitting Technique”.","He stretched out his hand and quickly flipped through the contents of the last two to three pages. He realized that they were exactly the same as the ancient pages he had obtained in the lower realm many years ago.","“This is indeed the Soul Splitting Technique, but... Master’s wife, why did you...” Li Moying looked at her with his face filled with query.","He had thought of thousands of ways the couple had taught their disciples, but he never expected to see such a secret manual.","Yin Niang nodded.” That’s right. This is the Soul Splitting Technique, or rather...It’s the complete scroll of the Soul Splitting Technique.”","Seeing that her two disciples were puzzled, she continued to explain,”What you obtained in the lower realm should only be the first few pages of the Soul Splitting Technique, right?” In fact, those pages only recorded a part of the Soul Splitting Technique, and it’s not complete. If you use this secret technique according to those pages, it will leave behind a huge hidden danger. You have to cultivate it completely.”","Hearing this, the two of them were stunned.","Huang Yueli frowned as she asked in a puzzled voice: ” But, Master’s wife, after my husband and I completed the Soul Splitting Technique, our cultivation base wasn’t affected much. Even after our respective primordial spirits returned to their original positions, our cultivation speed has increased by quite a bit. We didn’t feel any hidden dangers?”","Yin Niang shook her head and sighed softly.” You’re still young. Of course, you won’t feel any hidden dangers. In fact, the Soul Splitting Technique was a technique that defied the heavens after all. It was a huge request to fight against the Heavenly Dao. How could it be without a price? You and I are masters. We originally thought that after our primordial spirits returned, we would be no different from an ordinary couple in the God Realm. However, in fact, as time passed, the hidden dangers still appeared bit by bit.”","Huang Yueli knew that Yin Niang wouldn’t lie and her heart thumped as she became nervous.","To her and Li Moying, this was a huge piece of bad news.","“What exactly happened?” she asked hurriedly."]},{"number":4830,"title":"Chapter 4830: Unconcealed Panic","paragraphs":["Chapter 4830: Unconcealed Panic","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Yin Niang suddenly turned towards Huang Yueli as she spoke.","“Actually, the effect of the Soul Splitting Technique on Mo’er is still considered small. The effect on you will be even greater. After entering the Profound Life stage, you will immediately feel that your origin soul is out of your control and your body will become weaker and weaker...”","As she spoke, she suddenly changed the topic.” Do you know why I am so weak? I can’t even maintain my spirit body and fell into a deep sleep early?”","Huang Yueli was slightly startled.","The first time she saw Yin Niang, she had felt that it was abnormal for her to be so weak as a Profound Life Realm expert. She had even thought that Yin Niang was only weak on the surface.","It was only when Saint Iniquitous Shadow mentioned that Yin Niang had always been weak and her spirit body had always been in a deep sleep that she realized that Yin Niang’s weakness was not just what it looked like. It was a fact.","At that time, she was extremely puzzled. Now, after hearing Yin Niang’s question, she immediately reacted.","“Master’s wife, is it because of the influence of the Soul Splitting Technique that caused your body to become weak?”","Huang Yueli was still considered calm but when Li Moying heard this, his heart instantly tightened.","Facing the pressure of an expert like Saint Iniquitous Shadow, Li Moying could maintain his cold and indifferent expression but at this moment, his calmness had completely vanished as his face was filled with unconcealed panic.","He immediately took a step forward and asked anxiously,”Master’s wife, what’s going on?” Why was it that the one who received the primordial spirit was more affected than the one who had his soul split? You and your master are both Profound Life Realm experts, sitting at the top. Could it be...Is there no way to resolve it?”","Yin Niang saw that he was anxious and quickly comforted him.” Mo’er, calm down. When did I say that it can’t be resolved? The solution is in this book.”","Hearing that, Huang Yueli and Li Moying looked at the blue booklet in their hands in puzzlement.","Yin Niang explained,” Li ‘er, the book in your hand is the complete version of the Soul Splitting Technique. After my spirit body fell into a deep slumber, your master spent hundreds of thousands of years to think about it. It was only a few years ago that he was able to complete it. After you’ve successfully split your souls, you’ll need to continue cultivating the second half of the book to stabilize your souls. This way, you’ll be able to greatly reduce the risk of your souls collapsing after you enter the Profound Life realm.”","Facing the pressure of an expert like Saint Iniquitous Shadow, Li Moying could maintain his cold and indifferent expression but at this moment, his calmness had completely vanished as his face was filled with unconcealed panic."]},{"number":4831,"title":"Chapter 4831: Let nature take its course","paragraphs":["Chapter 4831: Let nature take its course","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Huang Yueli heard that, she was stunned for a moment and didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow really didn’t forget to mock her husband!","He had already handed over the entire scroll of the Soul Splitting Technique to them, yet he still despised her husband and insisted on not teaching him. Didn’t he realize that he was slapping himself?","But even though she said that, Huang Yueli’s heart was still filled with gratitude.","She remembered that when she was about to leave the cave, Saint Iniquitous Shadow was indeed dissatisfied with her getting married so early. She thought that it was probably true that he wanted to see her husband first before passing on the secret manual.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow really treated her as his daughter, just like what Yin Niang had said.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli’s smile disappeared as her expression turned solemn. She turned around and bowed towards Saint Iniquitous Shadow,” Thank you for imparting this to me. Disciple will definitely cultivate diligently and strive to master this cultivation method as soon as possible.”","“Alright, just practice hard. If you have any questions, you can ask any of us.”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow saw that his little disciple had suddenly become so obedient and he was too embarrassed to continue pushing Li Moying as he nodded his head and brought Yin Niang back.","Leaving Huang Yueli and Li Moying in the room to cultivate their own cultivation method.","However, Yin Niang, who was being pulled back by him, had a puzzled expression on her face.","“Brother Hong, you...Why did you bring me away? I didn’t even finish speaking just now! Why didn’t you tell them that even if they mastered the complete Soul Splitting Technique, they still wouldn’t be able to completely eliminate the risk of their primordial spirit collapsing? The problem would still exist after reaching the middle stage of the Profound Life Realm. If you want to avoid future troubles forever, unless...”","“It’s useless to tell them now!” Saint Iniquitous Shadow coughed lightly and put on a rare serious expression.” Think about it. What’s the use of telling them what we’ve tried for tens of thousands of years but failed to do? It’s better to let nature take its course. Perhaps the probability of success is higher.”","Yin Niang frowned slightly.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s words sounded reasonable at first, but when he thought about it carefully, he felt that something was wrong.","Before she could figure it out, Saint Iniquitous Shadow had already pulled her back into the room.” Alright, don’t think too much. As elders, we can’t give young people too much pressure...”","He wouldn’t tell Yin Niang that he just didn’t like this brat Li Moying.","If he knew the truth, wouldn’t that brat pester his little disciple every day? How could that be?","In the room, Huang Yueli and Li Moying who knew nothing about Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s thoughts, had already started to cultivate.","The Soul Splitting Technique itself had extremely high requirements for the strength and willpower of the caster’s primordial spirit. After all, the pain and risk of triggering the heavenly lightning to tear apart the primordial spirit was unimaginable. Even if one could endure the pain of the heavenly lightning, as long as their cultivation was not enough, their soul would be scattered on the spot. Not only would they not be able to save the person they loved, but they would also lose themselves."]},{"number":4832,"title":"Chapter 4832: Holding a grudge","paragraphs":["Chapter 4832: Holding a grudge","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Of course, when tempering the primordial spirit, it didn’t need to be like when Li Moying split his soul in the past, splitting his primordial spirit into two halves. He only needed to tear a small crack in his primordial spirit and then through the cultivation method, he would fuse it back together. Repeating it many times, causing the primordial spirit to gradually become tougher.","However, even if that was the case, he would still have to experience great pain during the cultivation process.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying sat side by side as they read through the blue booklet together.","Although he was a little surprised when he first saw it, he didn’t find it particularly difficult after reading it.","Both of them understood that advancing through cultivation and tempering themselves was a heaven-defying thing in itself. Therefore, there were no shortcuts to cultivation itself. Paying a small price in exchange for an increase in strength was still very worth it.","Huang Yueli closed the book and couldn’t help but sigh: ” Master is indeed worthy of being the most outstanding human peerless expert recorded in history. To be able to create such a cultivation method. If it were to spread to the God Realm, I wonder how big of a commotion it would cause.”","Not only did the primordial spirit affect a cultivator’s cultivation, but it also affected a cultivator’s lifespan. Moreover, after being injured, there was almost no way to make up for it. No matter what kind of natural treasures or top-grade pills were used to nurture the primordial spirit, the effect was just like putting out a burning cart of fire with a cup of water.","In history, countless experts had explored ways to strengthen and treat the primordial spirit. Unfortunately, there were no effective cultivation techniques that were passed down to future generations.","So many experts had failed on this question, but Saint Iniquitous Shadow had created such a complete version of the Soul Splitting Technique.","It had to be said that her master was indeed too powerful. She was also very wise and decisive.","Li Moying nodded his head but when he opened his mouth, he changed the topic,” Just based on the cultivation technique itself, it’s indeed powerful but unfortunately, there are too few people who can use it. If one doesn’t have divine grade talent, they won’t be able to cultivate at all. It’s impossible to spread it, right?”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment before she couldn’t help but burst out laughing,” Husband, you’re really vengeful. Master ridiculed you and now you insist on retaliating.”","Even such a powerful cultivation technique had its flaws found by him.","Li Moying’s eyes flashed as his tone was indifferent,” I’m just speaking the truth, what’s there to talk about holding grudges or not. Li ‘er, you’re thinking too much.”","Without waiting for Huang Yueli to speak again, he changed the topic,” Alright, there’s no time to lose. Since the cultivation method is already in our hands, let’s start cultivating immediately. The sooner I master these cultivation techniques, the sooner I can leave this place. If I drag this on for too long, I’m afraid something might happen to Brother Liu.”","Huang Yueli thought of Liu Buyan’s situation and her expression turned cold as she hurriedly restrained her impetuous thoughts and sat cross-legged on the soft cushion, starting to cultivate according to the contents recorded in the small booklet.","Li Moying saw that Huang Yueli had quickly entered a state of stillness and the corners of his lips curled up as he slowly closed his eyes and started to regulate his breathing.","He wasn’t too worried about Liu Buyan. Liu Buyan this brat didn’t seem to be extremely talented but he had always been very scheming. In other words, he was very sly and it was more than enough to deal with a few Black Tortoise Clan members. He didn’t believe that Liu Buyan would die in Snowflake City if they went back a few days later.","But even so, Li Moying still wanted to leave the small universe as soon as possible.","After having Master and Mistress, not to mention loving his own wife, Li ‘er did not even allow him to kiss her.","These days...There was simply no way to pass!"]},{"number":4833,"title":"Chapter 4833: Absolutely Can’t Fail!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4833: Absolutely Can’t Fail!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli naturally didn’t know what kind of trash her husband was thinking about so she had no time to think about it.","After closing her eyes, she quickly immersed herself in cultivation. All the disturbances in the outside world seemed to have left her.","Huang Yueli silently recited the cultivation method a few times in her heart as she started to circulate the evil qi in her body.","Back then when they entered Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave dwelling for the second time, she and Li Moying had both inhaled a large amount of evil qi. At that time, under Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s guidance, she had used the ” Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual ” to refine a portion of it. But due to the limitations of her ability and time, there was still over eighty percent of the evil qi that she was unable to refine directly and could only store it in her dantian.","Later, after returning to the God Realm, although she also wanted to find time to practice the Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual, due to the many eyes and ears around her, and the fact that the two of them were evil cultivators could not be exposed, there were not many opportunities to cultivate.","It was only when they were in the Devil territory that he used evil qi a few times in order to cover their identity.","Until now, she still had about 70% of the evil qi that she could not refine.","This meant that she could only use about 30% of the evil qi.","This bit of Evil Qi was more than enough to impersonate an Earth Devil Realm warrior. However, it was a bit shabby to cut his own primordial spirit according to the requirements of the blue booklet.","Huang Yueli originally thought that she would have to spend a lot of effort before she could tear her primordial spirit out.","However, what she did not expect was that in this small universe, the concentration of all kinds of energy in the surroundings was several times higher than that of the God Realm. The evil qi was no exception.","With the help of the endless supply of energy from the small universe, the evil qi she could mobilize was much more than she had expected.","She held her breath and concentrated. She circulated the evil qi in her body for a few cycles. Then, she gritted her teeth and attacked her primordial spirit!","Boom!","A loud sound akin to a mountain collapsing suddenly exploded in Huang Yueli’s mind.","An indescribable pain assaulted her instantly, causing Huang Yueli to almost fall to the ground.","Although she relied on her strong willpower to forcefully endure it, her body swayed a few times before she sat down again.","However, the tearing pain in her mind did not lessen. Instead, it came again and again.","Originally, she had been in danger many times during her training. She had suffered all kinds of injuries and was not that sensitive to pain.","However, injuries to the primordial spirit were completely different from injuries to the flesh and bones.","The pain came from the depths of her mind. Every time she used the evil qi to attack her primordial spirit, it was like a knife cutting through the depths of her mind. The pain could instantly reach every part of her body.","At the same time, this kind of wound would not only cause severe pain, but it would also affect her thinking.","Following the circulation of the cultivation method, Huang Yueli’s eyes were seeing stars as her mind was in a mess, almost forgetting where she was and what she was doing.","However, just as she almost fell to the ground, she suddenly sensed a familiar aura beside her.","That was Li Moying’s aura!","Her husband was sitting in the same room as her, cultivating the same cultivation technique.","She had chosen to cultivate the Soul Splitting Technique in order to repair her primordial spirit and to be able to be with her husband for a long time.","So... She could not fail!","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli’s spirit jolted and she instantly woke up."]},{"number":4834,"title":"Chapter 4834: Barely Able to Do It","paragraphs":["Chapter 4834: Barely Able to Do It","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The evil qi in Huang Yueli’s meridians had already accumulated to the limit after a few rounds of circulation.","An abundant amount of energy was accumulated in her dantian, constantly churning and rolling, as if it would explode at any moment.","Huang Yueli steadied her mind and gritted her teeth as she suddenly urged this energy to bombard towards her own primordial spirit!","The strength of this impact was even stronger than the previous ones combined. Even though her primordial spirit was several times stronger than ordinary cultivators, it was still torn open.","One could imagine how painful such a wound was.","However, since Huang Yueli had already made up her mind, naturally no circumstances could shake her determination to move forward. Without any hesitation, she let go of her control and let the remaining evil qi surge into her primordial spirit.","With the influx of evil qi, the torn primordial spirit began to recover quickly.","However, the process of repair was not easy. In fact, it was even more unbearable than the process of tearing.","Although it wasn’t as painful as when his primordial spirit was torn apart, when he was repairing it, a strong itch seemed to come from the depths of his soul and suddenly rushed up.","For a moment, Huang Yueli almost couldn’t help but fall onto the ground, wanting to roll back and forth to eliminate this itchy feeling.","However, she quickly controlled herself.","She knew that this strong discomfort came from her primordial spirit and not from her body. Therefore, even if she threw away her pride and rolled on the ground, it would not be alleviated.","The only way was to rely on his own willpower to force his way through.","Huang Yueli protected her soul and used all her strength to maintain a clear mind as she tried her best to ignore all sorts of uncomfortable feelings as she circulated the Soul Splitting Technique over and over again.","As time passed, she seemed to feel that her primordial spirit began to change slightly...","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were cultivating in their own room.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow and Yin Niang acted as if cultivating the Soul Splitting Technique was a simple matter, but in fact, they were not as relaxed as they appeared.","Especially Yin Niang.","It was her first time teaching disciples and although she was very optimistic about Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s innate talent, but she was still worried.","After staying in her room for an hour, she couldn’t sit still anymore. She dragged Saint Iniquitous Shadow to the courtyard and craned her neck to look into the room through the window to observe the cultivation of her two little disciples.","“Dear wife, what are you worried about? The two of them had god-grade talent and had also used the Soul Splitting Technique in the past. Now, they were just repeating the process from back then. Could it be that they could not complete it? Besides, Master can only lead the way of cultivation. Cultivation depends on one person. If they really can’t do it, there’s nothing we can do.”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was dragged by Yin Niang into the courtyard. He looked impatient and kept persuading Yin Niang to go back.","Yin Niang had been sleeping in the cave dwelling for tens of thousands of years. He had waited with great difficulty for his wife to wake up.","He was originally overjoyed, but he did not expect that before he could kiss her, he would discover that his two little disciples were also in the small universe.","He couldn’t chase her out, so he could only reluctantly teach her.","However, he did not expect that his wife would suddenly fall in love with the new entertainment of teaching disciples. She even paid more attention to her disciples than her husband."]},{"number":4835,"title":"Chapter 4835: Three to Five Days?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4835: Three to Five Days?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Now, he finally managed to use a Soul Splitting Technique to send his two disciples to the side and let them cultivate on their own.","He thought that he would be able to spend some time alone with his wife.","However, he never expected that his wife would actually want to watch his two little disciples cultivate!","So be it if he cultivated. He was already so old, and they were all divine grade geniuses with excellent comprehension abilities. How could he not know how to cultivate? And his master had to watch over him all the time?","Even for ordinary sects, there was no such logic.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow complained, but all he got was a dissatisfied glance from his wife.","“How can you be a master like this? His disciple had just entered the sect and was cultivating for the first time. No matter what, he should at least be concerned about their cultivation, right? Moreover, the Soul Splitting Technique is not an ordinary cultivation technique. It is extremely dangerous to cultivate it. If you are not careful, you will leave an incurable injury in your primordial spirit...”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow pursed his lips.” No matter how serious the injury is, can it compare to the time when their souls were split? They’ve already survived such a serious injury. What else can you do now?”","Yin Niang choked. She obviously did not expect her husband, who was usually obedient to her, to retort back.","She reached out and pinched Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s arm.” Shut up! Even if they are talented and won’t go wrong, tearing apart their primordial spirit is a very painful thing. If they can’t withstand it, how can we, as masters, sit idly by?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow really wanted to say that if he couldn’t even endure the pain of cultivation, he wouldn’t be able to reach the peak of martial arts and become a peerless expert.","However, before he could say anything, Yin Niang had already glared at him fiercely.","It seemed like if he dared to say another word, he would be chased out of the bedroom tonight.","Helplessly, he could only swallow the words that were about to come out of his mouth and change his words.” Ahem, ahem. My wife, you’re really thoughtful. We really should go and take a look. We’ll listen to you...”","Only then did Yin Niang’s anger turn into joy. She revealed a smile and took the initiative to hold his arm.” Hurry up and leave. How many years has it been since I’ve seen this little fellow cultivate? Moreover, he’s a little fellow with divine talent...”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow followed behind her helplessly. Hearing her rambling, he was speechless.","Hearing his wife’s tone, she really treated teaching disciples as a hobby...He felt that his future was bleak.","He had to think of a way to quickly send the two of them out.","Yin Niang pulled Saint Iniquitous Shadow and came to Huang Yueli’s room under the window.","The window was closed.","Yin Niang slowly walked to the window and gently pushed it open by a small crack.","The two of them had strong five senses. With this small gap, they could see the situation inside clearly.","Furthermore, Huang Yueli and Li Moying were currently focused on cultivation so it was impossible for them to specially set up an array to guard against Master and Mistress so it could be said that there was no obstruction at all.","Yin Niang’s face was filled with curiosity, and she almost pressed her ear against the window.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was speechless. He shook his head.” Why are you so anxious?” The Soul Splitting Technique was not so easy to cultivate. If they wanted to find a feeling, they would have to try it hundreds of times. Even with their talent, they would still need to spend three to five days. It would take at least ten days for them to successfully split their souls. Even if you stare at them now, you won’t be able to see anything!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he met Yin Niang’s surprised face.” What do you mean by three to five days?”"]},{"number":4836,"title":"Chapter 4836: True or False","paragraphs":["Chapter 4836: True or False","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was stunned. He thought that Yin Niang was distracted and didn’t hear him clearly, so he patiently repeated himself.","“Your husband just said that it would take at least three to five days to master the method of mobilizing the evil Qi in their bodies to attack the origin soul. It would take even longer to successfully tear the origin soul, and this is considering their extraordinary talent. So, we can wait a few days before...”","” However, Li ‘er and Mo’ er have already successfully torn apart their primordial spirits. They are already following the contents of the last few pages of the secret manual and have begun to use the evil qi to repair their primordial spirits.” Yin Niang blinked and said.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was stunned for a moment before he couldn’t help but laugh.","“dear wife, what are you talking about? Could it be that she didn’t sleep well last night and was still asleep? I personally created this Soul Splitting Technique, so no one knows better than me how difficult it is to cultivate it. I said three to five days, but it’s still too little. If they don’t put in enough effort, it’s normal for them to spend more than ten days. You must have seen wrongly.”","Hearing this, Yin Niang puffed up her cheeks and pinched Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s arm.” What do you mean? It’s fine if you don’t believe me, but you even mocked me for daydreaming and talking nonsense?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow gasped in pain. However, he didn’t dare to get angry in front of his wife. He could only lower his head.","“dear wife, please calm down. I have no such intentions. Don’t misunderstand! How dare I mock my wife? I just... Uh, I’m just going to explain the principle of the Soul Splitting Technique to you. After all, I only created this technique after you fell asleep. You haven’t cultivated it before, so it’s normal that you don’t know the details.","dear wife is absolutely right. It’s all my fault. I didn’t explain it to dear wife earlier...”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow smiled and coaxed his wife.","If an outsider were to see this, who would believe that this wife slave who had been controlled by his wife was one of the most famous peerless experts in the history of the God Realm?","However, despite his coaxing, Yin Niang’s expression still did not look too good.","“Cut the crap. You just think I’m lying to you. Then come and take a look for yourself. You’ll know if I’m telling the truth!”","As Yin Niang spoke, she took two steps to the side, leaving the seat closest to the window gap open.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was originally full of confidence, thinking that he was the person who understood this technique the most in the world and that his judgment would not be wrong.","However, when he heard Yin Niang say this, he became a little suspicious.","Could it be that what his wife said was true? Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s advancement was so shocking that in just a few hours, they had already mastered the Soul Splitting Technique?!","But how was this possible?","So what if the two of them were god-grade geniuses? He himself was also god-grade!","He asked himself, if he wanted to enter the sect, he would need at least five or six days. Even if his little disciples spent less time than him, they would definitely not be dozens of times faster!","Under Yin Niang’s gaze, Saint Iniquitous Shadow was filled with doubt. He leaned closer to the window and looked inside with his eyes wide open.","In the next moment, an extremely dense evil qi assaulted his face!","The evil qi in the small universe seemed to have gathered in this room, forming a faint gray fog.","And within the fog, two figures were faintly discernible, they were Huang Yueli and Li Moying!"]},{"number":4837,"title":"Chapter 4837: Real Face Slapping!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4837: Real Face Slapping!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli and Li Moying faced each other as they sat cross-legged on two soft cushions.","Although their bodies were stable and motionless, their faces were filled with pain. The cold sweat on their foreheads slid down their cheeks, forming a small puddle on the ground beside them.","Seeing this, Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s eyebrows twitched.” What’s going on? It was just gathering evil qi. Even if it was very difficult, it shouldn’t be so painful, right? Could it be...”","He suddenly thought of something and was shocked. He quickly released his divine sense and carefully investigated.","As a Profound Life Realm expert, even though he was only a spirit body, his divine sense was much stronger than the two of them. If he wanted to investigate, he could find out everything in a few breaths.","Not long after, Saint Iniquitous Shadow suddenly sucked in a breath of cold air and took a step back. They were...He had successfully split his soul? How is this possible?”","“Husband, didn’t you say that even a Divine level genius would need three to five days to find the way?” Yin Niang laughed when she saw that he had finally reacted. However, it has only been four to five hours. Why did Li ‘er and Mo’ er not only enter the sect but also successfully split their souls and start to cultivate their primordial spirits?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow had yet to recover from his shock. Even though he heard his wife’s teasing, he didn’t care about the awkwardness. He just widened his eyes and kept muttering to himself. How is that possible?”","Thinking back to how he had just boasted to his wife that no one knew the Soul Splitting Technique better than him, Saint Iniquitous Shadow felt a burning sensation on his face.","What a slap in the face!","If he hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, he wouldn’t have believed it even if he was beaten to death.","Seeing this, Yin Niang shook her head.” How is that impossible? It’s just that our little disciple is talented. Didn’t you tell me before that the last time Li ‘er entered the cave, you taught her the Wicked Shadow Canon and her cultivation speed was also very shocking, far exceeding your expectations?”","“That’s right, that’s indeed the case. Li ‘er’s talent last time really surprised me. However, with the talent she displayed back then, it’s impossible for her to successfully split her soul within 10 hours. The three to five days I said earlier had already taken her talent into consideration.” Saint Iniquitous Shadow finally calmed down. He frowned and asked in confusion.","When Yin Niang heard this, she was a little surprised.” What? There was such a thing? Then today...What’s going on?”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow turned his head again and looked at the two figures in the room. His expression became even more solemn.","“In my opinion, there should only be two possibilities. First, when Li ‘er entered the cave dwelling, she hid her strength from me. However, she was only an Early Profound Heart Realm practitioner back then, so it’s impossible for me to not see through her. Then there’s only one possibility left...”","Yin Niang said in surprise,”Do you mean...” Their talents would continue to grow? However, this... Was that even possible? Isn’t divine grade talent the peak of a cultivator’s potential?”","” There should be differences in talent among the same Divine level,” Saint Iniquitous Shadow said.” However, there are very few Divine levels in the world. There’s no way to compare them.” Moreover, the two of them were still young. Before the age of thirty, cultivators could improve their talent through various fortuitous encounters. Isn’t it because of this that the various great god clans desperately feed medicinal pills to young geniuses with potential?”"]},{"number":4838,"title":"Chapter 4838: Coming Out of Seclusion","paragraphs":["Chapter 4838: Coming Out of Seclusion","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Yin Niang was slightly stunned. She suddenly remembered that her two little disciples were not even thirty years old yet!","Because of their shocking talent and strength, as well as their calm and generous bearing, people always unconsciously ignored their true bone age.","From the looks of it, she had underestimated her disciple...","“Husband, it seems that our luck is really not bad. We originally thought that we were at the end of our rope and could only wait for the spirit body to dissipate in the cave abode. It is unexpected that we actually received two talented disciples at the last moment...This is heaven’s will!”","Yin Niang’s eyes were filled with excitement.","Back then, she and Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s primordial spirits were unstable due to their souls being split apart, and they happened to encounter a powerful enemy seeking revenge. Due to a moment of carelessness, after their physical bodies were destroyed, they could only hide in the cave abode in the form of spirits.","As time passed, it gradually disappeared.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s spirit body was about to disappear, and the cave’s array formation was about to collapse. Unexpectedly, two peerless geniuses suddenly barged into the cave at this moment.","With Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s innate talent, their future achievements would be limitless. Who knows, they might even be able to reconstruct their corporeal bodies and bring them out of the small universe.","The world is unpredictable, and the twists and turns have led to this!","Saint Iniquitous Shadow had just been slapped in the face so it wasn’t appropriate for him to ridicule Li Moying anymore so he could only give a snort and didn’t say anything.","Yin Niang observed for a while outside the window. She was relieved and a smile appeared on her face.","“Both of them have already begun to cultivate their primordial spirits, and the process is very smooth. The recovery of their primordial spirits is very fast. At this rate, after one night, they will be able to complete the entire set of cultivation techniques for the first time. After that, as long as they continue to cycle, their progress will become faster and faster.”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow nodded his head slightly and could not help but sigh.” Li ‘er, this disciple is really the right one. Looks like I have to bring out some true skills to teach them properly in the future. Otherwise, wouldn’t I be looked down upon by my disciple?”","Hearing that Saint Iniquitous Shadow was still intentionally jumping away from Li Moying, Yin Niang couldn’t help but laugh.","She shook her head,” That’s enough, seeing how smoothly Li ‘er and Mo’ er’s cultivation is going, there shouldn’t be any need for us to worry. If we keep watching, it might even affect them. Go back to your room!”","After waiting for so long, Saint Iniquitous Shadow finally got his wife’s approval. He didn’t have to watch his two disciples cultivate in the cold wind anymore. He immediately nodded and said,” You’re right!” Let’s not disturb them. Let’s go back to our room!”","In the next few days, Huang Yueli and Li Moying didn’t take a single step out of the room, not even moving a single inch.","The two of them had been sitting in the room, concentrating on their cultivation.","Yin Niang would drag Saint Iniquitous Shadow to check on them every morning and night. Seeing that the two of them had advanced as fast as she had expected, she couldn’t help but be in a good mood. She secretly calculated the time when the two of them would come out of seclusion.","” You said that they would need three to five days to enter the sect. It would take them at least two months to master the Soul Splitting Technique. Based on their progress, they should be able to come out in seven days.”","Yin Niang had calculated for a while and specially prepared some fine wine in advance. She even personally cooked a few dishes to celebrate for her disciples.","On the morning of the eighth day, Yin Niang waited in the courtyard with Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","Sure enough, just as it was dawn, a slight movement came from the disciples ‘rooms."]},{"number":4839,"title":"Chapter 4839: Bet","paragraphs":["Chapter 4839: Bet","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Saint Iniquitous Shadow and Yin Niang’s eyes lit up at the same time. They turned around and looked at the door expectantly.","It seemed that someone had already completed his cultivation and could come out of seclusion.","” I wonder if the one who comes out first will be Li’er or that brat.” ” I hope it’s Li’er,” Saint Iniquitous Shadow muttered to himself.” I really don’t want to see that brat’s face.”","Hearing this, Yin Niang almost laughed out loud.","She coughed a few times before she stopped laughing. She said leisurely,” I’m afraid I’ll have to disappoint you. I feel that the first person to come out this time will definitely be Mo’er.”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow frowned immediately, his face filled with displeasure.” Wife, how can you stand on that brat’s side? Could it be that she was biased towards him because he was good-looking? Li’er’s talent is obviously higher, the first to come out will definitely be Li’ er!”","“Li’er’s talent is indeed slightly higher, but there’s a limit to it. In comparison, Mo’er had a huge advantage. He was the one who initiated the Soul Splitting Technique, while Li’ er’s primordial spirit had been passively split. Thus, Mo’er’s primordial spirit was much more stable and the difficulty of cultivating it was much lower. Just like you and me, your origin soul is relatively stable.”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow knew that his wife was right.","However, he was still unwilling to give up and stubbornly said,” Anyway, I believe that the first one to come out will definitely be Li’er! How can that brat compare to Li’er’s outstanding talent?”","Yin Niang glanced at him with a half-smile.” Since Husband is so sure, why don’t we make a bet?”","“What are you reading?” Saint Iniquitous Shadow snorted.","Yin Niang smiled.” It’s very simple. Whoever loses, if I win, I’ll have to personally teach two disciples for the next month, and you can’t interfere. If you win, you will decide on the plan to teach your disciple.”","Hearing this, Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s expression froze.","Although Yin Niang was talking about teaching disciples, he reacted immediately. This was a major matter that was closely related to his personal interests!","Yin Niang had always been very attentive to her two disciples. If she were to teach them, she would definitely guide them with all her heart and protect them day and night. Then, as her husband, he could only stand aside.","Not to mention being close to his wife, even holding hands in front of his disciple would damage his master’s dignity.","Why should the disciple cultivate while the master had to stay alone in the empty room?","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was actually already beating his chest. However, if he said no now, he would definitely be laughed at by his wife. He could only bite the bullet and say,” Alright, let’s bet. It’s settled then!”","After he finished speaking, he could not help but secretly clench his fists.","Li’er, you have to work hard for Master!","Master did not want to stay alone in an empty room at all!","After the two of them made the bet, they looked at the tightly shut door again.","The room was silent.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow and Yin Niang looked at each other and realized that something wasn’t right.","Logically speaking, since the cultivation technique had already reached the initial success stage, the person who came out of seclusion would definitely leave the room. After all, not only would staying in the room not help the other party, but it would also easily disturb the other party.","But they had already waited for so long but they didn’t see either Huang Yueli or Li Moying come out from the room.","Yin Niang frowned,” This isn’t right. Did something happen to Li’er and Mo’ er when they were cultivating?”"]},{"number":4840,"title":"Chapter 4840: Qi Deviation?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4840: Qi Deviation?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Saint Iniquitous Shadow and Yin Niang looked at each other, their hearts sinking.","The two of them walked quickly to the door at the same time.","Yin Niang knocked on the door,” Li’er, Mo’ er? Which one of you came out of seclusion? Why haven’t you come out yet?”","After the room was silent for a few breaths, a low and deep voice that carried some tiredness rang out,” Master, Master’s wife, come in and take a look, Li’er she... There seems to be something wrong with her.”","” What?!”","Hearing this, Yin Niang’s heart immediately tensed up and she didn’t bother to think about why Li Moying was the one who completed the cultivation method first as she immediately pushed open the door and rushed in.","As soon as he opened the door, a wave of heat, carrying a dense evil qi, surged out.","Yin Niang used her sleeve to wave away the smoke. When she looked carefully, she saw the figures of two disciples.","The last time they peeked through the window, both of them were sitting on the soft couch without moving. But now, Huang Yueli was still in her original position, but her whole body had fallen to the side, her eyes tightly shut and her face was flushed red.","Li Moying had left the soft couch and was kneeling on one knee in front of Huang Yueli. His usually calm and steady handsome face revealed a rare look of anxiety.","One could tell that Li Moying really wanted to stretch out his hand to touch Huang Yueli but he had some misgivings, afraid that it would affect her cultivation, so he was caught in a dilemma.","“Mo’er, what happened?” Yin Niang asked. What happened to Li’er?”","Li Moying said anxiously,” Master’s wife, you’re here, that’s great! I don’t know what’s going on either. Just now, I was still cultivating when I heard a noise coming from the room. The surrounding evil qi became chaotic. By the time I hurriedly stopped cultivating and opened my eyes to take a look, Li’er had already fallen here.”","“How could this be?” Yin Niang asked in surprise. This... Isn’t this unreasonable?”","Practicing a new god-grade cultivation technique, especially a special cultivation technique like the Soul Splitting Technique that involved the primordial spirit, was indeed very easy to go berserk.","However, the highest possibility of an accident during cultivation was when one had just started cultivating and could not find the way. If one was careless and did not fully understand the cultivation method, it was very easy to become obsessed.","The second highest possibility was that the cultivator had already familiarized himself with the cultivation technique in the middle and late stages of cultivation. However, due to the long-term state of tension, if his willpower was too weak and he was too tired, he would be distracted for a moment and become possessed. Not only would all his previous efforts be wasted, but it might even cause his cultivation to regress.","But these two kinds of mistakes didn’t seem like something Huang Yueli would commit.","Moreover, during the cultivation process of her two little disciples, Yin Niang would drag her husband to check on them from time to time to confirm that their cultivation was going very smoothly. During the two most error-prone periods, nothing went wrong.","Now there were only a few hours left before she completed her seclusion and seeing that she had succeeded, Huang Yueli suddenly fell headfirst...","No matter how one thought about it, it was unbelievable.","Yin Niang frowned.” Mo’er, move aside first. Let Master’s wife take a look.”","Li Moying immediately retreated to the side as he gave up his seat.","Yin Niang sat down beside Huang Yueli as her right hand’s five slender fingers rested on Huang Yueli’s wrist as she started to probe the condition of her body.","Li Moying and Saint Iniquitous Shadow stood on her left and right as they stared at her without blinking.","The two of them were extremely worried about Huang Yueli and were eager to know the reason behind her accident but they didn’t dare to disturb Yin Niang."]},{"number":4841,"title":"Chapter 4841: Abnormality","paragraphs":["Chapter 4841: Abnormality","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Yin Niang closed her eyes and sat by the bed. She did not move for a long time, but her expression gradually became solemn.","Li Moying was observing from the side and couldn’t help but feel increasingly anxious and uneasy, afraid that his wife had met with some accident.","After nearly an hour, Yin Niang opened her eyes and let go of Huang Yueli’s wrist.","Li Moying immediately took a step forward,” Master’s wife, what happened to Li’er?”","Yin Niang did not answer immediately. Instead, she had a serious expression on her face.” Mo’er,” she said solemnly,” Master’s wife has a few questions for you. I hope you can answer them truthfully.”","Li Moying’s heart turned cold as he hurriedly said,” Master’s wife, feel free to ask. I’ve always been together with Li’er so I understand her body’s condition the best.”","” Yes.” Yin Niang nodded and asked,” Before today, did Li’er experience a similar situation?”","Li Moying was startled,” A similar situation?”","“It’s when you suddenly faint while cultivating,” Yin Niang said.","When Li Moying heard this, his intuition told him that something was wrong as his heart grew increasingly uneasy.","From Yin Niang’s tone, it seemed that the reason why Huang Yueli suddenly fainted was not just because of the Soul Splitting Technique that she had cultivated. Could it be...","Li Moying only felt his hands and feet turning incomparably cold. He who was usually calm and self-controlled couldn’t calm down no matter what. When he opened his mouth, his voice was trembling.","“Reporting to Master’s wife, Li’er is indeed... She was indeed feeling a little unwell. It had been nearly half a year and she had fainted several times. However, this is the first time she fainted during cultivation. The previous few times she suddenly fainted were all because she advanced.”","“Advance?” Yin Niang raised her eyebrows.” Tell me in detail!”","He didn’t know if it was his own misconception, but he felt that Yin Niang’s eyes had lit up earlier.","However, after thinking about it carefully, he felt that it was impossible.","If something happened to Huang Yueli, Master and Mistress would definitely be very worried so how could she suddenly become excited? It must be an illusion...","He composed himself and described the situation in detail.","” Presumably, Master’s wife has already seen through it. I’m already at Dao Profound Realm now, but Li’er is still stuck at Late Heart Profound Realm up till now and hasn’t been able to break through.”","” Actually, this isn’t because the gap in our cultivation advancement is really so great. Ever since we cultivated the Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual together, our cultivations are already very close. The time to impact Dao Profound Realm is also very close. But I succeeded on my first attempt to charge at Dao Profound Realm, while Li’er failed several times.”","” The first time was four months ago when Li’er and I sneaked into the Devil Clan’s territory and discovered that the Devil Clan was gathering an army, wanting to attack You’ an City so we sneaked into the Devil Clan’s army...”","“.. After killing Ruijiang, the Profound Energy in our bodies reached the peak and I started to charge at Dao Profound Realm on the spot and also successfully advanced. After that, Li’er also touched the threshold of breaking through and I thought she would succeed too, but...”","” Later on in Snowflake City, Li’er also had a chance to almost advance...”","“The third time was when we were trapped in the Devil Territory...”","After Li Moying finished speaking, he suddenly recalled something as he added,” Oh right, at that time we were fighting hard against Ruijiang who had suddenly advanced into the Devil King Realm and was almost no match for him. When I was about to be killed, Li’er wanted to self-destruct to save me but.... The self-destruction failed, which was also a very strange thing. At that time, I felt that something was wrong with her body.”"]},{"number":4842,"title":"Chapter 4842: Pregnant!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4842: Pregnant!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Yin Niang had a strange expression on her face when she heard him. She looked happy and worried at the same time.","She kept muttering to herself,”No wonder...” So it’s like this...But wasn’t this too fast? How’s that possible? Although it was a good thing...However, she’s too young...”","As Yin Niang spoke, she seemed to have fallen into her own thoughts.","Li Moying felt more and more uneasy and when he saw that Yin Niang was ignoring him, he turned his head with a frown and looked towards Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","With one look, he realised that Saint Iniquitous Shadow was also in shock. One moment he looked at Huang Yueli, the next moment he looked at him and finally, he seemed to have suffered a huge blow.","Li Moying’s brows knitted tighter and tighter.","He had been out training since he was young in his previous life. He had met many people with strange personalities, but he had never seen anyone like his master and mistress.","An hour ago, he looked like a normal person. Why did he look like he had gone crazy now?","Li Moying waited for a while and saw that both of them had no intention of answering him. Furthermore, after Yin Niang let go of Huang Yueli’s wrist and helped her to lie down properly, she didn’t take any other measures to save her and didn’t even let her take a single pill.","Li Moying couldn’t help but ask,” Master’s wife, I’ve already said what I can say. What exactly is going on? Can you give me a definite answer and stop scaring me, Li’er is my life...”","Only then did Yin Niang regain her senses and when she saw Li Moying’s anxious expression, she couldn’t help but burst out laughing.","“Don’t worry, your wife is fine. However, you’d better calm down. Don’t go crazy with joy later.”","Li Moying was startled,” You’ve gone crazy from joy? What do you mean...”","“Why are you acting like an idiot? You don’t even know that your wife is pregnant? Is this how a good husband behaves? Really... I’ve said it long ago, this brat isn’t reliable and isn’t worthy of Li’er!” Saint Iniquitous Shadow sneered and said disdainfully.","Li Moying didn’t react in time and after a while, he suddenly raised his head,” Wha... What? Master, you...What did you just say? Did I hear wrongly?","Li’er she... She...She...There was... There is...”","” What?” Yin Niang couldn’t bear to listen to her good-looking disciple stutter. She shook her head helplessly and smiled.” Didn’t I already tell you?” I told you to calm down. You didn’t hear wrongly, if my judgement is correct, Li’er should be pregnant. She fainted a few times before and failed to advance. It should be because the baby in her stomach will absorb the energy in her body.”","Originally, the energy in a cultivator’s body was extremely abundant, and it was only when it could not be suppressed and was about to overflow that it touched the threshold of advancement.","In the process of advancement, one still needed to constantly gather energy from heaven and earth. Once the absorption speed could not keep up, the energy supply would be interrupted, which would lead to the failure of advancement. In serious cases, the remaining energy in the body would bite back and cause death or injury.","And when Huang Yueli was advancing, she also encountered such a situation.","The baby in her stomach had suddenly absorbed a portion of her overflowing energy, causing her to suddenly lack energy at the critical moment of her advancement. Naturally, she could only fail on the verge of success.","Li Moying was tongue-tied as he still didn’t dare to believe that this kind of pie would suddenly fall from the sky and land on his head.","“But, this... This... Why didn’t she know? That’s right, there’s also Li’er’s Senior Brother, who is also a famous doctor in the God Realm. He had checked Li’ er’s pulse before but he couldn’t find anything...”"]},{"number":4843,"title":"Chapter 4843: Lingering Fear","paragraphs":["Chapter 4843: Lingering Fear","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Yin Niang smiled and said,” This is normal. It’s not that Li’er’s Senior Brother’s medical skills are not good enough, but... Your situation is rather special. It was mainly due to the influence of the evil qi, and it was difficult for ordinary doctors to make an accurate judgment. And the doctor who can determine Li’er’s pregnancy might also be able to see through your identity as one who cultivates evil qi.”","Hearing this, Li Moying finally understood but immediately after, he felt a lingering fear.","Fortunately, they had missed it when they went to look for Divine Doctor Zhang. If they really met, perhaps Divine Doctor Zhang, one of the three Divine Doctors of the God Realm, would really be able to tell that there was something wrong with the aura in their bodies...That would be troublesome.","“Mistress, then... Then my wife is now...” Li Moying walked to Huang Yueli’s side and stretched out his hand wanting to touch her but the moment before he touched her stomach, he retracted his hand.","Not knowing why, he had a feeling that the one lying on the soft couch was no longer Li’er, but a fragile porcelain.","He was afraid that if he did something wrong, he would hurt her.","Yin Niang looked at her disciple’s silly look from the side and tried her best to hold back her laughter.","He was usually so calm and elegant, but when he encountered such a thing, wasn’t he just like an ordinary man?","Yin Niang smiled and said,” You don’t have to be too nervous. Li’er’s pulse is very stable and the baby in her stomach should be very obedient. Moreover, she’s almost four months pregnant now and has escaped from the more dangerous first three months. In addition, she has always been strong and healthy. As long as she doesn’t fight with others, there shouldn’t be too much of a problem.”","When Li Moying heard that, he was even more shocked,” This...Already...Has it been four months?”","As soon as he asked this question, he knew that he had asked a stupid question.","Wasn’t the time when Huang Yueli’s self-destruction failed four months ago? She would definitely be pregnant by then.","“But her stomach... Why can’t I tell at all?” Li Moying frowned slightly as he started to worry.","“This might be because you guys have extraordinary talent,” Yin Niang said with a smile. You should also know, right? In the God Realm, the more outstanding the talent of a cultivator, the lower the possibility of conceiving. For people like you with god grade talent, it’s normal that you can’t give birth to a child for thousands of years. Even if she was pregnant, the pregnancy time might be slightly longer than that of ordinary people. In short, it should be normal. Don’t worry.”","When Li Moying heard this, he heaved a sigh of relief.","Indeed, just as Yin Niang had said, the more talented a cultivator was, the more difficult it was to conceive.","The possibility of a god talent cultivator getting pregnant was already extremely low. There were many Dao Profound Realm powerhouses who were several thousand years old who could not even leave behind a single offspring.","So the moment he found out that Huang Yueli was pregnant, he was so shocked.","Before this, Li Moying had never thought that he would have the day to become a father. After all, with their innate talent...If they wanted to be parents, they could only rely on the heavens.","They were still so young and focused on cultivating and advancing. They had never considered such a problem.","So the moment he found out that Huang Yueli was pregnant, he was so shocked. Before this, Li Moying had never thought that he would have the day to become a father. After all, with their innate talent...If they wanted to be parents, they could only rely on the heavens.","They were still so young and focused on cultivating and advancing. They had never considered such a problem."]},{"number":4844,"title":"Chapter 4844: It Feels Like It Was Yesterday","paragraphs":["Chapter 4844: It Feels Like It Was Yesterday","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying then recalled that on the day they had just entered the small universe, Yin Niang had mentioned it before.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow and Yin Niang had once wanted a daughter but when their enemies attacked and both of their bodies were destroyed, they didn’t succeed. That was why Saint Iniquitous Shadow took Huang Yueli as his disciple and even disliked him, Li’er’s husband.","In comparison, he was indeed ridiculously lucky.","Li Moying knew that he couldn’t agitate Saint Iniquitous Shadow anymore so he didn’t say anything but turned towards Yin Niang, humbly asking her for advice on the matters to take note of when taking care of a pregnant woman.","Yin Niang was very satisfied with his attitude. She smiled and nodded.” Mo’er, you don’t have to be nervous. Although Li’ er is a little young, pregnancy isn’t a bad thing for her. It’s a great thing!”","Li Moying was startled as he asked in puzzlement,” Master’s wife, you mean...”","“When Brother Hong taught you the Soul Splitting Technique the last time, there was something I didn’t tell you. If he wanted to get rid of the hidden dangers left behind by the Soul Splitting Technique, he could only improve it by cultivating the secret manual, but he could not get rid of it. As long as your cultivation continues to rise, you will be fine. Li’er’s soul will definitely collapse in the future. It’s just that after cultivation, it can be greatly delayed. And if you want to eradicate it...”","Yin Niang paused for a moment as her slightly smiling gaze landed on Huang Yueli,” The only way is for the two of you to have a child. After pregnancy, as the fetus itself carries a part of your primordial spirits, it can help Li’er stabilize her primordial spirit. Your master wanted to have a child so much back then because of this.”","Li Moying finally understood and for a moment, other than joy, he felt a little lucky.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow snorted unhappily.","Taking advantage of the time when Huang Yueli had yet to wake up, Li Moying followed Yin Niang to seek advice.","Yin Niang naturally told him everything she knew. However, she frowned a little.” However, I’m not a doctor after all. I’ve never given birth to a child before, so I don’t know much. Your situation with Li’er is very special. The more outstanding a practitioner is, the more difficult it is to have children. I’m afraid that when the child is born, it will cause a strange movement in the world... Just in case, you have to leave the small universe as soon as possible and return to the God Realm.”","Li Moying had also thought of this point as he nodded his head with a solemn expression,” I understand, thank you Master’s wife for your reminder.”","Yin Niang nodded.” Since that’s the case, your master and I won’t disturb you any longer. Have a good rest. We’ll take our leave first.”","After Saint Iniquitous Shadow and Yin Niang left, Li Moying sat down on the soft couch.","He lowered his head slightly and looked down at the girl lying on the soft couch.","Because of Huang Yueli’s reincarnation, her current bone age was only eighteen years old and because she advanced very quickly, her aging speed was much slower than ordinary people so her small face was exceptionally delicate and tender. The baby fat on her face had not completely faded and she looked like she was only fifteen or sixteen years old.","Looking at this face, Li Moying found it hard to imagine that this beautiful young lass’s stomach was already carrying two people’s baby.","He still remembered the first time he saw Huang Yueli in the teahouse in his previous life, the young lady’s delicate and beautiful expression, as though it was just yesterday, and they...They had actually entangled and supported each other for such a long time."]},{"number":4845,"title":"Chapter 4845: Huang Yueli Awakened","paragraphs":["Chapter 4845: Huang Yueli Awakened","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying sat on the edge of the soft couch as he quietly looked at Huang Yueli’s sleeping face for a very long time without feeling the passage of time.","When Huang Yueli woke up, she saw the man sitting upright at the head of the bed, staring at her with a solemn expression.","Her mind was still a little dizzy. She was puzzled and muttered softly,”Husband...” Husband?”","Li Moying immediately regained his senses as he leaned in front of her and stretched out his hand to lightly touch her forehead,” Li’er, you’re awake? How did it feel? Where else do you feel uncomfortable?”","Huang Yueli didn’t expect to see Li Moying so nervous and she couldn’t help but be stunned for a moment before she recalled the situation before she fainted.","She and Li Moying were in closed door cultivation to cultivate the Soul Splitting Technique.","In the beginning, his progress was very smooth.","After she mastered the trick of tearing her primordial spirit and using evil qi to cultivate her primordial spirit, she gradually became familiar with it after a few repetitions. Later on, her cultivation speed became faster and faster, and her primordial spirit also had obvious changes. It became more condensed and stable.","According to the blue booklet, the method of cultivating the primordial spirit had to be repeated for eighty-one cycles. Even if he had already achieved a small success, he could come out of seclusion. He needed to rest for a period of time before proceeding to the next round of cultivation.","Seeing that the eighty-one circulation was about to be completed, Huang Yueli was already prepared to exit her seclusion.","However, what she did not expect was that on the last cycle before she completed her success, the same abnormal movement as the previous failed advancements appeared in her lower abdomen again.","The evil qi that was originally filling her meridians and seemed to be overflowing seemed to be guided by some force and suddenly surged towards her lower abdomen. Then, in the blink of an eye, it was reduced by more than half.","She had originally relied on the endless flow of this evil qi to gradually repair her torn primordial spirit. Now that the supply of evil qi had suddenly been cut off, her cultivation technique could not continue.","An intense pain erupted from the torn primordial spirit, as if a sharp knife had stabbed into her primordial spirit.","Huang Yueli had been cultivating for such a long time and her body was already in a tense state. The sudden stimulation caused her body to be unable to withstand it.","Before he could react, he blacked out.","At that time, her last thought was that she had made such a big mistake in circulating her cultivation. Could it be that she had gone mad?","Unexpectedly, when she woke up, she did not seem to be in the same pain and exhaustion caused by the tearing of her meridians.","Huang Yueli tried to move her hands and feet and felt that her movements were as smooth as a feather, as if there wasn’t any problem.","But looking at Li Moying’s deep gaze, it made her feel that she had a huge problem...","Huang Yueli was even more puzzled as she frowned and asked: ” Husband, I...” What happened to me? “When I was cultivating the Soul Splitting Technique just now, the evil qi in my body was suddenly sucked out. My breathing was chaotic and I fainted. I...” What happened to me? Did Master and Mistress save me?”","Li Moying nodded his head,” That’s right, Master’s wife had checked your pulse earlier and you just left not long ago.”","“Then...What did Master’s wife say? What’s wrong with me? Why did he still fail at the brink of success after having cultivated for eighty cycles? What went wrong?”","Huang Yueli was puzzled.","Li Moying took a deep breath and tried his best to calm himself down,” No, there’s nothing wrong with you. Li’er, there’s something...”"]},{"number":4846,"title":"Chapter 4846: An Unexpected Surprise","paragraphs":["Chapter 4846: An Unexpected Surprise","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying’s solemn expression and tone made Huang Yueli nervous as she held her breath, waiting for him to continue.","“Li’er, you... There’s a baby here.” Li Moying said as his right hand gently placed on Huang Yueli’s stomach.","Huang Yueli subconsciously nodded,” Oh, so I have a baby. You were so nervous, I thought...”","Halfway through her sentence, she suddenly stopped and her eyes widened.” Wait, did you just say...” What did you say about me? I must have been unconscious for too long and felt dizzy. I actually heard you say that I have a baby...”","Li Moying saw his cunning and clever little fox, rarely showing such a silly look and the nervousness in his heart suddenly faded away as the joy in his heart could no longer be concealed.","He grabbed Huang Yueli’s wrist and pulled her into his embrace. He leaned into her ear and said: ” You didn’t hear wrongly. Li’er, we really have a baby! Just now, Master’s wife personally checked your pulse and said that the baby is already four months old.”","“Wha... What? Am I really pregnant? And... Four months? How is that possible?” Huang Yueli was truly shocked as her jaw almost dropped to the ground.","If the person who told her this news wasn’t Li Moying, she would definitely reprimand him, thinking that this was nonsense.","And now, even if it was Li Moying who said it, she still didn’t dare to believe it.","Huang Yueli lowered her head and looked at her lower abdomen.","In fact, recently, she had indeed felt a little chubby on her stomach. She was a little puzzled. Why did she have a small stomach at such a young age? She clearly didn’t eat much.","However, to say that she was pregnant...","“This... But why didn’t I feel anything? Didn’t they say that it would be very uncomfortable after being pregnant and that she would keep vomiting...”","The two of them looked at each other in confusion.","Don’t just look at their outstanding talent in cultivation and Huang Yueli was also an expert in armament refining to earn money, but regarding the matter of pregnancy, it really touched the blind spot of their knowledge.","Huang Yueli had not grown up with her mother in her two lifetimes so no one had told her about this knowledge and she had no experience.","In addition, the two of them felt that it would take at least a few thousand years for them to have children, so they didn’t take it seriously and didn’t think of specifically understanding it.","Now, they were all stunned when they heard this news.","Li Moying was stunned for a moment before he coughed,” I...” I don’t know either, but your pregnancy isn’t without warning.”","Li Moying paused as he repeated what Yin Niang had said to Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli then came to a sudden realization: ” So, the previous few failures of my advancement were all because of... The baby in my stomach? I’m really pregnant?”","“Yes, it’s true.” Li Moying nodded his head.","Huang Yueli looked at him and then at her own stomach. After a long while, she finally digested the news and felt a little bit of reality.","What followed was a burst of unconcealable joy.","She pounced into Li Moying’s embrace,” Moying, we...We’re really having a baby. Oh my god, this is really... That was great! That’s great!”","Actually, when she was in the Lower Realm, she had indeed imagined that she would be able to have a cute baby with her husband and the family of three would roam the Soaring Heavens Continent together.","However, after she ascended, she knew that it was difficult for the two of them to get pregnant because of their high talent, so she could only put down this delusion.","She did not expect happiness to come so suddenly!"]},{"number":4847,"title":"Chapter 4847: It Must Be A Daughter","paragraphs":["Chapter 4847: It Must Be A Daughter","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seeing Huang Yueli’s agitated look, Li Moying’s face couldn’t help but reveal a smile.","To be honest, he was a little worried at the start because after Huang Yueli got pregnant, she had met with many situations. Not only did she meet with danger several times, she had even failed to advance multiple times. All these situations showed that the pregnancy had a huge impact on Huang Yueli’s body.","If it was just a burden to his cultivation progress, then it was fine but if it was to cause any damage to his body, then Li Moying would rather not have this child, than to bear his Li’er suffering any harm.","Even though Yin Niang had assured him that carrying this child would be beneficial to Huang Yueli’s primordial spirit and wasn’t a bad thing, Li Moying was still worried.","However, at this moment, seeing the little fox in his arms so excited that she was about to jump up, no matter how much worry he had, he temporarily put it aside.","Gazing at Huang Yueli’s sweet smile, his gaze became gentler and gentler as he lowered his head and planted a kiss on her lips.","“Yeah, it’s really great, my Li’er is really too amazing! In the future, I will be able to bring you and my daughter to train together. I will have two princesses. I wonder how many people will be envious of me...”","“However, my daughter will definitely be as beautiful as you. In the future, there will definitely be countless little brats who like her...I must educate my daughter well. She must not follow a good-looking brat outside. She is not allowed to be too close to a man before she is 500 years old!”","Huang Yueli listened with a smile but as she listened, she felt that something was not quite right.","“Wait... Wait a minute, husband, you... Aren’t you thinking too far ahead? What five...500 years old?”","She and Li Moying were not even one-tenth of five hundred years old.","Her husband had already arranged everything for her daughter to be five hundred years old?","Moreover, what did he mean by not following others just because they looked good...He even needed to educate her properly? Why didn’t he think about himself? He had come to seduce her when he was just a teenager?","Back then her father didn’t beat Li Moying to death, it was really this fellow’s luck...","Now that it was his turn to be a father, he was like this?","Moreover...","“How do you know that I will give birth to a daughter? Don’t you have to be born to know?” Huang Yueli asked doubtfully.","Li Moying narrowed his eyes,” It must be a daughter. Only a daughter can be as beautiful and cute as you, so there’s a need to bring her along. If it’s a son...”","Huang Yueli suddenly had a bad premonition,” What about our son?”","” Just throw our son back to the family and let the elders be responsible for raising him. Anyway, they should be very happy to be able to personally raise our baby.” Li Moying said indifferently.","Huang Yueli simply fell,” You you you...What nonsense are you talking about? How could he treat her so differently! What happened to her son? Did your son offend you?","Why should he be thrown to the elders? No, no matter if the baby is a boy or a girl, I have to bring it with me personally!”","In this lifetime, Huang Yueli’s parents had gone missing when she was very young and she was brought up by an uncle who harbored evil intentions. Compared to her previous life where she grew up by Master’s side who treated her like his own daughter, the difference between the two was too obvious.","She had long made up her mind that she would personally teach the baby in the future.","In the end, her husband actually had the problem of valuing women over men?","After knowing each other for so many years, this was the first time she knew!"]},{"number":4848,"title":"Chapter 4848: Having a Son is not fun at all","paragraphs":["Chapter 4848: Having a Son is not fun at all","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened as she glared fiercely at Li Moying, as though she was going to chase him out of the house if he dared to object.","Li Moying originally didn’t dare to go against Madam and now that Li’er was pregnant, in his heart, she was even more fragile than glass so how would he dare to make her angry?","Seeing that his wife was angered, he quickly said,” alright, alright, alright. I’ll listen to you. I’ll listen to you. If you want to keep it by your side, then keep it by your side. Don’t be angry, don’t be agitated...”","Although he was coaxing Huang Yueli with his mouth, he was secretly scheming in his heart.","Anyway, the brat had not been born yet, so it was right to go along with his wife first.","After she was born...That little brat did not know how to speak and only knew how to cry. By then, Li’er would know that her son was not fun at all.","When the brat grew up, he would find an excuse that a boy needed to train independently and let him cultivate.","From the looks of it, his son probably did not have the ability to compete with him for favor...","Moreover, the probability of having a son was only 50%, and there was still a huge possibility that he could give birth to a daughter as cute as Li’er so he really shouldn’t scare himself.","Although he consoled himself repeatedly in his heart, but for some reason, Li Moying felt a little uneasy.","The little fox was originally not easy to coax and after she got pregnant, her temper got worse. Li Moying spent a lot of effort to coax his wife and fed her the dinner and pills that Yin Niang had prepared for her, letting her lie on the bed to rest.","Huang Yueli had been making a ruckus for the entire afternoon until she laid down on the bed before she finally calmed down.","She reached out to touch her belly that was covered by the blanket, and the corners of her mouth involuntarily curled up into a smile.","Actually, compared to the daughter that Li Moying was looking forward to, she wanted a son more.","A son who looked very similar to Li Moying.","When she was in Soaring Heavens Continent, she had heard people say that Li Moying looked extremely cute when he was young and wasn’t as cold and aloof as when he grew up, he was a sweet mouthed little cutie.","To be honest, she felt a little...It was hard to imagine.","If only she could see a miniature version of Li Moying to verify it, that would be great.","Just as Huang Yueli was letting her imagination run wild, she suddenly felt the man lying beside her move a little and immediately following that, he sat up and got off the bed.","Huang Yueli subconsciously asked,”Husband?” Where are you going?”","Li Moying was stunned for a moment as he turned back to look at her,” Did I wake you up? It’s fine. I’m not going anywhere. I just want to find a quiet place to cultivate. Your current situation is special. I’m afraid that cultivating in the room will affect you and the baby.”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she was slightly surprised,” You’re going to cultivate now? Didn’t you just come out of seclusion today...”","Li Moying had always been extremely hardworking in his cultivation. He didn’t rely solely on his innate talent to reach his current strength. If he didn’t have the perseverance and hard work day after day, no matter how strong his innate talent was, it would be in vain.","However, no matter how hard he worked, he would not rush to continue cultivating after he came out of seclusion. He would still take a short rest.","Of course, Li Moying’s resting motive wasn’t for himself, but to accompany her.","Huang Yueli herself was also like this.","This was a tacit understanding between the two of them.","Li Moying’s exquisite and handsome eyebrows were slightly blurred under the dim moonlight but it made him look even gentler.","He stretched out his hand to caress Huang Yueli’s face as he laughed softly: ” I have to hurry up. We already have a daughter and we are still trapped in this small universe. Daughter will definitely blame Father for being useless.”"]},{"number":4849,"title":"Chapter 4849: Be obedient","paragraphs":["Chapter 4849: Be obedient","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli was startled as she used her arm to support herself on the bed board, wanting to get up,” Then I’ll go with you...”","Before she could finish her sentence, her shoulder was pressed down.","Li Moying kissed her face and said softly,” Don’t make me worry, hm? If something like this morning happens again, I won’t be able to take it.”","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but glare at him,” How am I that weak? It was just a matter of cultivation. As long as he was careful not to attempt to advance, it would be fine. Don’t forget, when we were trapped in the Devil Territory, I was already pregnant. Didn’t I still come out?”","Her original intention was to appease Li Moying so that he wouldn’t have any unnecessary worries but after Li Moying heard that, his expression turned even darker.","“If I had known that you were pregnant, I would never have let you leave the?Phoenix Tranquility Gorge!”","According to the time that Yin Niang had mentioned, this baby should have been conceived when the two of them went to the?Phoenix Tranquility Gorge to send Wang Cai home.","The?Phoenix Tranquility Gorge was far away from the settlements of the Ancient God Clan and the Devil Clan. It had beautiful mountains and clear waters, a pleasant environment, and abundant Xuan Qi. It was indeed a good place to raise people.","The two of them had truly experienced what it meant to be an immortal couple.","Other than loving each other, they could also tease the little phoenix and tease the big phoenix every day. From time to time, they could even cheat some heavenly treasures. Their lives were extremely relaxed and happy.","It was said that environment and mentality were extremely important in the process of preparing for pregnancy so it was no wonder that Huang Yueli would get pregnant there.","Unfortunately, the two of them didn’t have any relevant experience so they didn’t notice the existence of the little child in Huang Yueli’s stomach.","Otherwise, Li Moying would definitely let his wife stay until after the child was born.","In this way, Huang Yueli wouldn’t have encountered those few dangers and almost lost her life.","Huang Yueli looked at Li Moying’s stern expression and found it a little funny,” Husband, don’t be so nervous. Baby and I are really fine, we’re doing great! If the baby could be conscious in his stomach, he might even think that his father doesn’t like him!”","Li Moying was startled for a moment as he hurriedly pulled out a smile as he touched Huang Yueli’s stomach.","” Father is going to cultivate. Stay with Mother. Don’t learn from her. Be good, understand?”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a second before she reacted and turned hostile on the spot,” Li Moying, what did you say? How can you slander Mother like this to Baby?”","However, Li Moying was already prepared and the instant she threw the pillow over, he quickly took a few steps back and flashed out of the room.","Huang Yueli pursed her lips and didn’t follow after him.","Although she didn’t take it seriously, but as a newbie who had just taken up her position as a little mother, Huang Yueli was still a little nervous and perturbed.","Even if Li Moying didn’t say it, she was still a little afraid, worried that her previous few failures in breaking through to a new realm would cause adverse effects to the baby.","For this reason, she could only give up on the idea of continuing to cultivate.","“Sigh, this time, your mother’s cultivation will not be able to catch up to your father again.” Huang Yueli sat on the bed as she used her finger to poke at her slightly bulging fair and tender belly, muttering softly,” Look at how much your Mother has sacrificed. If your Father quarrels with Mother in the future, do you know which side you should stand on?”","As soon as she finished speaking, her stomach suddenly twitched.","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment before she reacted, could it be...Did the little fellow move?"]},{"number":4850,"title":"Chapter 4850: This is not the main point!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4850: This is not the main point!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","To Huang Yueli, this was definitely a novel experience.","There had never been a moment where she truly felt that she was...She was really going to be a mother!","In her stomach, there was a little life.","It was the fruit of love that she had nurtured with the man she loved for two lifetimes.","As soon as she thought of this, her heart softened.","Huang Yueli couldn’t hold it in any longer as she immediately lifted the blanket and ran out of the room to look for Li Moying.","” Husband, husband?!”","Li Moying had just sat down cross-legged in the room next door and although he had already set up his posture, but he had not started cultivating.","The news of Huang Yueli’s pregnancy today had a greater impact on him than Huang Yueli.","No matter how much he reminded himself that he had to calm down as soon as possible, cultivate and break through as soon as possible, and bring his wife and children out of the small universe as soon as possible, he could not enter the cultivation state smoothly like usual.","It was really...He was too excited.","At this critical moment, he heard knocking sounds coming from outside the room.","Li Moying stood up and walked to the door. Just as he opened the door, a petite and slim figure pounced into his embrace.","“Husband, husband, the baby moved in my stomach just now! I can feel it moving! Our baby is really too smart. It must be able to understand what I said to it, so it answered me like this... Ahhh, the baby is really cute!”","Huang Yueli grabbed onto Li Moying’s lapel as she was extremely excited as she looked at the man’s handsome face with her eyes wide open, waiting for her new father to share her joy.","However, Li Moying’s reaction wasn’t what she had expected.","Not only did he not smile, he even frowned slightly. Then, he bent down and suddenly picked her up horizontally.","“Didn’t I tell you to rest in your room? Why did he run out? And you’re not even wearing socks!”","“Ugh!” Huang Yueli choked for a moment as her line of sight subconsciously shifted downwards and landed on her bare feet.","She had indeed forgotten to wear socks. Her husband’s eyes were really sharp...","It was until her back was pressed against a soft pillow that Huang Yueli suddenly regained her senses,” That’s not right, this isn’t the main point! Husband, did you not hear what I said? The baby just moved!”","Li Moying picked up the blanket on the soft couch and covered Huang Yueli’s body. He pinched her little feet and stuffed them under the blanket, wrapping her up tightly. Only then did he place his hand on her stomach through the blanket.","“She didn’t move?” The newbie father’s handsome brows furrowed slightly, revealing a rare look of confusion.","Huang Yueli’s head was full of black lines,” Baby can’t keep moving right? When I was talking to it just now, it moved. You just didn’t catch up.”","Li Moying seemed extremely regretful but this emotion only lasted for a very short period of time as he quickly reacted.","“Then what did you say to the baby just now? If you tell it again, maybe she will move again?”","“I just said...” Huang Yueli recalled for a moment and suddenly choked.","Could it be that she was going to tell Li Moying that she had tried her best to defame its father in front of Baby and even told Baby to stand firmly on Mother’s side?","“Cough cough, I forgot! You know, pregnant women are very forgetful.” Huang Yueli could only reply.","Li Moying’s gaze landed on her fair little face and saw her slightly awkward expression as the corners of his lips curled up."]},{"number":4851,"title":"Chapter 4851: Genius Baby","paragraphs":["Chapter 4851: Genius Baby","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","If he couldn’t tell that this little fox was hiding something, then he would have been her husband for nothing.","But Li’er could do whatever she wanted, who asked her to be his wife?","Li Moying let go of his hand and pulled the blanket again, wrapping Huang Yueli tighter,” Since that’s the case, then the next time the baby moves, I’ll accompany it, alright? I’m going to cultivate now. I’ll send you back first.”","As he said that, he was about to carry Huang Yueli up.","Huang Yueli hurriedly tugged at his sleeve,” Wait, there’s no need to go through so much trouble. You can just cultivate directly. Baby and I will stay here to accompany you.”","Hearing that, Li Moying frowned slightly,” When I’m cultivating, the evil qi in the small universe will be attracted and keep surging. You and Baby will definitely be affected...”","“What are you afraid of? When I didn’t know I was pregnant, didn’t I always cultivate with you? He didn’t see anything wrong. Besides...” Huang Yueli subconsciously rubbed her stomach,” Our baby is very powerful. Father and Mother are both Heaven Grade geniuses so how could they not be able to withstand even a little energy fluctuation?","Maybe it likes it!”","Li Moying recalled what Yin Niang had said in the afternoon. Huang Yueli had failed several times in her advancement and all of them had a portion of her Profound Energy sucked away by the baby in her stomach, so he swallowed back the words of persuasion that were about to reach his mouth.","His wife was right.","Their baby...He had probably already started cultivating in his mother’s stomach.","Who knew what kind of powerful genius babies they would give birth to?","Li Moying didn’t say anything else as he sat back down and started cultivating.","He had already made some progress in the Soul Splitting Technique, so he had started to cultivate the second secret manual that Saint Iniquitous Shadow had given him, which was the advanced version of the Evil Shadow Secret Manual.","According to what Saint Iniquitous Shadow had said, he had originally planned to wait until Li Moying advanced into the Late Dao Profound Realm before imparting this secret manual to him. But he had not expected that Li Moying’s innate talent in deviant cultivation was so high, to only use a week’s time to fully grasp the Soul Splitting Technique.","Considering that Li Moying needed to advance quickly and leave the small universe, he would impart the secret manual in advance.","It was just that this way, the difficulty of his cultivation would be much higher than the usual one and there was a possibility of him going berserk. It was precisely because of this that he wanted to avoid Huang Yueli from the start.","But after facing Huang Yueli’s expectant gaze, he really couldn’t forcefully chase her away and could only remind himself to be extra careful when cultivating, not to hurt his wife and children because of his own negligence.","Li Moying sat down on the opposite soft couch and gently closed his eyes as he started to meditate to regulate his breathing.","Speaking of which, it was strange. Earlier when he was alone, he felt uneasy and initially thought that with Huang Yueli and the baby by his side, he would be even more distracted. But he had not expected that when he felt the faint fragrance of Huang Yueli’s body wafting in the room, he actually felt unusually calm.","Not long after, he completely entered a state of cultivation.","Huang Yueli sat beside Li Moying for a while and looked at his straight back as he sat on the soft couch. Even though he was holding his breath and concentrating, he was still like a sharp sword that had been unsheathed, biting cold and sharp.","His handsome and perfect eyebrows were as exquisite as a painting, and his cold white skin was slightly sweaty.","Not long after, he completely entered a state of cultivation. Huang Yueli sat beside Li Moying for a while and looked at his straight back as he sat on the soft couch. Even though he was holding his breath and concentrating, he was still like a sharp sword that had been unsheathed, biting cold and sharp.","His handsome and perfect eyebrows were as exquisite as a painting, and his cold white skin was slightly sweaty."]},{"number":4852,"title":"Chapter 4852: What’s going on?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4852: What’s going on?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli subconsciously swallowed her saliva as she stretched out her hand to pat her own face.","“Why is it so hot? Could it be that the energy concentration in the room is too high?”","She picked up a stack of paper from the low table beside her feet and fanned her face a few times.","However, not only did this not lower the temperature in her body, but it also made her feel more and more hot as time passed.","Huang Yueli had originally wanted to stay here and cultivate with Li Moying but now it seemed that the energy in the room had changed too drastically so in order not to affect the baby in her stomach, she decided to return to her own room.","Huang Yueli stood up and walked towards the door.","But she didn’t know what was going on but her mind was clearly clear about what she wanted to do but her feet seemed to not listen to her commands as she didn’t walk towards the door but instead approached Li Moying step by step.","By the time Huang Yueli regained her senses, she was already standing in front of Li Moying and her right hand was raised up, almost touching Li Moying’s face.","“Ugh! What happened?” Huang Yueli suddenly woke up as she retracted her hand in horror.","She had almost harassed her husband while he was cultivating!","If it had been a few more breaths, she might not only have touched her husband’s face, but she might have even kissed him!","This, this, this...","Although the two of them had been married for many years, it was not like she had never done something more reckless.","However, harassing the other party while he was cultivating...","She didn’t think she was that shameless, right?","Huang Yueli’s heart was still whirling with thoughts when she realised that she didn’t know when she had taken another step towards Li Moying’s direction.","The distance between the two of them was already extremely close, and they were just short of sticking together.","Huang Yueli hurriedly took a step back and realised that the situation was not good.","” That’s right, this must be because Moying is cultivating the Wraith Secret Guide ...”","Back then when Saint Iniquitous Shadow was imparting her this cultivation method, he had given her the secret manual for both husband and wife to cultivate together. Later on, she had also relied on that secret manual to bring Li Moying who had been unconscious for a few months back.","But this time when the Wicked Shadow Saint passed the second half of the ” Iniquitous Shadow Secret Manual ” to Li Moying, he didn’t mention this matter again so the couple thought that this secret manual was no different from an ordinary cultivation method.","Now, it seemed that the two of them who were connected by the Soul Splitting Technique could not avoid affecting each other when they cultivated evil techniques.","If it was any other time, cultivating together with Li Moying wasn’t a big deal but now, she was already pregnant...","When Huang Yueli thought of this, her heart turned cold as she bit down on her tongue, using this little bit of pain to wake up as she hurriedly retreated.","However, at this moment, she suddenly felt a slight twitch in her abdomen. It was not painful, but it gave her a fright.","Immediately after, a portion of the evil qi in her body was sucked away, and the heat in her body instantly disappeared.","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment as she lowered her head to look at her lower abdomen,” No way? The baby could even absorb evil qi? Does the baby like the energy here?”","Of course, the little guy would not answer her.","After absorbing a large amount of energy, it stopped moving and quietly stayed in its mother’s stomach.","Huang Yueli had already walked to the front of the door when her footsteps suddenly halted and she turned back."]},{"number":4853,"title":"Chapter 4853: Want to Abduct Li ‘er","paragraphs":["Chapter 4853: Want to Abduct Li ‘er","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli’s footsteps lightened as she walked to Li Moying’s side but she didn’t make a sound to alarm him. Instead, she stretched out two fingers and carefully pulled out the << The Secret Guide of the Wicked Shadow >> from the short table beside him.","Thereafter, she sat down on the soft couch opposite Li Moying and started to flip through this unorthodox secret manual that no one had ever seen before.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow was indeed worthy of being ranked as a grandmaster among all the Profound Life Realm experts in the past. The second half of the book was filled with pearls of wisdom.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but exclaim as she looked on.","How did she come up with such a method of using energy? Although her master was sometimes as childish as a child, he was indeed a rare genius. They did not worship him for nothing.","Huang Yueli’s comprehension ability was extremely high so she only used an hour to flip through it from beginning to end.","After reading it, she put the secret manual aside and closed her eyes. Now, she went through the contents of the book in her mind before she began to try to cultivate.","The cultivation process was unexpectedly smooth.","Perhaps it was because Li Moying was right beside her, every bit of growth of the evil qi in his body would affect the energy in her meridians, which allowed her to cultivate with twice the result with half the effort, easily crossing the first threshold.","The only problem was that because the two of them were cultivating in the same room, their cultivation techniques resonated with each other. Every once in a while, they would become irritable.","Fortunately, the baby in her stomach would absorb some energy from time to time. Every time Huang Yueli felt that the heat in her body was unbearable, she would be able to lower her temperature in time.","In order to prevent the failure of advancement from happening again, Huang Yueli had consciously controlled the flow of energy within her body during this cultivation. She paid more attention to tempering the evil qi and Profound Qi in her meridians, making them more condensed and pure, trying her best to prevent large amounts of energy from accumulating in her dantian.","As a result, her foundation became more and more solid, but she deliberately avoided advancing.","Just like that, Huang Yueli and Li Moying came to an agreement and started to cultivate together once again.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow and Yin Niang noticed this and nodded.","“Li’er is really a smart and hardworking child, pregnant yet not forgetting to cultivate. Taking advantage of this opportunity to lay a good foundation will be of great benefit to her. She has advanced too quickly and her foundation is not stable enough. Now that she has made up for this, she will definitely soar after she gives birth to a child!” Yin Niang was peeping at her two little disciples outside the window, her eyes full of smiles.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow snorted and looked disapproving.” How is he smart? She was pregnant at such a young age. Wouldn’t she be trapped by that brat? It’s not convenient to divorce that brat.”","“You, that’s enough! Don’t always pick on Mo’er.” Yin Niang was angry and amused at the same time. She rolled her eyes at her husband,” Mo’er and Li’ er are so compatible, and he treats her so well...Look at him, he was cultivating almost 24 hours a day. Wasn’t it to break through as soon as possible and bring Li’er and Baby out? Looking at his progress, I’m afraid he’ll break through in the next two days.”","” What?” Saint Iniquitous Shadow said unhappily,” You brat is taking Li’er away and you’re still happy?”","“It’s not like I’m not coming back,” Yin Niang said helplessly. As long as the spatial passageway is opened, wouldn’t it be a matter of a second for Li’er to come back to see you?”","” Hmph!” Saint Iniquitous Shadow snorted.” I’m afraid that once the little girl leaves the small universe, she’ll only have that brat in her heart...”","Suddenly, he felt as if his daughter was about to get married. What was going on?"]},{"number":4854,"title":"Chapter 4854: A Blessing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4854: A Blessing","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","No matter how reluctant Saint Iniquitous Shadow was, Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s cultivation were still increasing at an astonishing speed.","Every time they saw the cultivation speed of these two young people, Saint Iniquitous Shadow and Yin Niang would sigh in their hearts, thinking that it would be difficult to find another genius who was more outstanding than them in a million years.","To be able to receive such two talented disciples and see the two of them as loving as they were when they were young, wasn’t it a blessing?","After another ten days, on an ordinary morning, Li Moying finally broke through again.","From initial-stage Dao Profound Realm to middle-stage Dao Profound Realm, although this was just a minor realm’s advancement, starting from Dao Profound Realm, every minor realm breakthrough was a rebirth like experience.","And every breakthrough threshold was like a natural moat for countless cultivators.","Li Moying was only 23 years old this year and he had already advanced to Dao Profound Realm Middle Stage. In the recorded history of God Realm, this was something that had never happened before.","If he was not in the small universe at this time, but was advancing in the God Realm, it would probably cause a shock to all the cultivators in the twelve continents of the God Realm.","It would even attract the attention of the Devils from ten thousand miles away.","Huang Yueli followed Master and Mistress as they sat in the courtyard, waiting for Li Moying to advance as her thoughts drifted.","Previously after killing Sky Devil Ruijiang, the Devil Clan’s Clan Leader had already announced that he wanted to take advantage of the time when Huang Yueli and Li Moying were still in the Profound Heart Realm to kill the two of them to prevent future troubles.","If the two of them had not been trapped in the Devil Territory for so long, they might have already fought with the Devil Clan.","Now, if the Devil Clan were to find out that her husband had already successfully advanced into the Middle Stage Dao Profound Realm, the Devil Clan might go crazy and who knows how many people they would send out to assassinate Li Moying.","Now that they could advance in the small universe, it was a good thing for them.","It was not an exaggeration to say that it was a blessing in disguise.","This time around, Li Moying didn’t advance due to the stimulation from the battle, but through cultivating two different cultivation methods and accumulating together to advance. This kind of advancement method consumed a very long time and was a relatively long process.","Huang Yueli and Saint Iniquitous Shadow couple sat in the courtyard for an entire day and night.","The various attributed energies in the small universe were all affected by Li Moying’s aura as they gathered towards the direction of the small wooden house.","The energy of different attributes formed light arrows that shot over from the distant horizon like meteors, falling into the energy vortex on the roof.","These energies gathered into the vortex above Li Moying’s head but the mark left behind by the sky didn’t disappear. As time passed, the energy vortex grew bigger and bigger as the different coloured light arrows merged together, like exploding fireworks, forming a dazzling light screen.","Huang Yueli’s body was under the light curtain and she could feel the energy that was faintly leaking out from the whirlpool as her breathing slightly stagnated.","Yin Niang noticed her strange behavior and turned to look at her.” Li’er, how are you? If you can’t take it, then stay far away and wait. Your master and I are here, so there won’t be any problems. You’re pregnant now, so you’d better be careful. Don’t force yourself.”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes and shook her head: ” I’m fine. Baby is fine too.” Baby... I like to be close to Daddy very much!”","Sensing that Li Moying was about to advance, Baby actually kicked her in her stomach excitedly."]},{"number":4855,"title":"Chapter 4855: Passage Opening","paragraphs":["Chapter 4855: Passage Opening","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Just as the three of them were talking, Li Moying’s advancement had already reached the final stage.","The energy vortex above the roof suddenly contracted, and countless streams of light were instantly gathered at the center of the vortex. The entire sky suddenly darkened, and the three of them instantly fell into a pitch-black darkness.","However, this state only lasted for less than ten breaths.","With a loud explosion, a colorful stream of light shot out from the center of the hut, dyeing the sky with a gorgeous color again.","The energy fluctuations coming from not far away also had obvious changes.","Huang Yueli’s eyes flashed as her face revealed a faint excited expression,” Husband...He should have successfully advanced!”","Yin Niang nodded slightly.” I didn’t expect Mo’er’s advancement to be so smooth. We, who are protecting him, are useless. Next, he should be about to open the passageway to the small universe.”","Yin Niang was right.","As soon as she finished speaking, the ground of the entire small universe suddenly shook, and it became more and more intense.","Soon, even Saint Iniquitous Shadow and the others couldn’t stand steadily. They secretly circulated their cultivation techniques to prevent themselves from sitting down.","The energy streams in the sky kept gathering, dispersing, and gathering again...It was like a bucket of paint that had been mixed together.","As the tremors intensified, the energy was gradually divided into silver spots of light.","“Split!”","A cold male voice came from the small house.","Following this not-so-loud sound, the tremors on the ground reached an extreme. The sky exploded with a loud bang, tearing a crack in the middle.","The crack continued to extend to both sides, and it only stopped after about ten meters.","Immediately after, a gust of cold wind rushed in from the crack. The whistling sound was like the roar of a dragon and tiger, deafening.","However, Li Moying only gave a cold snort. Under his control, the entire small universe’s energy gathered together again, blocking this cold wind, blocking it out of the crack.","After another 15 minutes, the entire small universe returned to peace.","Huang Yueli rubbed her belly and sighed inwardly, her baby was indeed worthy of being the baby of two god grade geniuses.","That huge explosion just now, as well as the intense astral winds in the spatial passageway, for cultivators with slightly weaker strength, this pressure was difficult to withstand.","However, her baby was actually obedient and did not move at all. It seemed that he was not affected at all. In fact, she even felt that the baby had absorbed some energy...","“Baby, you’re so obedient. Your daddy is coming out soon. He’s going to bring us home. Are you happy?”","Before he could finish his sentence, the door was pushed open.","Li Moying’s tall and straight figure appeared at the door.","The black robe he was wearing was completely soaked in sweat, and the hair on his forehead was very messy. However, this still could not hide his cold aura.","Because he had just advanced, the powerful and turbulent energy in his body seemed to be about to seep out of his body.","His eyes were as dark as ink, flashing with a cold light. He was like a beast that was still in hibernation, powerful and dangerous.","But Li Moying’s aura didn’t affect the three people in the courtyard at all.","The three of them looked at Li Moying at the same time.","Li Moying didn’t say a word as he walked straight towards Huang Yueli."]},{"number":4856,"title":"Chapter 4856: Was it easy for her?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4856: Was it easy for her?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli raised her head slightly and looked at the man who was much taller than her as the corners of her lips curled up.","She wanted to congratulate him but before she could speak, Li Moying had already stretched out his hand and pulled her into his embrace, hugging her tightly.","“Li’er, I succeeded! I can finally take you and the baby out! I was really worried that if I failed, you and the baby would be disappointed.”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow coughed heavily.","Huang Yueli felt the familiar warmth and strength as her face turned slightly red as she stretched out her hand to push his chest,” Alright, I understand. Baby and I are very assured of you. Quickly let go of me, Master and Mistress are watching.”","Li Moying released her a little but both his hands were still wrapped around her waist, encircling her in front of him as he lowered his head to stare at her,” The commotion outside was a little too big, you’re not injured right?”","Huang Yueli shook her head,” I’m fine, you don’t have to worry. I’m not that kind of weak and incompetent girl, how could I be injured by such a small battle?”Y0u can read sh0rt, t0uching, and r0mantic st0ries ab0ut c0uples, as well as children’s st0ries f0r free 0n sitest0rys(.)c0m","Li Moying was naturally very clear about his dear wife’s ability but this didn’t stop him from being on tenterhooks for Huang Yueli every single time.","Perhaps in other people’s eyes, Huang Yueli was a peerless genius who was so powerful that she was almost omnipotent. But in his eyes, Li’er was just his wife, the woman whom he swore to protect her for his entire life, to let her be happy forever.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow coughed again, and his face turned green. He couldn’t help but say,” Mo’er, Master and Mistress taught you the cultivation technique and protected you with great effort. It’s fine if you don’t bow and thank us both, but you still hug your junior sister and refuse to let go. What kind of body are you...?” Ahhh!”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s stern words stopped abruptly when Yin Niang stepped on him.","Yin Niang rolled her eyes at her husband before turning to her two little disciples.","“Mo’er, don’t listen to your master’s nonsense. Your master is very happy that you can advance so smoothly. He was still saying just now that you’re the youngest among the God Realm’s cultivators who broke through to middle-stage Dao Profound Realm in history. To be able to take in a disciple like you, we’re truly lucky.”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow didn’t expect his wife to reveal all of his secrets so directly. His expression immediately turned extremely ugly.","“Dear wife, you...Whose side are you on?!”","Yin Niang’s mouth twitched. She complained in a small voice,” That’s enough. Don’t embarrass yourself in front of your disciple, alright?!”","It could be seen that the two little disciples originally thought that this master of theirs still had the halo of an idol. They thought that he was a peerless expert ranked among the top in the history of the God Realm, a legendary existence. They did not know about the reputation of Saint Iniquitous Shadow in the God Realm back then...He was a very childish wife-flaunting maniac.","Was it easy for her to protect her dignity as a master?","However, Saint Iniquitous Shadow could not understand her painstaking efforts. If this continued, his prestige in front of his disciple would be completely gone!","Luckily, Li Moying didn’t notice their interaction as his attention was completely on Huang Yueli.","Li Moying smiled as he took a glance at Huang Yueli. He turned his head and smiled,” Master’s wife, you’re wrong. I’m not the youngest.”","Yin Niang was stunned.” What? Wasn’t it? Could it be that after your master and I became spirit bodies, there was actually a genius stronger than you?”","Li Moying shook his head and after pausing for a moment, he nodded his head,” Of course there are geniuses who are stronger than me and that is Li’er. After she breaks through, my title as the youngest genius will definitely be lost.”"]},{"number":4857,"title":"Chapter 4857: It’s Time to Leave","paragraphs":["Chapter 4857: It’s Time to Leave","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Saint Iniquitous Shadow and his wife, who had been fed a mouthful of dog food by their two disciples, were speechless for a long time.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but pinch her husband’s waist,” Alright, is there anyone who brags like you? I haven’t even broken through to Dao Profound Realm right now!”","Although Yin Niang said that her cultivation had stagnated because of the baby in her stomach, and that as long as the baby was born, her cultivation would increase rapidly, it had not happened yet, after all, and no one could guarantee it.","Li Moying said it out loud, not knowing if she should say that he had blind confidence in her, or if he was thick-skinned and flattered her randomly.","Li Moying smiled and didn’t say anything else.","No one knew better than him how hard Huang Yueli had been cultivating and how high her innate talent was. If she couldn’t advance even with this, then it would really be unfair.","He did not believe that such a thing could happen.","The two of them whispered to each other for a while before Huang Yueli pushed Li Moying away and turned around to look at Saint Iniquitous Shadow and Yin Niang as she cupped her hands towards them.","“Master, Masteress, Moying and I still have some matters to attend to in the God Realm so we will be leaving now. When we settle down, we’ll definitely come and visit you often.”","Yin Niang’s eyes were filled with reluctance but she said,” Entering the small universe through the spatial passageway will consume a lot of Profound Energy in your body. You are still pregnant so don’t take this risk. When the baby is born safely, come and tell us the good news.”","The concern on Yin Niang’s face was genuine. Huang Yueli looked at her and couldn’t help but think of her own mother who was still in the lower realm, feeling extremely touched.","“Master’s wife, don’t worry, I will take care of my body. But my and Moying’s abilities aren’t that bad, isn’t it just a space tunnel? It’s nothing.”","She didn’t notice that just as she said this, Li Moying’s brows furrowed slightly but he didn’t refute her.","Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s expression was much uglier. He glanced at the two of them and snorted coldly. He was just short of writing the word ‘tsundere’ on his face.","” Sister Yin, don’t worry. If I can still remember anyone other than that brat after I get out, I’ll lose!”","Yin Niang frowned.” What are you saying? How could he behave in front of his disciple! Speak properly!”","Saint Iniquitous Shadow hesitated for a moment, but he didn’t immediately listen to his wife.","When Huang Yueli saw this, she laughed to herself as she took a step forward,” Master, I’m really sad when you put it this way. In my heart, you’re no different from my father but in the end, you said that I can’t remember you...Sigh, I’m sad...”","Huang Yueli lowered her head with a dejected look as she stretched out her hand to wipe the corner of her eyes.","Seeing his little disciple on the verge of tears, Saint Iniquitous Shadow immediately became anxious and hurriedly said,”Cough cough, Li’er, Master didn’t mean that...” Of course, Master cares about you as much as your master’s wife, but... Sigh, in short, isn’t Master still reluctant to let you leave? He’s worried that you and Baby won’t be able to live well outside and will be bullied by this brat?”","” Then don’t worry, Moying and I will definitely be in love.” Huang Yueli suddenly raised her head but her face was filled with smiles.","When Saint Iniquitous Shadow saw this, he realized that he had been played by his little disciple. His expression immediately turned ugly.","Huang Yueli stuck out her tongue and just as she was about to say something to coax him, Li Moying suddenly interrupted,” The spatial passageway won’t be able to maintain for long so we have to hurry up and leave.”"]},{"number":4858,"title":"Chapter 4858: Heaven Desecrating Pill","paragraphs":["Chapter 4858: Heaven Desecrating Pill","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but glare at her husband.","Don’t think that she didn’t know that this man was doing it on purpose. His childishness was on par with Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s. It was no wonder that her master always found him an eyesore. As the saying goes, it takes two hands to clap!","But what Li Moying said wasn’t wrong, they had to leave within an hour.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli turned around and bowed towards Yin Niang and Saint Iniquitous Shadow,” Master, Masteress, we’ll be leaving then.”","Yin Niang took a step forward and held her hand.” Master’s wife has prepared some things for you. You might be able to use them when you reach the God Realm.”","Saying that, she stuffed an interspatial ring into Huang Yueli’s hands.","Huang Yueli used her spiritual perception to quickly probe and immediately exclaimed: ” Master’s wife, this...” This was too valuable! We... We can’t accept it. You can keep it for yourself.”","In the ring that Yin Niang had given her, other than the evil cultivation techniques that she had specially arranged, there were also many rare materials of the god grade, as well as the ancient books of array techniques and spirit weapon techniques that she and Saint Iniquitous Shadow had collected.","These were all extremely rare items that couldn’t be obtained even with money. Presumably, in the ancient times where the two of them were in, they were all priceless treasures.","However, this wasn’t the most precious thing. What really shocked Huang Yueli was that in this interspatial ring, there was actually a god grade medicinal pill-the legendary Heaven Desecrating Pill.","This kind of pill, Huang Yueli had only seen it in the Sacred Phoenix Race’s ancient secret collection. Furthermore, it only mentioned its name, not even a picture.","This was because the Heaven Desecrating Pill had already been lost for many years when the ancestor wrote this ancient book.","In the current God Realm, there was no way to even verify whether such a medicinal pill existed or not.","Legend had it that this pill could reverse the laws of the heavens to a certain extent. Even a dead cultivator could be revived as long as their body was still warm. Moreover, it could restore the cultivation of cultivators below the Profound Life Realm. It would not matter even if their dantian was completely shattered.","Such a divine pill, originally even Huang Yueli didn’t think that it really existed but Yin Niang took out one.","There was no need to say how precious this medicinal pill was.","Yin Niang sighed softly.” You don’t have to be so polite with Master’s wife.” You and I are masters, and we don’t need these anymore. Although the Heaven Desecrating Pill is miraculous, it’s not very useful for Life Profound Realm cultivators. But for you, it’s a divine medicine that can bring the dead back to life. The birth of a god grade genius is a matter of competing with the Heavenly Dao. It’s hard to guarantee that there will be any accidents. Take this pill so that we can be more at ease.”","Seeing that Huang Yueli was still hesitating, Yin Niang paused for a moment before continuing: ” Your Master’s and my corporeal bodies have already been destroyed and Heaven Desecrating Pills are unable to reconstruct the body of a Life Profound Realm practitioner. If we want to get out, we can only rely on you two little disciples. If anything were to happen to you two outside, wouldn’t we be trapped here forever?”","Huang Yueli saw her insistence and could only agree as she kept it.","She did not think that she would have the chance to use the medicinal pill. She only wanted Yin Niang and the others to be at ease.","This conversation took up quite a bit of time. The passage in the void had already begun to shrink a little.","Huang Yueli knew that she couldn’t delay any longer and hurriedly cupped her hands towards the two of them before turning around and holding hands with Li Moying, they walked into the spatial passageway together."]},{"number":4859,"title":"Chapter 4859: Half a Year","paragraphs":["Chapter 4859: Half a Year","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The moment she entered the passageway, Huang Yueli felt a huge pressure.","Various energies of different attributes intertwined and gathered, forming a vortex-like energy torrent that surged toward the two people in the center.","A cultivator with slightly weaker strength would probably be crushed into pieces by such a huge energy in an instant.","Even though Huang Yueli was already prepared and had already donned her strongest defensive spirit armor, and had even circulated her defensive cultivation method beforehand, but she was still struck by the impact which caused the blood in her body to churn and her chest to feel nauseous.","However, this feeling only lasted for less than a breath.","Without waiting for her to circulate her cultivation to resist, Li Moying had already exerted his strength and pulled her into his embrace to protect her. At the same time, through their tightly clasped hands, he had transferred his inner breath into Huang Yueli’s body to help her resist the impact of the energy vortex.","After advancing into the Middle Stage of Dao Profound Realm, Li Moying’s Profound Energy’s purity had risen another level.","With him blocking the majority of the impact, Huang Yueli’s pressure instantly reduced by quite a bit.","But looking at the cold sweat on Li Moying’s forehead, Huang Yueli was very clear that even with her husband’s ability, it was still very difficult for him to bear all the impact alone.","Her heart ached as she frowned as she tugged at Li Moying’s finger, wanting him to let go of her so that she could fight alongside him.","However, Li Moying only took a glance at her and the strength in his grip on her didn’t weaken in the slightest as he refused to let go.","Fortunately, this section of the spatial passageway was not considered long. The section with the strongest energy was even shorter. It did not take long for the surrounding pressure to gradually reduce.","By the time the pressure disappeared, the two of them were already on solid ground, stepping on the land of the God Realm.","Huang Yueli let out a long breath as she turned her head to take a look. She realised that the entrance of the passageway was shrinking at a speed visible to the naked eye and it would probably disappear from her sight before long.","When Li Moying saw this, he said softly,” This time the spatial passageway has already been opened up. The imprint at the entrance is connected to our primordial spirit. If we want to enter in the future, we just need to expend a certain amount of Profound Energy and it will be able to open up again.”","Huang Yueli nodded her head and couldn’t help but sigh,” But the amount of Profound Energy required to open the passageway is really not small. Previously I had thought that if I were to encounter any danger in the future, I could hide in the small universe but now it seems that it’s a little unrealistic.”","If they had discovered a strong enemy beforehand and hid, it would have been fine.","If they were seriously injured in battle, it would be almost impossible to open the space passageway to escape. Because after being seriously injured, they might not have enough Profound Energy to open the passageway and would not have the ability to pass through the space passageway.","” However, this is normal. Otherwise, those ancient experts who possessed a small universe wouldn’t have fallen.” Huang Yueli sighed for a while and very quickly figured it out.","Since they had already left the small universe, the most important thing now was to hurry back to Snowflake City to meet Liu Buyan.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying immediately released the airship from their space and rushed back to Snowflake City.","The two of them were first trapped in the Devil Territory and then in the small universe. They were completely unable to sense the changes in time in the outside world.","It wasn’t until they entered the city and asked the residents in the city that they realized that time passed faster than they had expected. It had been nearly half a year since they left.","Initially, they had agreed to meet Xuan Jiuling in one to two months. However, half a year had already passed...","The two of them suddenly had an ominous premonition."]},{"number":4860,"title":"Chapter 4860: Left","paragraphs":["Chapter 4860: Left","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","‘I didn’t expect that the speed of time passing in the outside world would actually be twice as fast as in the small universe...This time, things are going to be a little troublesome.” Huang Yueli’s brows knitted together as she said in a worried tone.","Li Moying squeezed her hand as he consoled her,” Don’t worry first. Divine General Xuan has always kept his word and Liu Buyan isn’t someone easy to deal with so he might not have really met with any mishaps. Let’s go to the inn to take a look at the situation first. Maybe nothing happened and we were just scaring ourselves.”","Huang Yueli nodded her head and together with Li Moying, the first thing they did was to rush to the inn where they had stayed previously.","When they left, they had made an agreement with Xuan Jiuling to let Liu Buyan continue to stay in the inn and his freedom of movement wouldn’t be interfered with. But Liu Buyan had to swear on the Heavenly Dao that he absolutely wouldn’t leave the boundaries of Snowflake City and he had to return to the inn every night.","Although this was equivalent to house arrest, but as a Spirit Medicine Master, Liu Buyan would usually go into closed door cultivation to study the pill formula and a few months would pass so it wasn’t an unreasonable request.","However, when Huang Yueli and Li Moying rushed to the inn, what they were most worried about had happened.","Because of the confrontation between the two of them and the Black Tortoise Race half a year ago, the inn manager had a deep impression of this young couple who were very eye-catching in terms of looks and strength. As soon as he saw the two of them, he immediately recognized them.","“Ahem, aren’t these Young Master Li and Madam Li? I didn’t expect that the two of you would come to Snowflake City again and even come to my small store to be the queue leader. It’s really an honor to bring light to my humble store...” The shopkeeper immediately stood up and came forward to welcome him.","Although his face was full of smiles, his heart was really uneasy.","The last time these two came to his inn to stay, they caused quite a stir. He almost lost his store...She really didn’t want to see them again.","However, he did not have the guts to reject the two powerhouses.","Huang Yueli saw through his thoughts with a single glance and had no intention to say more to him. She went straight to the point: ” We are just passing by and we are not staying here today. We just want to ask if my Senior Brother is doing well? Is he still living in his original room?”","When the shopkeeper heard this, he suddenly quivered and his expression changed.” Ah? The two of you... Are you asking about Young Master Liu? However, he...didn’t he leave a long time ago?”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were stunned as their hearts thumped.","“What happened? Tell me clearly! When did Young Master Liu leave?” Li Moying frowned and asked.","In his anxiety, he could not restrain his aura. The shopkeeper’s legs went weak and he almost knelt down.","The shopkeeper did not dare to be negligent and hurriedly told him everything he knew.","“Li... Young Master Li, after you and Madam left, Young Master Liu really... He stayed in the store for a period of time. During that time, he rarely went out and basically stayed in the store. He even needed the waiter to send his dishes to his room. However, a month later, a young master suddenly came to the door and asked about Young Master Liu...After that, Young Master Liu left with him.”","“Young master?” Huang Yueli’s brows creased as her intuition told her that there was something wrong with this person,” What young master? Who is he to my senior brother? Why did Senior Brother leave with him?”","Liu Buyan didn’t seem to have any particularly good friends in the God Realm.","Even if he did, it was impossible for the other party to know that he was in Snowflake City.","The shopkeeper’s face was filled with a bitter smile.” Ahhh, Madam, aren’t you making things difficult for me? How would this lowly one know who Young Master Liu was? I...”"]},{"number":4861,"title":"Chapter 4861: Suet white jade token","paragraphs":["Chapter 4861: Suet white jade token","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli thought about it and agreed. There was no use in making things difficult for a shopkeeper so she could only soften her tone.","“Then try to recall what happened that day. What does that young master look like?”","The shopkeeper did not hide anything.” When that young master appeared, I was worried that something would happen to Young Master Liu,” he said readily.” So, I was more cautious and paid attention to him.” This young master was dressed in white, and there was a jade token carved from suet white jade on his waist. It was obvious that he was not an ordinary item. He’s also quite handsome, and the aura he exudes is extraordinary. I guess that he should be like the two of you, a cultivator genius of the Ancient God Clan.”","“A jade token made of Sheep-Fat White Jade?” Huang Yueli frowned as she exchanged glances with Li Moying.","Li Moying narrowed his eyes as he asked,” Shopkeeper, then can you confirm which clan this person is from?”","The shopkeeper was stunned, and a look of confusion appeared on his face.” This... My cultivation level is not high. I’m only at the initial stage of the Profound Meaning realm. As long as the god clan’s cultivation level is higher than mine, it’s very difficult for me to distinguish them...”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying both revealed a disappointed expression as their hearts grew anxious.","But the two of them interrogated the shopkeeper again but he couldn’t give out any valuable information and only knew that the person who came didn’t have any conflict with Liu Buyan. After knocking on Liu Buyan’s room, the two of them didn’t know what they were talking about and about fifteen minutes later, Liu Buyan left with him and never returned.","Seeing that they could not get anything out of him, the two of them could only bid farewell and leave.","However, after walking for a short while, the two of them found a teahouse and sat down, quietly analyzing the situation just now.","” Li’er, how much of what that shopkeeper said earlier, do you think is true and how much is false?” Li Moying muttered.","Huang Yueli caressed her sleeves as she said thoughtfully: ” I think that shopkeeper’s guts are very small. If he really wanted to lie to us, I’m afraid he wouldn’t dare to do so. It’s just that he seemed to be hiding something and didn’t tell us everything he knew. It seems that the force that took Senior Brother away is very powerful. The shopkeeper doesn’t dare to offend us or the other party.”","Li Moying nodded his head,” Your thoughts are exactly the same as mine. I’m afraid that the shopkeeper has been coerced and moreover, the other party’s influence should still be in Snowflake City.”","Huang Yueli replied: ” That’s right. If the other party had already left Snowflake City, the shopkeeper would definitely tell the truth. Only if the other party’s forces had not left, would he be worried about the other party’s revenge. However, if the other party was here for his senior brother, why didn’t they take him away after finding him? Instead, why did they stay here? It can’t be that he’s waiting for us? Could it be that they are our enemies?”","Li Moying’s brows creased up slightly as he pondered for a moment before shaking his head slowly,” That’s impossible. When the two of us left, only Divine General Xuan knew our identities and I’m not worried about Divine General Xuan’s character so it’s impossible for him to reveal our whereabouts.... How would outsiders know about our relationship with Liu Buyan?”","Li Moying’s brows creased up slightly as he pondered for a moment before shaking his head slowly,” That’s impossible. When the two of us left, only Divine General Xuan knew our identities and I’m not worried about Divine General Xuan’s character so it’s impossible for him to reveal our whereabouts.... How would outsiders know about Liu Buyan’s relationship with us? How would outsiders know about our relationship with Liu Buyan?”"]},{"number":4862,"title":"Chapter 4862: Divert","paragraphs":["Chapter 4862: Divert","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying raised his brows,” You know what happened?”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes and nodded slightly,” I guess that the person who took Senior Brother away should be someone from the Black Tortoise Clan, or at least someone who has some relationship with the Black Tortoise Clan. If not for that, how could the Divine General Xuan not care about his Senior Brother’s disappearance? He might have already overturned the entire inn. However, the shopkeeper did not mention that someone had come looking for him after the matter...”","Li Moying’s brows twitched as he understood as he slammed the table,” You’re right, this matter should be related to the Black Tortoise Clan and Xuan Jiuling should be someone who knows about it!”","Previously they had always felt that Xuan Jiuling wouldn’t go back on his promise and would definitely let Liu Buyan stay in the inn until the two of them returned so they had sunk into their habitual thoughts.","Now that he thought about it from a different perspective, things suddenly became clear.","“However, to be able to force the Divine General Xuan to cooperate, the person must have an extraordinary status. At the very least, he must be an elder of the Divine General Xuan’s status in the Black Tortoise Race. I wonder how senior brother is doing now that he has fallen into the hands of such a person.” Huang Yueli thought of the crucial point and her expression turned even more solemn.","Li Moying’s fingers tapped lightly on the table,” The matter has already happened for so long so it’s useless to worry now. Divine General Xuan should already know that the two of us have entered the city. He definitely wants to see us. We’ll just wait here.”","Huang Yueli gradually calmed down as she nodded her head and sat down again but her expression was still not too good.","Li Moying stretched out his hand to hold her small hand as he shook his head helplessly,” I know you and Brother Liu are Senior and Junior siblings and your relationship isn’t bad but to be so concerned about the man who had once pursued you in front of me, aren’t you worried that I’ll be jealous?”","Huang Yueli had just picked up the teacup and drank a mouthful of water when she heard those words and almost choked.","“Cough cough, you... What are you talking about! How many years has it been? You actually...You actually still remember!”","Li Moying replied in a low voice,” What many years ago? Actually, it was just five to six years ago. In this life, when you were in the lower realm, he even erased your memories and detained you in his territory. Otherwise, you wouldn’t have taken his master as your master. Have you forgotten?”","Huang Yueli choked for a moment, totally not expecting that her husband would bring up the past at this time.","Liu Buyan had already gone missing and he was still jealous, was that really alright?","However, he was so openly jealous that she didn’t know where to start.","She held it in for a long time before saying,”Isn’t your memory too good?” That senior brother already has someone else he likes. Why don’t you remember? If he didn’t like Xuan Qingling this time, why would he take such a risk and get into trouble for her? She has long forgotten about me, alright?”","“In that case, it’s quite a pity for you?” Li Moying gave a harrumph.","Huang Yueli almost fell,” I...Since when did I feel that it was a pity? If you continue to spout nonsense, I’ll ignore you!”","Huang Yueli glared at her husband as she slightly puffed up her cheeks. Although she looked angry on the surface, her heart felt a little sweet.","Every single thing that happened between the two of them was clearly remembered by Li Moying so naturally she could only feel happy.","Li Moying looked at her slightly flushed little face as he gently exhaled.","Actually, he had long stopped being jealous of Liu Buyan. His little fox liked strong practitioners and he knew from his past life that Liu Buyan was no longer a threat to him so even if that brat still liked his dear wife, it was useless.","Li Moying just didn’t want Huang Yueli to be overly worried about Liu Buyan’s matter and affect the baby in her stomach.","Fortunately, her attention was successfully diverted."]},{"number":4863,"title":"Chapter 4863: Invite","paragraphs":["Chapter 4863: Invite","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Because Li Moying had intentionally changed the topic, Huang Yueli had indeed relaxed quite a bit.","The two of them waited in the private room of the teahouse for about two hours. As expected, the sound of footsteps rang out.","“Young Master Li, Madam Li, Divine General Xuan has learned that the two of you have come to Snowflake City. He wishes to invite the two of you to his residence for a chat. He has specially sent me to invite the two of you.”","A deep voice rang out from outside the door, accompanied by the sound of metal clashing. It was obvious that the cultivator outside was a general under Xuan Jiuling. He was wearing ling armor and followed a curtain as he bowed to the two of them.","Huang Yueli’s brows raised as she exchanged a glance with her husband before speaking out unhurriedly.","“What’s wrong? What did the Divine General Xuan mean by this? When my husband and I left Snowflake City, how did we entrust him with this? Now that he’s done this, he still has the cheek to send a subordinate over and ask us to go over to see him? It’s simply ridiculous!”","Huang Yueli’s voice was crisp and pleasant to the ear. Usually when she spoke, she would speak in a soft and gentle voice. Even when facing ordinary cultivators whose abilities were far inferior to hers, she would still be very polite.","However, this time, her tone became heavier. Towards the end, the Profound Energy in her body formed a pressure that was released along with her words, making the Divine Guards outside the door shudder uncontrollably as cold sweat broke out on their backs.","There were many customers of the teahouse gathered outside the door as well as spectators by the roadside. When they heard Huang Yueli say such words, they were all stunned and the entire place was silent.","Xuan Jiuling had been guarding the vicinity all along this period of time. As a peak Dao Profound Realm powerhouse, he was naturally illustrious in the entire Snowflake City.","The status of the Divine General’s estate was extremely high. Even the soldiers guarding the gate of the Divine General’s estate were existences that everyone looked up to. Not to mention, the cultivator standing at the door had a divine guard’s waist token hanging on his waist. One look and one could tell that he was a general who was put in an important position in the military.","When this divine guard arrived, he attracted everyone’s attention. Everyone wanted to know who he wanted to see in such an ordinary teahouse.","However, no one had expected that such a high-ranking Divine Guard would not even dare to enter the room. When he reached the door, he would bow to the bottom and give such a big bow. The tone he used to speak to the people in the room was also extremely respectful.","He was even representing the Divine General Xuan to invite people in the future!","What kind of peerless expert could make an expert with such status and strength like the Divine General Xuan personally send someone to invite him?","When this divine guard arrived, he attracted everyone’s attention. Everyone wanted to know who he wanted to see in such an ordinary teahouse. However, no one had expected that such a high-ranking Divine Guard would not even dare to enter the room. When he reached the door, he would bow to the bottom and give such a big bow. The tone he used to speak to the people in the room was also extremely respectful.","He was even representing the Divine General Xuan to invite people in the future!","What kind of peerless expert could make an expert with such status and strength like the Divine General Xuan personally send someone to invite him?"]},{"number":4864,"title":"Chapter 4864: Esteemed Guests","paragraphs":["Chapter 4864: Esteemed Guests","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Madam Li, it was this general’s fault for not thinking things through and offending the two of you. I will convey your words to Lord Divine General. Please wait a moment.”","After the guard finished speaking in a low voice, he bowed in the direction of the curtain and slowly retreated out of the teahouse.","As soon as the divine guard disappeared, the guests at the scene began to discuss in surprise, not hiding their shock at all.","“I wonder who the two of you in the private room are? He actually managed to make the Dark Divine General’s personal guards treat him with such respect!”","“Not only are the guards respectful, didn’t you hear what the guard said? Was he really going to convey these words to Divine General Xuan? Could it be that Lord Divine General will really come to this small teahouse in person?”","“That’s impossible, right? What kind of status does the Divine General Xuan have? With his status in the military, and the credit of defeating the Devil army and killing Sky Devil Ruijiang half a year ago, how could he lower himself so much?”","” That’s hard to say. If the status of the two people in the private room is high enough, Divine General Xuan might appear.”","“That’s strange. Who are the two of you? There weren’t many people in the entire God Realm who had a higher status than the Divine General Xuan, right? Could it be that he was the clan leader of some god clan? But the voice I heard from inside just now seemed very young!”","“What do you mean by ‘seeming’? He’s very young! When the guests in the private room entered, I saw them at the side. They were clearly two young cultivators who were not yet adults. They looked to be in their twenties, and their appearances were first-class!”","“In that case, could he be the heir of a major faction? However, the heir is only from the younger generation. How dare he act so arrogantly in front of the Divine General Xuan?”","Everyone looked at each other.","They were just ordinary people in the God Realm, and the highest cultivation among them was only at the initial stage of the Profound Meaning realm. They had no contact with the circle of experts in the God Realm at all. At most, they would hear some gossip from the upper echelons after a meal. They could not even determine the authenticity of the gossip, let alone know about the top god grade geniuses in the God Realm.","Moreover, in order to avoid any unnecessary trouble, Huang Yueli and Li Moying had changed their appearances as usual, concealing their stunning looks.","Everyone was discussing animatedly, their gazes focused on the curtain, staring at it eagerly.","They all wanted to see with their own eyes what kind of noble young masters were sitting inside.","However, to their disappointment, no matter how curious they were, they were destined to never be able to see the other party’s true appearance.","That was because, in less than fifteen minutes, Divine General Xuan’s carriage had really appeared outside the teahouse.","A Six-star Divine General, an elder of the Black Tortoise Clan, had really appeared here!","This shocked all the guests present so much that their jaws dropped.","How could there be such a thing in the world!"]},{"number":4865,"title":"Chapter 4865: Unforeseen event","paragraphs":["Chapter 4865: Unforeseen event","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Jiuling walked out of the curtain and hesitated for a moment before stopping.","“Matriarch Huang, Young Master Li, are the two of you inside? This Xuan has indeed done something wrong this time, so I’ve specially come to apologize to the two of you.”","If the customers in the teahouse had not left, they would have fainted on the spot when they saw this scene.","A dignified Divine General of the Military Department was actually so respectful to two young cultivators!","However, there were no outsiders now, only Xuan Jiuling’s personal guards.","Although these people also felt that Huang Yueli and the rest had let an elder like Xuan Jiuling personally come over to explain, which was a little too overbearing, but they didn’t feel too shocked.","After all, Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s true identity, they were all insiders and they knew clearly that the Sky Devil Ruijiang that the two of them had defeated back then was an incomparably powerful enemy that even Divine General Xuan was helpless against.","At that time, the entire Blessed City was shrouded in despair and they were already prepared to sacrifice themselves for the country. In the end, Huang Yueli and Li Moying appeared and brought such shocking good news...","With their strength, achievements, and status, it wouldn’t be too much for Xuan Jiuling to be polite to them.","Moreover, the Black Tortoise Race was at fault this time.","In the private room, Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged a glance.","In fact, when the Divine General’s estate’s carriage drove over from the other end of the street, they already knew that Xuan Jiuling had arrived. However, they didn’t make any reaction from the beginning to the end. They just wanted to give Xuan Jiuling some pressure.","Now that their goal had been achieved, and Xuan Jiuling’s seniority was higher than theirs, the two of them couldn’t continue to act arrogantly.","Huang Yueli opened her lips lightly: ” Divine General Xuan, I have troubled you to come over personally. My husband and I have failed to welcome you. Please come in and have a cup of hot tea.”","Hearing the sweet voice of this young girl, Xuan Jiuling’s tensed nerves finally relaxed. He exhaled a long breath, lifted the curtain, and walked in.","Although Huang Yueli and Li Moying were juniors, but the two’s identity and abilities were displayed here. In the future, they would definitely grow into peerless existences who could summon the wind and rain in the God Realm. Anyone who had a bit of foresight knew that they could not offend the two of them.","Fortunately, Huang Yueli and the rest knew the principle of stopping while they were ahead.","Since Xuan Jiuling had taken the initiative to give them enough face, they naturally appreciated it.","Li Moying stood up and exchanged a bow with Xuan Jiuling before saying,” Divine General Xuan, please take a seat.” They hadn’t seen each other for a long time, so they could take this opportunity to catch up. I wonder how Your Excellency Divine General has been these days?”","Xuan Jiuling couldn’t help but reveal a bitter smile.” The two of you, don’t use words to mock this old man. I know what you want to ask, so I’ll just say it. Please entrust Young Master Liu to me and let me protect him while you return to Snowflake City. I originally thought that this matter would not be difficult, so I agreed immediately. I did not expect that things would suddenly change. I have failed the two of you. This old man is really ashamed!”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli frowned,” Your Excellency Divine General’s so-called unforeseen event...What was it? Back then, you promised us that even if the Black Tortoise clan leader came personally to ask for him, you would help us delay until we returned.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli frowned,” Your Excellency Divine General’s so-called unforeseen event...What was it? Back then, you promised us that even if the Black Tortoise Patriarch came personally to ask for him, you would help us delay until we returned.”"]},{"number":4866,"title":"Chapter 4866: Unlucky","paragraphs":["Chapter 4866: Unlucky","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“What is it? An Zhenyu? He actually came to Snowflake City personally? This... How is that possible?”","Even though Huang Yueli had already mentally prepared herself and knew that a major accident must have happened recently, but this news still shocked her.","Moreover, she quickly thought of another point.” So, the person who went to the inn to take my Senior Brother away that day was An Zhenyu himself?”","Xuan Jiuling nodded with a serious expression.","Huang Yueli’s brows furrowed as the uneasiness in her heart grew stronger.","“Divine General Xuan, what’s going on?” she urged. Why did Young Master An come all the way from the White Fen Continent to this frontier fortress? Was he really here for Miss Qingling? Between him and Miss Qingling...Their feelings are actually so deep?”","According to Huang Yueli’s knowledge, the White Fen Clan was a rather special existence among the twelve clans of the God Clan, their status was rather transcendent.","Of course, this was different from the special status of the Veracious Wyvern Clan in the ancient times. The White Fen Clan relied on their extraordinary talent in medicine and spirit medicine.","More than 80% of the most outstanding physicians and spirit apothecaries in the history of the God Realm were from the White Fen Clan.","No matter how powerful a warrior was, once they were injured or poisoned, they would need a doctor to treat them. Therefore, the other eleven families did not dare to offend the White Fen Clan. It was difficult for the White Fen Clan not to have a high status.","And it was precisely because of this that the members of the White Fen Clan weren’t passionate about cultivator cultivation. The highest position in the clan wasn’t a heaven-grade genius with outstanding cultivator talent, but a clansman with outstanding talent in spirit medicine.","The White Fen Clansmen rarely worked in the military. Even if they stayed in the alliance army, they would be doctors and would not go to the front line.","As the most important heir of the family, An Zhenyu would definitely not take the risk of appearing in Snowflake City for no reason.","However, if he said that he did it for Xuan Qingling... Huang Yueli also felt that it was a little strange.","According to Xuan Qingling, she had only met An Zhenyu two or three times, and they hadn’t even spoken ten words. The White Fen Clan had come to offer the betrothal gift because of her talent and strength, and not because she had any romantic relationship with An Zhenyu.","Xuan Jiuling took a glance at Huang Yueli and sighed: ” Speaking of which, Young Master Liu’s luck is really bad. Young Master An came to Snowflake City not for him or Qingling, but...It’s for Divine Doctor Zhang!”","This answer was really unexpected.","Huang Yueli was startled before she replied: ” Divine Doctor Zhang? Why is this matter related to Divine Doctor Zhang?”","“You two have stayed in the city for too short a time, so you don’t know.” Xuan Jiuling explained. It is said that Divine Doctor Zhang had already announced a year ago that he was afraid that no one would inherit his medical skills because of his old age. Therefore, he planned to find a suitable disciple and pass on his medical skills to his disciple.”","“However, because Divine Doctor Zhang has been traveling all over the world for free medical treatment, these words are just empty talk. Who knew that not long after you left, Divine Doctor Zhang suddenly returned and announced to the public that he was fated to be in Snowflake City, so he planned to stay here for a year to find a disciple.”","“However, because Divine Doctor Zhang has been traveling all over the world for free medical treatment, these words are just empty talk. Who knew that not long after you left, Divine Doctor Zhang suddenly returned and announced to the public that he was fated to be in Snowflake City, so he planned to stay here for a year to find a disciple.”"]},{"number":4867,"title":"Chapter 4867: Different Medical Philosophy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4867: Different Medical Philosophy","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Huang Yueli heard this, she finally understood.","“Divine Doctor Zhang is actually planning to accept a disciple in Snowflake City? No wonder...When my husband and I entered the city just now, we felt that there was something unusual in the city. There were actually people wearing Spirit Medicine Master badges on every street...Spirit Medicine Masters are so rare. This is the first time I’ve seen so many Spirit Medicine Masters. I thought that the alliance army had specially recruited them...So you’re here for Divine Doctor Zhang.”","She pondered for a moment before saying,” In that case, my Senior Brother is really too unlucky. An Zhenyu happened to come to Snowflake City and heard about what happened between my fiancée and my Senior Brother. That’s why he took my Senior Brother away?”","Xuan Jiuling nodded.” As far as I know, that’s true.”","Li Moying frowned as he couldn’t help but say,” Divine General Xuan, there’s one thing I don’t understand. There are countless Spirit Medicine Masters in the White Fen Clan. There are even god grade Spirit Medicine Masters and a large number of ancient books in their collection. As the young master of the White Fen Clan, An Zhenyu can learn any medical skills he wants. Why does he want to be a disciple of Divine Doctor Zhang like an ordinary Spirit Medicine Master?”","Xuan Jiuling stroked his beard.” I had the same question before. I just heard the news from the White Fen Tribe a few days ago.” It is said that the reason why Divine Doctor Zhang has his current medical skills is because he accidentally entered an ancient ruin when he was young and obtained all the secret impartation of an ancient Spirit Medicine Master sect.”","” These secret impartation techniques not only include prescriptions and medical books, but they also include the long-lost techniques of Spirit Medicine Masters. Even the White Fen Tribe was unable to pass down these techniques from their ancestors. It can be said that they are unique in the God Realm.”","Huang Yueli was shocked: ” There’s such a thing? No wonder...”","Li Moying’s brows were still tightly knitted,” Even so, Divine Doctor Zhang is a rare Divine Spirit Medicine Master who is not from the White Fen Clan so wouldn’t he want to find a successor from outside the White Fen Clan? Even if An Zhenyu comes to Snowflake City personally, will he really give his secret impartation to the young master of the White Fen Clan?”","Hearing this question, Huang Yueli was stunned and very quickly, she sank into deep thought.","“Husband is right. This didn’t seem to make sense. Currently, almost all of the high-level Spirit Medicine Masters in the God Realm were from the White Fen Clan. It was almost impossible for other god clans and human cultivators to want to become divine rank Spirit Medicine Masters. Under such circumstances, Divine Doctor Zhang still passed on his medical skills to An Zhenyu. Wouldn’t the White Fen Clan monopolize the medical skills of the God Realm in the future?”","Although everyone had the freedom to choose their successor, but from Divine Doctor Zhang’s perspective, this choice was somewhat inconceivable.","This was because Divine Doctor Zhang’s medical philosophy was different from that of the White Fen Clan.","“Husband is right. This didn’t seem to make sense. Currently, almost all of the high-level Spirit Medicine Masters in the God Realm were from the White Fen Clan. It was almost impossible for other god clans and human cultivators to want to become divine rank Spirit Medicine Masters. Under such circumstances, Divine Doctor Zhang still passed on his medical skills to An Zhenyu. Wouldn’t the White Fen Clan monopolize the medical skills of the God Realm in the future?” Although everyone had the freedom to choose their successor, but from Divine Doctor Zhang’s perspective, this choice was somewhat inconceivable.","This was because Divine Doctor Zhang’s medical philosophy was different from that of the White Fen Clan."]},{"number":4868,"title":"Chapter 4868: Just Ask","paragraphs":["Chapter 4868: Just Ask","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli saw that Xuan Jiuling didn’t know the inside story so she didn’t continue to ask and changed the topic.","“We can’t guess Divine Doctor Zhang’s thoughts, so let’s talk about my Senior Brother. Since An Zhenyu had been staying in Snowflake City in order to obtain Divine Doctor Zhang’s legacy, did that mean...My Senior Brother and Miss Qingling are still in the city?”","Xuan Jiuling was much clearer about this problem.","He hurriedly nodded.” The two of them are indeed still in the city. After finding out that Young Master Liu was taken away by Young Master An, I personally went to the White Swamp Race to ask for someone. However, An Zhenyu insisted that Young Master Liu had deliberately set Qingling up to get close to the Black Tortoise Race and defiled his fiancée. He refused to let her go, and Qingling was also found and taken away by his people.”","” Matriarch Huang, you should know that our patriarch is heavily injured and needs the help of the White Fen Clan’s patriarch. I can’t offend the White Fen Clan too much, so I can only persuade them nicely. However, An Zhenyu’s attitude is unyielding and he refuses to let them go.”","” I even sent a trusted aide to the Black Turtle State, hoping that the patriarch could find a way to mediate with the White Fen Tribe. However, it has been several months and there is still no reply.”","” However, I’ve been sending people to monitor the temporary base of the White Fen Tribe. Although Young Master Liu and Qingling have been detained, their lives should be safe. I can guarantee that.”","Xuan Jiuling sighed as a guilty look appeared on his face as he cupped his hands towards Huang Yueli and Li Moying,” This old man is really useless, I have failed the two of you...”","Huang Yueli frowned as she raised her hand to support Xuan Jiuling,” Divine General Xuan, there’s no need for you to be like this, please sit down.”","Although she was displeased, she didn’t intend to vent her anger on Xuan Jiuling.","She could understand why Xuan Jiuling was in such a predicament.","Although Xuan Jiuling was already a Six-star Divine General, he was still a member of the Black Tortoise Clan. In the God Realm, the warriors of the God Clan were taught from a young age that nothing was more important than the honor of the clan. All the clansmen had to obey the orders of the Clan Leader.","Now that the Black Tortoise Clan’s Patriarch’s life was still in the hands of the White Fen Clan, Xuan Jiuling naturally wouldn’t treat Liu Buyan as more important than his own Clan Leader. To make him betray the clan just for a promise, to fall out with the White Fen Clan’s Young Master, it wasn’t realistic at all.","At least Xuan Jiuling had thought of a way to save Liu Buyan’s life and even brought the latest news over which was still helpful to her.","Xuan Jiuling saw that Huang Yueli’s face didn’t show any anger and the heart that had been hanging in the air for several months finally relaxed by half.","He thought for a while and said in a low voice,” Matriarch Huang, Young Master Li, you two are magnanimous and won’t argue with me. However, I’ve indeed let you down. If there’s anything I can help you with, I’ll make it up to you. Please don’t treat me as an outsider. Just ask.”","Huang Yueli had already recovered from her deep thoughts and immediately opened her mouth to speak: ” I still have a matter that I need to trouble Lord Divine General with.”"]},{"number":4869,"title":"Chapter 4869: Not So Simple","paragraphs":["Chapter 4869: Not So Simple","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli’s expression didn’t change much,” My husband and I are after all eloping and I don’t want to go back just like that. I know a thing or two about how the White Fen Clan does things. They’re just acting tough because they want money and resources. My husband and I can satisfy them without alerting the clan.”","When Xuan Jiuling heard that, he raised his head in shock as his gaze swept across Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s faces.","He didn’t believe that Huang Yueli and the rest didn’t know that with the identity of the White Fen Clan’s Young Master, it definitely wouldn’t be so simple to raise conditions.","An Zhenyu knew that Huang Yueli and the rest were anxious to save them so they would definitely demand an exorbitant price. If they wanted a large sum of Crystal Jade and Spirit Stones, then so be it. Xuan Jiuling believed that with Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s status, it wasn’t to the extent that they couldn’t afford it.","However, if An Zhenyu deliberately made things difficult for them, it was very likely that he would ask them to hand over a high-grade treasured weapon or even a magical weapon before they were willing to let them go.","Even if it was Huang Yueli, it was impossible for her to take it out.","Only Sacred Phoenix Clan or Cloudy Qilin Clan, this kind of large clan with deep heritage, would have such a priceless and rare treasure.","Xuan Jiuling could understand the feelings of the eloping couple who didn’t want to go to the family to apologize and plead for mercy. However, this time, it was not something that the two of them could settle.","Although that was the case, Xuan Jiuling was in the wrong first, so he couldn’t directly pour cold water on the two of them. Therefore, he didn’t say it directly. Instead, he wanted to bring the two of them to An Zhenyu’s place first and let them hear the other party’s conditions.","This way, Huang Yueli and the rest would know the difficulty of this matter and would be able to listen to his suggestion.","“Alright, since Matriarch Huang says so, I’ll take you to the White Fen Clan’s encampment now.” Xuan Jiuling said as he stood up.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying smiled as they stood up.","It wasn’t that they couldn’t see through Xuan Jiuling’s thoughts, but only they themselves knew the true wealth of these two people.","Not only did she have the life-bound magic tools that she had plundered from the Phoenix clan, but she also had the heavenly and earthly treasures that she had collected from the small universe. The latter was something that no one else in the entire God Realm could take out.","Even if it was the Sacred Phoenix Clan’s warehouse, it might not be as rich as her collection. Furthermore, even if she was the clan leader, the clan’s warehouse was not something she could touch whenever she wanted. She might as well settle it herself."]},{"number":4870,"title":"Chapter 4870: Extortion","paragraphs":["Chapter 4870: Extortion","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Jiuling choked. Seeing that the two of them didn’t seem to care, he couldn’t help but shake his head.","Towards Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s innate talent, ability and character, he naturally acknowledged them but he didn’t think that these two youngsters would have enough wealth to deal with the White Fen Clan’s extortion.","After all, their ages were obvious.","No matter how talented they were, their experience was still limited. The accumulation of wealth required a certain amount of time. How much wealth could they have without relying on the family behind them?","Furthermore, it was obvious that Huang Yueli and Li Moying still needed to gain experience in the ways of the world.","At the very least, from their disdainful expressions just now, it could be seen that they knew nothing about the power of money and medicine.","In the God Realm, the strong were respected. However, at certain special times, no matter how powerful a warrior was, they had no choice but to lower their heads to the White Fen Clan. Naturally, the two of them were no exception.","Xuan Jiuling sighed in his heart and didn’t say anything. He silently brought the two of them to the gate of the mansion.","The guards of the White Fen Clan recognized Xuan Jiuling and were rather respectful. They immediately went to report.","But the three of them waited at the door for quite a while until Huang Yueli was getting impatient before a young man came out from the main door to welcome them.","“Ha ha, Divine General Xuan, what brings you here again? Didn’t you inform me in advance so that I could make preparations in advance so as not to neglect you?”","Although these words sounded very polite, the other party had come so late. His attitude was already very obvious. It was obvious that he wanted to leave them hanging.","Xuan Jiuling’s face sank, but he said,”Young Master An, you’re too polite.” You are the young master of a clan, and you personally received this old man. How can you say that you are neglecting me?”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying had been observing the person who had just arrived and when they heard Xuan Jiuling’s words, they revealed a look of realization.","It turned out that this was the young master of the White Fen Clan, Xuan Qingling’s fiancé, An Zhenyu.","An Zhenyu was tall and thin. His facial features were standard, but his skin was slightly pale and his eyes were dim, making him look feminine and handsome.","He was wearing a white long robe and the colour seemed plain but as a Spirit Armament Master, Huang Yueli could tell at a glance the preciousness and extravagance of the material. The white silk satin was faintly inlaid with golden threads, all of which were refined from a kind of Heaven Rank Spirit Beast’s back tendons, able to withstand the full strength attacks of Middle Stage Dao Profound Realm and below practitioners.","For such a powerful treasured armor to be made so exquisitely and beautifully, it wasn’t an easy task for Huang Yueli so one could imagine that its value must be astonishing.","It seemed that the White Fen Clan had indeed reaped a lot of benefits by relying on their ancestral medical skills.","Huang Yueli looked at An Zhenyu thoughtfully and she had to admit that although his innate talent was lacking, barely reaching the lowest limit of Heaven Grade innate talent, but his identity, financial resources and medical skills were all considered to be top notch.","He was not as handsome and righteous as her Senior Brother, nor was he as gentle and considerate as her Senior Brother.","In short, her Senior Brother was more compatible with Xuan Qingling.","An Zhenyu exchanged pleasantries with Xuan Jiuling before leading her into the study.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying wanted to follow in but were stopped by two servant girls,” Please hold on, my Young Master only wishes to see Divine General Xuan alone.”","“These two aren’t my juniors. I’m here today to introduce them to Young Master An,” Xuan Jiuling hurriedly said.","An Zhenyu frowned slightly.” What do you mean? Who are these two brats?”"]},{"number":4871,"title":"Chapter 4871: Settle It Privately","paragraphs":["Chapter 4871: Settle It Privately","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hearing An Zhenyu’s words, Xuan Jiuling’s expression changed slightly as his heart felt uneasy as he subconsciously looked towards Huang Yueli.","His original intention for coming here today was to be a peacemaker and mediate between the two sides to reach an agreement.","He had never expected that before he could even say why he was here, An Zhenyu would express his disdain so vividly.","With Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s identity and innate talent, when they heard An Zhenyu addressing them as ” little brat “, who knew how furious they would be. Could it be that both parties had yet to start negotiations and they were about to collapse?","However, Huang Yueli didn’t fall out with him on the spot as he had expected. She just raised her brows slightly as she walked straight up to An Zhenyu.","Let me introduce myself, I am Li Yuehuang and this person beside me is my husband Li Mo. This time, we have specially requested Divine General Xuan to introduce us because of my Senior Brother Liu Buyan.”","When she and Li Moying entered Snowflake City this time, they had already changed their appearances.","In the carriage, she had already asked Xuan Jiuling and found out that he hadn’t revealed their true identities to the White Loch Clan. Thus, she decided to go with the flow and continue using her fake identity to negotiate with An Zhenyu.","Liu Buyan’s matter was her private matter and if the clan knew about it, they would be restrained instead so it was better to settle it privately.","In any case, no matter how much An Zhenyu demanded, she had the ability to satisfy him.","Precisely because she had already made such a plan before she entered the house, so she didn’t plan to fuss over An Zhenyu’s contempt towards her and Li Moying.","She came here to save people and didn’t want any more trouble.","When Huang Yueli left her mouth, An Zhenyu was attracted by her and revealed a stunned expression.","Even with his status, he had never seen such a beauty.","When he heard Huang Yueli’s last sentence, An Zhenyu was slightly startled and immediately said in a playful tone: ” You’re the Junior Sister of that brat surnamed Liu?”","Huang Yueli nodded her head slowly,” That’s right, Young Master An, that Spirit Medicine Master Liu Buyan that you brought away from the inn a few months ago is my Senior Brother from the same sect. My husband and him are sworn brothers. My Senior Brother has an unruly personality and accidentally offended you. However, as far as I know, there seems to be some misunderstanding, so I specially came to visit to explain on behalf of my Senior Brother.”","“Explain?” As if he had heard a joke, An Zhenyu couldn’t help but sneer.” Since you’re here, you should know what crime Liu committed to end up in my hands, right? What else is there to explain?”","His pale face revealed a trace of coldness as he stared at Huang Yueli with an unfriendly gaze.","If it was a cultivator with low strength, it was inevitable that they would reveal a terrified expression at this time.","But to An Zhenyu’s surprise, Huang Yueli’s expression remained calm and composed.","“Young Master An, this is indeed a misunderstanding. I heard from Divine General Xuan that Young Master seemed to think that it was my Senior Brother who kidnapped Miss Qingling, but that was not the case. At that time, my Senior Brother entered Miss Xuan’s boudoir to treat her. Coincidentally, Miss Xuan was poisoned...”","Huang Yueli explained the sequence of events in detail.","However, when An Zhenyu heard this, he only let out a disdainful sneer.” Is that all you want to say? Did Liu tell you all this himself? This is just an excuse he used to escape punishment. Do you think I’ll believe such nonsense?”","Huang Yueli frowned,” My Senior Brother has always been a righteous person and would never lie...”","“There’s no need to say anymore! The evidence of him cuckolding this young master is already conclusive!” An Zhenyu interrupted her with a ferocious expression."]},{"number":4872,"title":"Chapter 4872: The Rumors Are True","paragraphs":["Chapter 4872: The Rumors Are True","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“You don’t have the final say on whether it’s decent or not.”","An Zhenyu rudely interrupted Huang Yueli’s words and no longer looked at her, but turned towards Xuan Jiuling who had been standing silently at the side.","“Lord Divine General, what do you mean? Why did you bring these two unpresentable things in front of me? Xuan Qingling ignored my engagement and caused me so much trouble, causing the White Fen Clan to lose face! I haven’t even held the Black Tortoise Clan accountable, yet you’re speaking up for that little thief surnamed Liu? I’ve always respected your achievements, but you can’t humiliate the White Fen Clan like this, right?”","An Zhenyu’s words were aggressive, and he was just short of pointing at Xuan Jiuling’s nose and cursing.","Even for an outsider like Huang Yueli who was watching, her heart was faintly angered.","No matter what, Xuan Jiuling was a Divine General of the Military Department. In order to resist the invasion of the Devils, he had made many contributions and protected the people of the twelve continents of the God Clan. He was a person worthy of respect.","An Zhenyu, who had never been to the front lines and had grown up in a luxurious environment, actually had such an arrogant and despotic attitude in front of the Divine General Xuan.","It seemed that the rumors about the White Fen Clan that were circulating in the God Realm were not wrong at all.","Huang Yueli couldn’t contain her anger and before Xuan Jiuling could say anything, she had already stepped forward.","” Enough, Young Master An. Divine General Xuan brought us here out of good intentions. If you have any grievances, you should just come at us. Why do you have to make things difficult for Divine General Xuan?”","“Ma...Cough, Madam Li, you...”","Xuan Jiuling had not expected Huang Yueli to speak out for justice.","After all, just two hours ago, Huang Yueli was still unhappy because he didn’t manage to take care of Liu Buyan’s matters.","An Zhenyu did not expect this little girl, who he did not even take seriously, to actually dare to speak to him in such a tone. For a moment, he was stunned.","He sized up Huang Yueli for a while and couldn’t help but laugh coldly: ” Who do you think you are? What qualifications do you have to be so presumptuous in front of me? Hurry up and get out!”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli’s expression changed slightly.","It wasn’t because of An Zhenyu’s arrogance, but because she could feel the Profound Energy fluctuations from her husband’s body behind her.","Although it was very weak, so weak that she couldn’t detect it, but she was very clear that Li Moying was angry.","What her husband could not stand the most was someone insulting her.","Huang Yueli hurriedly grabbed Li Moying’s sleeve and tugged, hinting at him to calm down.","At the same time, he suppressed the anger in his heart and quickly turned around. I’ve heard of the rules of the White Fen Clan. Since we came here today, we naturally wouldn’t come empty-handed. As long as Young Master An can be magnanimous and let my Senior Brother go, then we will definitely do our best to satisfy Young Master.”","Huang Yueli had lived two lifetimes and she rarely had the time to lower her voice. Especially with the increase in her strength, whenever she met someone like An Zhenyu, she had already taught him how to behave.","However, for the sake of her Senior Brother, she could only lower her stance.","After all, Liu Buyan had already fallen into the hands of the White Fen Clan for over two months and she didn’t know what the situation was like so she didn’t dare to take the risk.","When An Zhenyu heard her say this, he immediately revealed a disdainful expression and sneered,”Just you guys? They’re just two country bumpkins who came out of nowhere and want to redeem someone from me? Can you afford the price I want?”"]},{"number":4873,"title":"Chapter 4873: An Zhenyu’s Condition","paragraphs":["Chapter 4873: An Zhenyu’s Condition","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli’s attitude was calm as she spoke in a neither slow nor fast manner: ” Young Master An, how do you know that we can’t afford the ransom? Why don’t you state your conditions first? Although we’re young and inexperienced, we’ve always been lucky. Who knows if we might just happen to have what you want?”","An Zhenyu stared at her for a while and couldn’t help but laugh out loud.","“As expected of a girl who hasn’t experienced anything. She doesn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth! With cultivators like you, even if your luck is heaven-defying, it’s impossible for you to take out true rare treasures!”","Huang Yueli’s small face hung a smile,” Isn’t it too early for Young Master An to come to a conclusion now?”","“Alright, since you think so highly of yourselves, then listen to me!”","An Zhenyu sneered and turned around. He extended his right hand and pointed at the northeast corner of the room.","“Do you see the pill furnace over there? That was when I was refining pills the day before yesterday. I was careless and caused the furnace to explode. Now that this alchemy furnace has been repaired, its grade will inevitably drop. I’m thinking of changing it to a new furnace. As long as you can find an alchemy furnace of the same grade, I will let that Liu brat go.”","Huang Yueli followed the direction of his finger and looked over.","In the corner, there was an alchemy furnace that was one and a half person’s height. Although Huang Yueli wasn’t considered proficient in spirit medicine, but just from the material structure and the array patterns embedded on the outside, she could tell that this alchemy furnace wasn’t an ordinary item.","Unfortunately, a large hole had exploded in the furnace’s chamber. It was pitch-black inside. Clearly, it was severely damaged. Even the array patterns on the outside had been destroyed.","It was indeed as An Zhenyu had said. It would be difficult to repair it.","An alchemy furnace was different from ordinary spirit weapons. Not only did the person who refined it need to have high attainments in spirit weapon techniques, but they also had to be very familiar with spirit medicine techniques. Therefore, the production was very rare. It was almost impossible to find a grandmaster who could repair it.","Huang Yueli’s expression was pensive as she stared at the furnace. Suddenly, her gaze swept across a rugged pattern at the bottom of the pill furnace and her pupils suddenly contracted.","If she was not mistaken, this should be...","No, if it really was that kind of treasure, An Zhenyu would probably be so anxious that he wouldn’t even have the appetite to eat or drink if he accidentally damaged it. How could he be speaking in such a casual tone?","What was going on?","Huang Yueli kept on thinking but her dazed look, in An Zhenyu’s eyes, seemed like she was helpless.","“What’s wrong? Now he knew who he was? It’s just a pill furnace, something that this Young Master would casually throw away if he broke it. It’s also a treasure that you lowly people will never see in your lifetime!”","An Zhenyu sneered and said,” I’ve already sympathized with your youth and deliberately said less. If it was Divine General Xuan who came to redeem you himself, he wouldn’t be able to send you away with such a small amount of money. You can’t even take this out, and you still dare to waste my time?!” Hurry up and get lost!”","Huang Yueli was deep in thought and only when she heard An Zhenyu’s icy cold voice did she suddenly come back to her senses.","She ignored the mockery in An Zhenyu’s words and asked,”Young Master An, this alchemy furnace of yours... It should be a middle-grade artifact, right?”","When An Zhenyu heard this, he was stunned.” Little girl, you’re quite knowledgeable. You can even tell the grade of this alchemy furnace! Now you should know how rare this pill furnace is, right?”"]},{"number":4874,"title":"Chapter 4874: It’s a Deal","paragraphs":["Chapter 4874: It’s a Deal","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli stared at the pill furnace for a while but didn’t say anything.","An Zhenyu waved his hand impatiently.” That’s enough. If you can’t pay the ransom, get lost. Don’t waste my time.” Men, escort the Divine General Xuan and his two followers out!”","The guards at the door responded and entered, wanting to forcefully chase them away.","However, before they could get close, Huang Yueli took a step forward,” Wait a moment, Young Master An! I have another request.”","An Zhenyu frowned.” What else do you want to say? I advise you not to waste your breath. Since I’ve stated my conditions, I won’t change them! If you can’t take out a new pill furnace, don’t even think about meeting that Liu brat.”","Huang Yueli’s tone was calm as she replied: ” Sir, you’ve misunderstood. I just wanted to ask. If I can take out an alchemy furnace that is of a higher grade than a middle grade treasured weapon, then can I take this damaged old alchemy furnace away? This pill furnace has been severely damaged, so I don’t think you can use it anymore, Young Master. However, I’m a Spirit Armament Master myself, so I can still use the materials extracted from these fragments.”","An Zhenyu didn’t expect Huang Yueli to raise such a request and after being stunned for a while, he couldn’t help but burst out laughing.","“How interesting. You’re just a little girl, and you still want to find a higher grade pill furnace? He really did not know the immensity of heaven and earth! As long as you can take out a pill furnace of the same grade, I’ll let you take this old pill furnace. Anyway, it’s trash that I don’t need.”","An Zhenyu was certain that this was just an excuse Huang Yueli used to delay time.","After all, for many years, the White Fen Clan had been collecting top-notch pill furnaces through various channels. In addition, the various races in the God Realm had offered offerings to the White Fen Clan’s divine doctor for consultation. It could be said that more than 90% of the pill furnaces above the level of artifacts in the entire God Realm were in the hands of the White Fen Clan.","The remaining ones were all treasured and collected by the various large factions.","An ordinary person would never see a Treasure Armament pill furnace in their entire life.","Even if someone occasionally took it out for auction, that would absolutely be a sky-high price too. Even with Dao Profound Realm powerhouses ‘worth, it was very hard to bear. It was even more impossible for these two little ghosts in front of him to be able to afford it.","Huang Yueli ignored An Zhenyu’s disdainful tone as she nodded lightly,” Since that’s the case, then it’s settled.”","An Zhenyu sneered and could not even be bothered to say anything.","Huang Yueli continued: ” To be honest, to find a furnace that is exactly the same as yours is really too difficult. It’s impossible for me to do it.”","An Zhenyu sneered.” You’re finally telling the truth. I think you’re still pretending...”","“However...” Huang Yueli’s tone changed,” I happen to have a top grade Treasure Armament pill refining furnace which should be enough to make up for your loss. I hope Young Master An can keep his word and release my Senior Brother.”","“You... What did you say?” An Zhenyu’s face was filled with shock. He could not believe his ears.” You have a top grade Treasure Armament pill refining furnace?”","However, after a few breaths, he calmed down and the mocking expression on his face deepened.","“Little girl, do you take me for a fool? Who are you? Have you ever seen a top grade Treasure Armament pill refining furnace? How dare you boast like this? These methods of yours to delay time can fool others, but in front of this young master...He could only humiliate himself!","Why aren’t you giving it to me...”","He suddenly stopped mid-sentence and his eyes widened."]},{"number":4875,"title":"Chapter 4875: Origin of the Furnace","paragraphs":["Chapter 4875: Origin of the Furnace","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli’s right hand flipped lightly and an alchemy furnace appeared out of thin air in the front hall.","This really shocked An Zhenyu.","The alchemy furnace was not a small spirit armament like armor. It was a large object that was at least two to three meters tall. It was impossible to store it in an interspatial ring of a lower grade.","To be able to carry such a huge pill furnace around with her, it already showed that Huang Yueli’s net worth wasn’t small.","An Zhenyu was stunned for a moment before he came back to his senses. He snorted and said,” You’re not simple. It seems that you two brats have some fortuitous encounters. No wonder you dare to speak to me like this. However, how could an ordinary person obtain a high-grade artifact? I’m afraid you don’t even know how to differentiate the grade of the pill furnace. Today, I’ll be kind and teach you guys a good lesson.”","After An Zhenyu finished speaking, he walked to the side of the pill furnace and walked half a circle around it.","As he walked, he said,”The pill furnaces on the market are generally only spirit armaments. They have different appearances. However, as long as it reached the level of a Treasure Armament, there would be special fire marks on the furnace’s mouth, air intake, and top. The fire marks of low grade artifacts are red, mid grade artifacts are silver, and high grade artifacts are gold.”","“The darker the color, the better the quality of the alchemy furnace.”","“As for your pill refinement furnace, we just need to open the lid and look at the mouth of the furnace to know. It’s just a...”","An Zhenyu said with a mocking expression on his face as he reached out and lifted the lid of the furnace.","He casually glanced at it, but the next moment, his expression suddenly changed.","Her unfinished words were stuck in her throat.","Huang Yueli’s lips curled up as she asked politely: ” Young Master An, how is my pill furnace? Please enlighten me?”","“This... This...”","An Zhenyu was tongue-tied and speechless for a long time.","The little girl took out the pill furnace. Not only was there a distinct fire mark on the furnace, but the fire mark was also golden!","It was not the faint golden color he had seen on the alchemy furnace in the past. Instead, it was as if a golden light had shot out, so bright that it was almost blinding.","An Zhenyu was in a daze for quite a while but Huang Yueli didn’t rush him as she found a chair and sat down to wait.","About half a minute later, An Zhenyu seemed to have suddenly woken up.","He stretched out his finger and rubbed it back and forth on the golden fire mark, as if he wanted to rub it to see if it was real or fake.","After a while, he squatted down again and checked the air intake at the bottom. Then, he climbed onto the stool and carefully observed the top of the alchemy furnace.","The surprise in his eyes increased with each look.","After the inspection, he got down from the stool and looked at Huang Yueli again.","“Cough cough, little girl, where did you get this alchemy furnace?” An Zhenyu coughed lightly and restrained his excited expression. He put on the airs of the young master of the Ancient God Clan again.","Huang Yueli replied indifferently: ” It’s just a chance encounter between me and my husband. It’s not worth mentioning.”","An Zhenyu frowned slightly when he heard this.","He didn’t expect this little girl to be so alert. This answer was equivalent to not saying anything.","Going out to train and not exposing one’s whereabouts and origins as much as possible was a code of conduct that all experienced people knew.","He saw that Huang Yueli was young so he deliberately asked her but he didn’t expect to meet with a rebuff.","An Zhenyu’s expression darkened.” Miss Li, I advise you not to hide anything. Tell me the origin of the alchemy furnace. You should know that the status of our White Fen Clan is here. If the origin of this pill furnace is unknown, wouldn’t we be in trouble for no reason? At that time, it will affect the reputation of the White Fen Clan. Can the two of you bear the responsibility?”"]},{"number":4876,"title":"Chapter 4876: Deal canceled","paragraphs":["Chapter 4876: Deal canceled","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","An Zhenyu’s tone was stern as he questioned repeatedly, thinking that under his pressure, Huang Yueli would definitely not be able to withstand the pressure and would speak the truth.","From his point of view, for a lass like Huang Yueli to be able to obtain such a treasure, she must have been extremely lucky.","If he could dig out the truth from her mouth, he might be able to make use of it and obtain a thousand times the benefits.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t even lift her eyelids as she replied coldly: ” Young Master An is too serious. The White Fen Clan has an outstanding status. Who in the entire God Realm can afford to offend them? How could they possibly lose their reputation because of a nobody like me?”","An Zhenyu didn’t expect her to be so calm. He tried to get her to tell him the truth, but he couldn’t get a single word out of her.","He gradually lost his patience and his voice became colder.” Miss Li, are you determined not to tell me? Don’t tell me you don’t want to see your Senior Brother?”","Even when she heard Liu Buyan’s name, Huang Yueli only raised her brows slightly.","Not only was he not frightened, he even found it funny.” What? Young Master An, didn’t we agree on this just now? As long as I can bring out an alchemy furnace that is better than a middle-grade artifact, you will immediately release him. Why, are you going back on your word?”","” Hmph!” An Zhenyu harrumphed coldly. There was no shame on his face at all. He said righteously,” It’s not that the White Fen Clan is regretting their decision. It’s just that you can’t even explain the origin of the alchemy furnace!” For the sake of my family’s honor, I cannot take such a risk. As long as you explain clearly, I’ll immediately let her go. How about it?”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as she looked at An Zhenyu with a smile that was not a smile.","An Zhenyu probably thought she was a fool.","She said that she wanted to know her background but in fact, she just wanted to feel out her and Li Moying’s background.","Two young cultivators who did not seem to have any background were carrying such a treasure on their bodies. Naturally, it would attract people’s covetous gazes.","An Zhenyu was probably not satisfied with a mere alchemy furnace and wanted to bully them by taking all the treasures in their hands.","Unfortunately, she and Li Moying weren’t ordinary people.","She didn’t mention the origin of the alchemy furnace, nor was she afraid that someone would snatch it away. It was just that... He had forgotten.","After all, he had collected too many treasures in the past few years.","She didn’t know which treasure vault he had taken it from, so it wasn’t worth it for her to remember its origins.","“In that case...”","Huang Yueli took a step back and just as An Zhenyu thought that she was about to give in, she suddenly waved her right hand.","Following her actions, the alchemy furnace disappeared in an instant.","“Since Young Master An has misgivings, I can’t force you. I can only understand. Let’s cancel our deal.”","As she spoke, she turned around and walked towards the door.","An Zhenyu was stunned.","By the time he regained his senses, Huang Yueli had already walked to the front of the door and with a single stride, she went out.","He quickly chased after her.” Wait, Miss Li, you...” Wait a moment! When did I say that the deal was canceled? I just want to clarify things. You...","What do you mean by that? Are you really not planning to redeem Liu Buyan?”","An Zhenyu had never thought that Huang Yueli would have such a reaction and without saying a word, he kept the pill furnace back.","Didn’t they say earlier that they had a deep relationship as senior siblings and would spare no expense to save Liu Buyan?","In the end, he gave up after encountering such a small problem?","When Huang Yueli saw An Zhenyu chasing after her, her footsteps halted as she laughed coldly in her heart.","She knew it. As a Spirit Medicine Master, An Zhenyu would definitely want to get his hands on such a good alchemy furnace. Now that she was going to take the alchemy furnace away, it would be strange if An Zhenyu wasn’t anxious."]},{"number":4877,"title":"Chapter 4877: Doing Many Wicked Things","paragraphs":["Chapter 4877: Doing Many Wicked Things","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli stood at the door with a regretful expression,” Of course I want to save my Senior Brother but Young Master An’s concern is very reasonable so I can’t force him to do anything...”","When An Zhenyu heard this, he had the urge to vomit blood.","How could he not understand that Huang Yueli had deliberately said this because she was certain that he was unwilling to give up on the top grade treasured pill furnace.","He secretly gritted his teeth in hatred. He wanted to forcefully seize the alchemy furnace and this young man and woman.","These two brats had no foundation and did not have the ability to fight him head-on.","However, just as he raised his brows, a figure walked out from the side, blocking between him and Huang Yueli.","“Young Master An, I didn’t expect such an outcome. What a pity. I’ve been presumptuous today. I won’t disturb you any further. I’ll take them away now.” Xuan Jiuling said unhurriedly.","An Zhenyu suddenly raised his head, narrowed his eyes, and glared fiercely at Xuan Jiuling.","He had almost forgotten that this old thing was also present.","He didn’t know what benefits Xuan Jiuling had gained from these two little brats, which was why he had been able to deal with them and bring them to him.","However, An Zhenyu knew that Xuan Jiuling had been in the military all year round and had an upright personality. If he wanted to snatch these two little brats in front of him, he would definitely interfere.","Today...It was probably impossible to detain him.","An Zhenyu was depressed, but he could only soften his tone.” Please wait a moment, Divine General Xuan. Although our clan has a rule that we can’t accept items of unknown origin, since you, Divine General, have guaranteed it, it’s not like we can’t make an exception...”","With just a few words, he managed to smooth things over. It sounded as if he had bought Xuan Jiuling a huge favor.","It seemed that he had done many wicked things like extorting money in the past.","Huang Yueli laughed coldly in her heart but her face didn’t show it. She only asked: ” So Young Master An has agreed to let her go?”","An Zhenyu nodded. However, what he said was,” I can let her go, but since I can’t tell the origin of your alchemy furnace, I have to check it carefully to prevent any mistakes.”","How could Huang Yueli not know that he was trying to find a mistake in the quality of the pill refining furnace so as to deny it.","After all, high-grade Bejeweled Artifact level pill furnaces were practically all passed down from ancient times.","After so many years, it would be abnormal if there were no problems.","Unfortunately, the person he met wasn’t anyone else but Huang Yueli.","Before she came to visit with Xuan Jiuling, she had already thought of using this alchemy furnace to redeem her, so before she left, she did a little inspection. The small defects on the surface were repaired, and even the incomplete array patterns were repaired.","Huang Yueli didn’t say another word as she waved her sleeves and took out the pill furnace once again.","An Zhenyu’s eyes instantly lit up. He used up all his self-control to not immediately pounce on her and hug her. Instead, he pretended to cough lightly and slowly walked over to examine her carefully.","He had checked the furnace with the intention of finding fault, but he never expected that he would check the entire furnace from the top to the bottom. He even reached into the furnace and touched the array patterns in detail.","In the end, he still couldn’t find any problems.","This alchemy furnace was completely preserved and its appearance was perfect. It was simply inconceivable!","It was as if it had just been refined by a Spirit Armament Master.","Was he really not dreaming?","“How is it? Young Master An, are you done with your examination?” An hour later, Huang Yueli had lost her patience and urged him."]},{"number":4878,"title":"Chapter 4878: Don’t do anything unnecessary","paragraphs":["Chapter 4878: Don’t do anything unnecessary","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","It would be best to avoid any unnecessary action.","An Zhenyu was reluctant to let Huang Yueli and the others off without further discussion.","However, something did strike him as rather peculiar.","He had already taken the time to thoroughly examine the alchemy furnace from top to bottom. Despite the fact that it was almost smashed into pieces, he was unable to identify any issues with it despite checking it countless times.","Even if he wished to look for a bone in an egg, he was unable to do so.","As the day was drawing to a close, An Zhenyu finally straightened his back and said reluctantly,” The problem with this alchemy furnace is not small. However, it’s not easy for you two brats to get such a treasure. If I were to argue with you, it would seem that our White Marsh Race is not generous enough.”","Huang Yueli resisted the urge to roll her eyes, but instead she said, “Thank you, Young Master An, for your help.”","An Zhenyu’s demeanor was somewhat aloof as he grunted in acknowledgment. If I may be so bold, I would like to accept this alchemy furnace. If you would be so kind as to leave now.","Huang Yueli looked slightly perplexed and enquired, “Young Master An, could I possibly ask where my Senior Brother is?”","“What? Tell me, who am I? Are you worried that I will break the contract and not let him go?” An Zhenyu looked slightly displeased. I’m afraid that he isn’t here. He’s being held in a house on the outskirts of the city. Just follow the Steward to get him.","Huang Yueli narrowed her eyes.","She was somewhat taken aback by An Zhenyu’s lack of respect. He had already taken advantage of her, yet he was still reluctant to hand her over. It was obvious that he had bad intentions.","However, she took a moment to consider her options and decided to withhold judgement for now. Instead, she replied, “In that case, thank you, Young Master An. My husband and I will leave now. Please use this alchemy furnace well. It was not easy for my husband and I to obtain this item...”","She deliberately put on a conflicted expression, as if she were in a difficult situation and as if a piece of flesh had been cut off. Upon seeing it, An Zhenyu felt a sense of joy.","While he was pleased to have obtained a treasure, he felt a certain satisfaction in taking away someone else’s beloved item.","” Alright, alright.” He waved his hand.” Treasures are just worldly possessions. How can they be more important than human lives?” Liu Buyan had offended this Young Lord’s fiancée and this was originally a sin that couldn’t be made up for even with a thousand cuts but now I shall make the decision to release him! Men!”","An Zhenyu called out, and a Steward promptly made his way to him.","“Young Master, may I inquire as to what your orders are?”","“Take them to the dungeon and let that kid with the name Liu go!” An Zhenyu ordered.","The Steward was stunned for a moment.” Let him go? However, Young Master, that Liu...”","He was interrupted by An Zhenyu.","“If I told you to release, just go. Don’t do anything unnecessary. Do you understand?”","The Steward was visibly shaken and suddenly grasped the situation as he nodded his head in agreement and turned towards Huang Yueli.","“Everyone, please follow me.”","Xuan Jiuling didn’t suspect anything and heaved a sigh of relief.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but notice that An Zhenyu’s tone seemed slightly off.","“Aren’t you in a hurry to save him?” he snorted coldly. Why aren’t you leaving yet?”","Huang Yueli regained her senses and looked towards the back corner of the room. “Young Master An, I believe we previously agreed that this damaged pill furnace of yours should be exchanged with mine.”","An Zhenyu was momentarily taken aback before recalling the agreement he had made on impulse.","However, he now had the benefit of a superior-grade Treasure Armament alchemy furnace. It was not of concern to him that the middle-grade Treasure Armament was damaged. He casually waved his hand and said, “Take it, take it.”"]},{"number":4879,"title":"Chapter 4879: A Feud","paragraphs":["Chapter 4879: A Feud","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","An inexplicable trace of joy flashed by her eyes but her expression remained as if nothing had happened as she quickly walked over and kept the damaged pill furnace into her space.","Following that, she nodded towards Li Moying and Xuan Jiuling.","The three of them followed behind the Steward and left quietly.","An Zhenyu stared at their backs as his gaze gradually turned cold. He was unwilling to tell them the origin of this alchemy furnace? Don’t worry, I have a way to make you speak.”","Perhaps in an hour, that little girl would be kneeling and begging him.","Huang Yueli and the rest left the White Fen Clan’s residence and urged the Steward to bring them to fetch the person.","At first, the Steward wanted to put on airs and get some benefits from the two young men.","However, Xuan Jiuling snorted coldly, and the Steward’s legs couldn’t help but go weak.","No matter how polite a peak Dao Profound Realm powerhouse was in front of their Young Lord, his strength was still placed there. It was not what an ordinary cultivator like him could afford to provoke.","The Steward did not dare to delay and took the three of them to the western suburbs by carriage.","The few of them stopped at the entrance of a desolate courtyard.","The moment Huang Yueli alighted from the carriage, she looked at the surrounding environment and her brows furrowed slightly.","“The Evil Qi here is very heavy. I’m afraid it’s an ominous place. Senior Brother has been locked up in this place for several months. I’m afraid things are not going well.”","Xuan Jiuling glanced at her, his expression grave.” Miss Li, you’re right. This place used to be the old water prison of Snowflake City. It was used to lock up people who had colluded with the Devils to murder their own race. Many people died in prison, and the Evil Qi is indeed very heavy. I heard that this place has been abandoned for many years. I didn’t expect it to be used by the White Fen Clan.”","“So that’s how it is...” Huang Yueli was deep in thought.","The two of them had extremely high cultivation levels, so the Steward couldn’t eavesdrop on their conversation.","He led the three of them in through a detour. With the red token An Zhenyu had given them, they passed through several guards and walked down the stairs. After entering several iron gates, they finally arrived outside a water prison.","Steward Meng, are you here today to teach this trash who dared to offend Miss Xuan a lesson on behalf of Young Master?”","When the guards at the door saw that the young master’s favorite had arrived, they immediately showed a flattering expression and went forward to greet him.","“This kid was still clamoring every day a while ago, saying that his Junior Sister would come to save him. No matter how he was taught a lesson, he refused to lower his head. Now that he has been locked up for a long time, he has stopped. We’ll follow Young Master’s instructions and take care of this kid every day. Hehe, we definitely won’t slack off...”","Steward Meng raised a hand and interrupted the guard.” Alright, thank you for your hard work. However, the Young Master had ordered that he be released. Go and unlock the door.”","The guard was stunned for a moment, apparently not expecting to hear such words.","However, he did not dare to disobey An Zhenyu’s orders. He quickly responded and turned around to enter the water prison.","Not long after, he dragged out a man covered in blood and staggering.","Huang Yueli took a closer look and her entire body shook,” Senior Brother! Senior Brother, you... How are you?”","Although the person in front of her was in a sorry state, but how could she not recognise that this was Liu Buyan himself.","Huang Yueli’s gaze swept past Liu Buyan’s face and landed on his scarred body as her face was gradually tainted with a layer of anger.","Even though she had long guessed that Liu Buyan’s situation wouldn’t be good if he fell into An Zhenyu’s hands, but when she saw Liu Buyan being tormented so miserably, she couldn’t help but feel her rage surge up.","This feud between her and the White Fen Clan... it’s official!"]},{"number":4880,"title":"Chapter 4880: Nonsense!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4880: Nonsense!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Liu Buyan heard the commotion, he raised his head and looked towards Huang Yueli.","“Junior Sister, it’s really... It really is you! Finally...You’re finally back. I knew it...Cough cough!”","Liu Buyan’s words were halfway through when his body suddenly weakened and he was about to fall onto the ground.","Huang Yueli shot over like an arrow, wanting to support him but the instant she touched Liu Buyan, an arm stretched out from the side and grabbed Liu Buyan’s shoulder to support him.","“Brother Liu, be careful. Li ‘er has been worried about you these past few days, you have to take care of yourself.”","Li Moying swept him a glance as he said expressionlessly.","These were clearly words of concern, but when he said it with his stoic face, it made people feel a faint threat.","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment as she couldn’t help but roll her eyes at Li Moying.","Her husband was still jealous at a time like this!","Steward Meng coughed and interrupted their conversation.” Young Master Li, Madam Li, how is it? Our Young Master is a man of his word, right? Since Young Master Liu is in your hands now, I have finished my work here. I’ll take my leave first.”","After he finished speaking, he nodded towards Huang Yueli and turned around to leave.","This time, even Xuan Jiuling who accompanied Huang Yueli and her husband to the scene felt that something was amiss.","This Steward Meng...He was a little too straightforward today.","Who didn’t know the White Fen Clan’s usual character? They would cause trouble for no reason. They wouldn’t let them go unless they made things difficult for them.","Not only was Young Master An Zhenyu difficult to deal with, but the Stewards below were also not easy to deal with.","However, today, Steward Meng did not waste any words and brought them to the water prison. He released them without saying anything and left immediately after releasing them...","This was not normal.","Xuan Jiuling frowned slightly as he wanted to remind Huang Yueli.","However, before he could open his mouth, Liu Buyan coughed out,” Wait... Wait a minute! Steward, please wait, my...Where’s my antidote?”","Steward Meng stopped in his tracks.","The corners of his mouth curled up, but his tone was completely innocent.” Young Master Liu, what do you mean? What antidote?”","Liu Buyan coughed a few times,” Why play dumb? The pill you forced down my throat last time, I have to take the antidote every month, right? Since Young Master An had agreed to let me go, then the antidote...Why don’t you give it to me as well?”","When Huang Yueli heard that, her face sank.","Previously when she first saw Liu Buyan, she felt that his face was green and white. She had some medical knowledge and could tell that he was poisoned but she didn’t know what kind of situation Liu Buyan was in.","Now that she heard what her Senior Brother said, she instantly understood.","“Steward Meng, what poison did your Young Master give my Senior Brother? Where is the antidote? The White Fen Clan pretended to release them but refused to give them the antidote. This ...Did you do it on purpose? Are you trying to cheat me?”","Steward Meng dragged out his tone. “Oh my, Madam Li, your words are too harsh.” You asked our Young Master to use the Alchemy furnace to redeem Young Master Liu. Then didn’t our Young Master let him go without hesitation? As for the antidote you mentioned...I really don’t understand. I think this Young Master Liu is just weak. He’s not born to live a long life. I’m afraid he has been infected with something. How can he blame it on our Young Master?”","Hearing such shameless words, everyone present was furious.","Even Xuan Jiuling couldn’t control his anger as he roared in anger, “What nonsense!”"]},{"number":4881,"title":"Chapter 4881: Completely Different Person","paragraphs":["Chapter 4881: Completely Different Person","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Even though Xuan Jiuling was restrained by his family and didn’t want to cause trouble, he still couldn’t hold it in when he heard such shameless remarks.","He was the one who brought her to the White Fen Clan but An Zhenyu didn’t give him any face as a senior and continued to make things difficult for Huang Yueli and the rest.","Forget it.","Now that Huang Yueli had taken out a priceless treasure as ransom, this price was something that even the Black Tortoise Clan couldn’t afford. An Zhenyu had taken advantage of her and even secretly set up a trap for her...","“The White Fen Clan went back on their word and made things difficult for two ordinary cultivators. Aren’t they afraid that they will be cursed by tens of thousands of people if word gets out? How preposterous! Where is the antidote? Hurry up and hand it over! Do you think I won’t dare to kill you?”","Xuan Jiuling’s eyes flashed with a cold light, and the pressure on his body suddenly erupted.","Steward Meng couldn’t take it and staggered a few steps back. He still couldn’t stand properly and fell to the ground, his face turning pale.","With his strength and status, he dared to make trouble for the White Fen Clan. When Xuan","Jiuling was truly angry, he immediately panicked.","Steward Meng explained in fear,”Xuan...” Divine General Xuan, Please...Please show mercy! I’m really...I really didn’t mean to not give you the antidote. I’m just a nobody. All of us...we all listen to the Young Master’s orders. I... How can I have an antidote?”","“You still dare to be stubborn? Since you’re useless, why don’t you kill me with one slash? I believe Young Master An wouldn’t challenge this Divine General for a mere errand boy!”","Steward Meng was so frightened that his entire body trembled.” Spare me! Lord Divine General, spare me!” I really have no choice!”","Xuan Jiuling still wanted to say something when he heard Huang Yueli’s unhurried voice.","“Divine General Xuan, forget it. What he said is indeed true. He’s just a dog who relies on others’ power. How can he have the ability to get the antidote?”","When Steward Meng heard this, he turned towards Huang Yueli and bowed continuously,” Thank you Madam Li for standing up for justice, this lowly one...This little one is extremely grateful...”","That fawning expression was totally different from his previous arrogant look, as though he hadn’t heard Huang Yueli mocking him for being a dog.","Xuan Jiuling couldn’t even be bothered to look at him and when he heard the commotion, he turned towards Huang Yueli,” Huang...Young Miss Li, what do you mean? Could it be that we’re just going to let it go? However, the White Fen Clan has many strange pill recipes. The pill that Young Master Liu ate is most likely very dangerous. If there’s no antidote...”","As he spoke, he frowned.","There were many vicious medicinal pills circulating in the God Realm. Some not only harmed people’s lives, but they could even make people wish they were dead.","To the White Fen Clan, these pills were not difficult to obtain. If they were to ignore them, who knew what would happen when the medicinal effects took effect a month later?","“No, let’s go back and look for An Zhenyu now! Even if I have to risk being punished by the family, I have to help you get the antidote!” Xuan Jiuling looked anxious as he turned around to go to the White Fen Clan.","Huang Yueli hurriedly stretched out her hand to stop him,” Divine General Xuan, please hold on! I have my own plans for this matter. You don’t have to worry.”","Xuan Jiuling stopped in his tracks and frowned even more.” Young Miss Li, don’t underestimate the medical skills of the White Fen Clan. Even Divine Doctor Zhang might not be able to cure the poison they use","to harm people!”","“I know.” Huang Yueli smiled,” Of course I want the antidote. But we don’t need to look for An Zhenyu, he will naturally come to look for me.”","Xuan Jiuling was stunned.” What do you mean? An Zhenyu is probably waiting for you to beg him. How can he take the initiative...”","Before he could finish, he heard a flurry of footsteps coming from the corridor of the water prison.","“Steward Meng, where are Young Master Li and Madam Li? Are they still there?”"]},{"number":4882,"title":"Chapter 4882: Is This The Way To Beg Someone?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4882: Is This The Way To Beg Someone?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Someone was running over from the end of the corridor.","Hearing the commotion, everyone present was stunned.","Steward Meng was the most confused. He turned to the person who had come, his face full of doubt.” What’s going on? What was going on? Steward Ning, why are you here?”","Wasn’t it just bringing two young cultivators who were still wet behind the ears to pick someone up?","It was already a big deal to send a Steward over for such a small matter. Why did he send another person over?","Steward Ning didn’t reply as he panted heavily as he ran over. When he saw that Huang Yueli and the others were still there, he let out a long breath.","He cupped his hands towards Huang Yueli and pulled out a smile,” Madam Li, Young Master Li, the two of you haven’t left yet? That would be great! Just now, our Young Master instructed that he still has something to ask the two of you. Could the two of you please follow me?”","This time, Steward Meng’s jaw almost fell to the ground.","Earlier when Huang Yueli said that she wouldn’t look for An Zhenyu and would let him invite her, Steward Meng scoffed in his heart, feeling that this lass’s brain must have gone into water to actually daydream, not even thinking about her own capabilities!","He didn’t expect her to be right!","How was this possible?","What did these two little brats do to make their Young Master take the initiative to invite them?","He wasn’t the only one who had this question. Even Xuan Jiuling was confused.","Xuan Jiuling naturally knew Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s true abilities but when they left earlier, An Zhenyu’s attitude was something he had seen clearly.","In less than two hours, the other party’s attitude had completely changed...What exactly happened?","Liu Buyan also didn’t understand. It wasn’t enough but this didn’t stop him from blindly trusting his Junior Sister.","He slapped his thigh.” Hey, this is interesting. Is this the attitude you use to beg others? Let me tell you, my Junior Sister isn’t someone who can be invited just because anyone wants to. If An Zhenyu insists on seeing her, then let him come over himself!”","Steward Meng and Steward Ning’s expressions changed drastically. Clearly they had not expected that Liu Buyan who was already tortured half to death would still be so arrogant at such a time.","However, Steward Ning still remembered the order he had received before he came over as he suppressed his anger and turned towards Huang Yueli,” Young Miss Li, isn’t your Senior Brother going overboard? My Young Master is already very polite...”","“Oh? How is my Senior Brother going overboard?”","Steward Ning hadn’t even finished speaking when he was interrupted by Huang Yueli.","A faint smile hung on her fair and delicate face.” I think my Senior Brother is right. Young Master An wants to see me, but I don’t want to see him. Since I’ve paid the ransom and Young Master An has released him, our deal is over. Why don’t we part ways here?”","As she said that, she stretched out her hand and held Li Moying’s arm as she raised her head,” Husband, let’s go back? It’s so humid here...”","Hearing this, Li Moying’s calm and indifferent face suddenly showed a trace of anxiety.","He hurriedly hugged Huang Yueli’s waist and protected her in his embrace,” You’re not feeling well, why didn’t you say so earlier? Couldn’t he take care of his own body? Think about it. You’re different from before. You’re...”","“Hey, hey, hey. Alright, alright. Don’t keep talking about me. Husband, have you realized that you are becoming more and more like a mother?” Huang Yueli pouted.","She was afraid that Li Moying would reveal the fact that she was pregnant so she quickly pinched him.","Li Moying gave a light snort as he tightened his arm and brought her out."]},{"number":4883,"title":"Chapter 4883: Must Be Rewarded","paragraphs":["Chapter 4883: Must Be Rewarded","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Hey, wait!” Looking at their backs which had no signs of turning back, Liu Buyan’s mouth twitched,” You guys...You’re leaving just like that? Have you forgotten about your poor Senior Brother? No one came to help me?”","Li Moying’s footsteps halted but he didn’t turn back. He only sneered coldly,” Stop pretending. I know you can still walk.”","“Damn!” Liu Buyan couldn’t help but curse.","Earlier when he saw Li Moying appearing together with Huang Yueli, he was really touched and felt that this brat had discovered his conscience.","He had not expected that everything was just his misconception. Li Moying this fellow was still as annoying as before!","“Husband...” Huang Yueli couldn’t bear it as she tugged at Li Moying’s sleeve,” Don’t be like this, Senior Brother is already very pitiful...”","The man, who was originally impatient, heard the voice of the girl in his arms and his gaze softened.” Alright, alright, alright. I’ll listen to you. Shall I help him up?”","“Don’t... Farewell, there’s no need to trouble Young Master Li.” Liu Buyan got goosebumps from these two people’s show as he hurriedly waved his hands,” I’m not dead yet, I can still walk two steps.”","Li Moying swept him a glance and didn’t say anything else as he hugged his wife and went out.","Liu Buyan limped as he followed.","The three of them were about to walk out of the water prison when the few people behind them suddenly reacted.","Xuan Jiuling frowned, but he didn’t have time to say anything. He hurriedly ran out.","Steward Meng was so angry that his face turned red.” Damned brat! Who does she think she is?” He scolded angrily. The Young Master had sent someone to invite her over to flatter her, but she actually...He actually dared to say such words! Steward Ning, what is going on? Why does Young Master want to see them?”","Steward Ning was also indignant, but he was more worried than angry.","“I really don’t know. After the three of them left just now, the Young Master stayed in the pill refinement room alone. He originally said that he was going to enter seclusion for a while. I didn’t expect that after an hour, he flew into a rage and asked me to come out and look for someone...”","Steward Meng was even more puzzled.” This...What should we do now? Could it be that he had to bring the guards of the water prison to chase after them and snatch them away? However, the Divine General Xuan is following them. This...”","Steward Ning’s brows were tightly knitted. He hesitated for a while before gritting his teeth.” Let’s go back and report first.”","Outside the water prison.","Li Moying protected Huang Yueli who was in his arms as they boarded the Black Tortoise Clan’s horse carriage which had been waiting outside.","Finally, he stretched out his hand out with a conscience and pulled Liu Buyan up.","Xuan Jiuling followed him into the carriage. Before he could even sit properly, he impatiently said,” Patriarch Huang, why did you do that just now? An Zhenyu isn’t a kind person. Even if you don’t go to see him, there’s no need to be so explicit. If he bears a grudge against you, it’ll be troublesome.”","Huang Yueli smiled, totally disapproving,” So what? An Zhenyu schemed against me. Even if he doesn’t come looking for trouble with me, I’ll definitely repay him handsomely!”","Her voice was sweet and her tone was gentle, but the meaning in her words made Xuan Jiuling feel shocked.","It was only until this moment that he realised that he had been too immersed in his character earlier. Actually Huang Yueli and Li Moying weren’t the ordinary practitioners whom he had brought to see An Zhenyu to plead for mercy. The two of them were so powerful and their personalities were so flamboyant that even a Divine General like him couldn’t compare to them.","Would they be afraid of a mere An Zhenyu?","If it wasn’t because Liu Buyan was in the other party’s hands, they were afraid to shoot at the rat to avoid the vessel, most likely the two of them would have already overturned the entire White Fen Clan."]},{"number":4884,"title":"Chapter 4884: Junior Sister’s Life Is So Bitter","paragraphs":["Chapter 4884: Junior Sister’s Life Is So Bitter","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","But Xuan Jiuling couldn’t understand what Huang Yueli had done to make An Zhenyu’s attitude change so suddenly.","He had obviously been together with Huang Yueli and the rest, so what exactly had happened that he didn’t know about?","Xuan Jiuling couldn’t understand but seeing Huang Yueli’s unwilling expression, he didn’t ask further.","He sent the three of them to the entrance of an inn and left.","Huang Yueli asked for two superior rooms.","The moment they entered the room, Liu Buyan couldn’t wait to ask,” Junior Sister, Divine General Xuan was here earlier so it’s not appropriate for me to ask too much. You... Where did you and Li Moying go? Why have the two of you disappeared for so long? Did you run into some trouble? I’ve been worried about you all this time...”","“We did run into a little trouble, but it’s already been resolved. Aren’t we fine now?” Huang Yueli smiled as she casually brushed past all the matters that she had encountered previously.","This trip to Forest Shade Town, she and Li Moying had a narrow escape and almost died in the Devil’s Territory.","However, reality proved that their luck was indeed not bad. Not only did they not die in the end, but they even benefited from the disaster...","Better not show it off.","After all she only had Liu Buyan as a friend who ascended together from the Lower Realm so it wasn’t worth it to anger him to death.","However, Liu Buyan didn’t immediately understand her good intentions and when he saw her stuttering, he started to worry as he sized her up.","“Junior Sister, are you really alright? Do you think I don’t know you? If it’s really nothing, it’s impossible for you to not come back after the agreed time. Oh right, when you left, Junior Sister had a strange illness and didn’t wait for Divine Doctor Zhang to return...Could it be that his illness acted up halfway?”","“Cough cough! Well...You’re half right. Senior Brother, there’s something that I only found out after I left Snowflake City. Don’t get too excited later...”","Huang Yueli then recalled that Liu Buyan still didn’t know about her pregnancy as she subconsciously lowered her head to take a look at her slightly bulging stomach.","Liu Buyan sensed her gaze and followed her gaze over as his eyes widened!","“Junior Sister, you, you, you... What are you... No way!”","Huang Yueli nodded her head reservedly.","No matter how arrogant she usually was, she was still a girl who was not even twenty years old. Especially with the support of such talent, she originally thought that her pregnancy should be at least two hundred years later...","She felt like a minor who had tasted the forbidden fruit behind her elders’ backs. It was a little difficult for her to say it.","Since Liu Buyan had already guessed it, she didn’t need to say it directly.","“Cough cough, as you can see. That’s it...”","Liu Buyan stared fixedly at her stomach as though he was petrified.","Huang Yueli knew that it was a little hard for him to digest this news so she didn’t urge him.","After a long moment later, Liu Buyan finally reacted.","Huang Yueli’s lips relaxed and just as she was about to say something, Liu Buyan suddenly ran over and started wiping away his tears while wailing aloud.","“Junior Sister, you... Why is your life so bitter! In your previous life, you were schemed against and died young. In this life, you finally managed to make it out and got married to Li Moying and ascended to the God Realm but in the end...But you... But...”","Huang Yueli was totally dumbfounded,” Wait...Wait a minute, what about me? Why are you crying?”","Liu Buyan said,” You...” There’s such a big tumor in your stomach, I am extremely...Sad...”"]},{"number":4885,"title":"Chapter 4885: Have You Gone Silly?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4885: Have You Gone Silly?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli was stunned by Liu Buyan’s huge imagination and she didn’t come back to her senses for a long time.","Liu Buyan had already started to comfort her.","“Junior Sister, don’t despair like this! Although your illness is very difficult to treat, Divine Doctor Zhang’s medical skills are really amazing. If we think of a way to beg him, there might still be hope of curing it. You can’t give up on yourself now! Don’t worry, I will definitely... Ouch!”","Liu Buyan was halfway through his sentence when he suddenly felt a pain on his head as Li Moying knocked his head.","His expression changed as he turned around to glare at Li Moying,” Why did you hit me? You can’t save your wife, so you don’t have to vent your anger on me!”","Liu Buyan, have you become a fool after being locked up in the water prison for a few months?” Li Moying’s lips twitched a few times as he resisted the urge to throw this fellow out,” What tumor, are your eyes only for decoration?”","“What do you mean?” Liu Buyan was still in a daze, unable to react,” If Junior Sister didn’t have a tumor, then why is her stomach so big?”","Huang Yueli raised her hand and wiped off the cold sweat on her forehead as she lightly coughed twice.","“Senior Brother, you... Didn’t you think that I might be... pregnant?”","“Pregnant? Are you kidding me?” Liu Buyan’s first reaction was to scoff disdainfully,” It’s not just a day or two since I came to the God Realm so how could I not have this bit of common sense? It’s hard for the God Clan to give birth and even for the most ordinary Earth Grade innate talent practitioners, it’s common for them to not be able to give birth after a hundred years of marriage. With your and Li Moying’s innate talent, if you want to have a successor, perhaps taking in a disciple would be even more...”","Halfway through his sentence, he finally noticed Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s expression which was hard to explain in a few words and he choked.","“Wait... Wait, Junior Sister, you... What you said just now, could it be...Are you kidding me?”","“Why would I make such a joke?” Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as she said seriously: ” Senior Brother, you’ve really misunderstood. This isn’t some strange illness. I’m just pregnant.” It was also because of the baby that I fainted at the critical moment of my advancement.”","“Wha... What’s that? This... This...”","Liu Buyan seemed to have been struck by lightning.","He froze on the spot as he stared at Huang Yueli for quite a while before he regained his senses. He quickly asked: ” Is what you said true? But how is that possible? If you were already pregnant when you advanced, then you should be at least six or seven months pregnant now. Why is your stomach still so small? Also, I’ve checked your pulse before. Your pulse really doesn’t look like a happy pulse at all, right? Junior Sister, you must not hide your illness from the doctor...”","As Liu Buyan spoke, he circled back as though he was certain that Huang Yueli was suffering from a terminal illness.","Huang Yueli didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. She could only explain in detail: ” This is true. I met an expert after I left Snowflake City and only then did I know that I was pregnant. The reason why you can’t feel the happy pulse is because the cultivation technique I cultivate is special and affects the circulation of my meridians. As for the size of my stomach...”","“Just like what you said earlier, Moying and I have special talents so not only is it not easy to get pregnant, but the pregnancy period will also be longer than ordinary people. Right now, it’s about the equivalent of an ordinary person’s four months. I can already feel the baby’s fetal movement.”","When Huang Yueli mentioned about the baby in her stomach, a smile couldn’t help but appear on her face.","Liu Buyan only felt a little realistic at this moment,” You...You really are... Damn, aren’t you too strong?”","Her talent was already abnormally strong, and she even had a husband with abnormal strength.","Originally, the two of them had joined forces and had already attracted the jealousy of many people. Many people had to rely on secretly cursing the two Divine level geniuses to have no descendants in order to barely suppress the jealousy and hatred in their hearts.","But now, Huang Yueli had secretly gotten pregnant without a word?!","Countless boys and girls would be heartbroken!","However, speaking of which...","Liu Buyan soon had a new question, how abnormal would the innate talent of the baby born from two god grade geniuses be?"]},{"number":4886,"title":"Chapter 4886: Do you want to marry her?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4886: Do you want to marry her?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Also, wasn’t Li Moying this scumbag too lucky?","It was one thing if his innate talent was strong, but to be able to obtain the heart of a peerless genius like Huang Yueli was one thing, but he was actually going to be a Father at such a young age?","And as Li Moying’s Older Sworn Brother, he was still all alone!","Clearly, he, Liu Buyan, was more suave, understanding and more popular among the girls.","Life was really unfair!","Liu Buyan was so shocked by this new news that he couldn’t recover his senses for a long time.","Huang Yueli briefly explained her situation and put this matter aside.","Being pregnant was not a problem for her. She did not even have morning sickness. The intensity of her cultivation had also decreased. Every day, her husband would take care of her and she felt that she had gained a lot of weight...","Although she was pregnant which caused her several advancements to fail and indeed delayed her cultivation, but as long as she thought about how she could bring her adorable baby along to roam the God Realm, Huang Yueli felt that it was all worth it.","After all, it would only take a year to give birth. After giving birth, she would make up for it by cultivating more.","Compared to these, she was more concerned about Liu Buyan and Xuan Qingling’s situation.","“That’s right, Senior Brother, I haven’t had the chance to ask you. After I left with Moying, what happened to you and Young Miss Xuan? You were taken away by An Zhenyu. Where is Young Miss Xuan now?”","When he heard this question, Liu Buyan’s expression instantly turned gloomy as he let out a deep sigh.","“Young Miss Xuan, she...She was taken away by the Black Tortoise Clan, so she should still be in Snowflake City. I heard that the White Lake Clan has been urging for marriage, so the Black Tortoise Clan is prepared to stay here until Divine Doctor Zhang chooses a disciple, and then send Young Miss Xuan to the White Lake Continent to get married.”","When Huang Yueli heard this, her brows creased up,” You mean...Young Miss Xuan was under house arrest by the Black Tortoise Clan? However, Divine General Xuan did not mention this matter earlier...”","“This matter has nothing to do with Your Excellency, Divine General. Junior Sister, don’t misunderstand.” Liu Buyan hurriedly said,” It’s the Black Tortoise Clan who sent another female elder and brought Xuan Qingling away. Moreover, this female elder looks very suspicious. She was the one who brought An Zhenyu here and accused me of being Miss Qingling’s lover...”","Hearing that, Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged a glance as they had a judgement in their hearts.","“In that case, this elder is inextricably linked to Young Miss Xuan’s poisoning. Perhaps this poison was made by her.”","The matter between Liu Buyan and Xuan Qingling was too secretive so even when facing Xuan Jiuling, they didn’t reveal the matter of it.","It would be strange if there was nothing fishy going on since the female elder was so clear and even informed the White Fen Clan.","Liu Buyan nodded his head,” I think so too.”","He paused and stammered,”Junior Sister, I have a...” I wonder if you have a way to cancel Young Miss Xuan’s marriage with An Zhenyu? Young Miss Xuan is such an outstanding woman, but marrying a scumbag like An Zhenyu is really...”","Huang Yueli’s lips curled up as a playful look appeared on her face,” Speaking of saving people...Actually, it’s not completely impossible.”","“That’s great!” Liu Buyan’s face was filled with joy,” Junior Sister, I knew it, there’s nothing you can’t do. I’m so grateful...”","“Wait!” Huang Yueli stretched out a hand and stopped him from thanking her,” I can save her but I have to ask you a question first. Do you like Young Miss Xuan? Do you want to marry her?”"]},{"number":4887,"title":"Chapter 4887: The Antidote Is Here","paragraphs":["Chapter 4887: The Antidote Is Here","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Liu Buyan was stunned for a moment before his face flushed red as he shook his head repeatedly, stammering,” Marry... Junior Sister, what are you talking about! How could I...I like Young Miss Xuan? We...We’re not compatible at all! An outstanding woman like her should be worthy of being the heir of the various great god clans. I just think that An Zhenyu’s character is too bad and I’m afraid that he’ll delay Young Miss Xuan...”","Liu Buyan stuttered as he continued to peek at Huang Yueli’s expression.","Fortunately, Huang Yueli’s expression was calm as though she believed him as she nodded her head,” I understand. Senior Brother, you’re acting out of a sense of justice, right?”","“Yes, that’s it!” Liu Buyan said repeatedly.","Huang Yueli shrugged her shoulders,” Since that’s the case, then I won’t be able to help you. Sorry, Senior Brother.”","Liu Buyan was stunned,” Wh.... What was that? Didn’t you just say...”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes as her face was full of sincerity,” Senior Brother, I said earlier that I have a way but I have to pay a huge price! If it’s to save my future sister-in-law, then there’s nothing to say. I’m duty-bound. However, saving an unrelated ordinary friend, this... You should know my personality. I don’t like to meddle in other people’s business.”","When Liu Buyan heard this, his face turned pale as he opened his mouth, wanting to say something but stopped.","In the end, he said in a low voice,”I understand. Then...” Then forget it. I was just impulsive just now.”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were stunned.","Both of them thought that under Huang Yueli’s goading, Liu Buyan would definitely speak his true feelings and was even prepared to tease him.","But she had not expected that Liu Buyan would have such a reaction in the end.","This... It was really against common sense!","Huang Yueli stared at Liu Buyan as she started to doubt her life.","She had known Liu Buyan for two lifetimes and thought that she understood her Senior Brother very well. His attitude towards Xuan Qingling was definitely not ordinary.","But Liu Buyan refused to admit that he liked the other party no matter what...","Forget it. She could just take it that her Senior Brother was thin-skinned, but he gave up on begging her to save him just like that...Wasn’t that too strange?","Huang Yueli hesitated for a moment and decided to ask him face to face.","However, just as she was about to speak, there was a sudden knock on the door.","“Excuse me, do Young Master Li and Madam Li live here?”","This voice was somewhat familiar. It was Steward Meng, who had delivered the order to the water prison earlier.","The three people in the room immediately stopped talking.","Huang Yueli’s eyes turned as she raised her voice: ” That’s right, what’s the matter?”","“Madam Li, sorry to disturb your rest. My Young Master has something important to ask the two of you. I wonder if you can make it convenient for him?” Steward Meng’s tone was completely different from two hours ago. He was as flattering as he could be.","When Liu Buyan heard this, his entire person was a little dumbfounded.","Even though he believed in his Junior Sister’s ability and knew that Huang Yueli said that she would be able to get him the antidote, she definitely had a plan.","However, it had only been two hours!","The arrogant and domineering Young Master of the White Fen Clan, An Zhenyu, had actually come personally!","What did his Junior Sister do to him?","Huang Yueli’s expression remained calm as she winked at Liu Buyan and said silently,” Your antidote is here.”","Then, before Liu Buyan could react, she opened the door."]},{"number":4888,"title":"Chapter 4888: We Meet Again So Soon?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4888: We Meet Again So Soon?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As expected, it was An Zhenyu standing outside the door.","He was still wearing the same silver white robe that he had worn when he met them earlier in the morning. But for some reason, his robe was already covered with patches of dust and there were even a few black marks on his face.","Steward Meng and Steward Ning stood on his left and right, looking terrified.","An Zhenyu’s expression was even more interesting.","He narrowed his eyes as he stared at Huang Yueli, his face turning green and white, looking indescribably ugly. He didn’t look like he was here to beg for help, but seemed to have met his enemy.","Huang Yueli met An Zhenyu’s gloomy expression but she didn’t panic at all. Instead, she smiled calmly,” Young Master An, we meet again so quickly? My husband and I have already brought Senior Brother back. Young Master is really an honest and trustworthy person. This cooperation is very pleasant.”","“Pleasant...” An Zhenyu was even angrier after being teased by her.","He tried hard to hold it in, but he couldn’t.” Li, what do you mean? What did you do to that alchemy furnace? Hurry up and explain! You dare to lie to me? You’re simply courting death!”","Huang Yueli had an innocent expression as she blinked her eyes,” Young Master An, I don’t understand what you’re saying. What happened to that alchemy furnace?”","“Are you still pretending to be ignorant? That alchemy furnace is completely useless! I placed the herbs in and just as I lit the fire, the flames instantly enveloped the entire furnace and burned the herbs into ashes! It almost exploded on me!”","An Zhenyu suddenly slapped the railing of the inn corridor.","He was, after all, a Heart Profound Realm middle stage cultivator. This palm strike was truly astonishing in power. The high quality Primordial Silk Wood shattered into waste on the spot.","Thinking of the scene at that time, An Zhenyu’s anger surged.","He was originally filled with joy after obtaining such a high-grade alchemy furnace.","The moment Huang Yueli and the rest left, the first thing he did was to take out the medicinal herbs that he had kept for a long time, intending to test out the might of the pill furnace.","However, who would have thought that not only did he fail to refine the medicinal pill, but his entire body was also blown up. So many sky-high-priced medicinal herbs were also destroyed in a single day.","The guests in the surrounding rooms were secretly peeking out. When they saw this scene, their expressions changed and they immediately shrank back.","But although Huang Yueli was the closest to him, she wasn’t affected in the slightest and instead the curve of her lips widened.","” I don’t know about that. I’m not a Spirit Medicine Master. How would I know about the alchemy furnace?”","An Zhenyu listened to her nonchalant words and looked at the calm smile on her face. How could he not understand that all of this was clearly planned by this wretched girl!","If possible, he really wanted to slap this wretched girl who dared to scheme against him to death.","However, when he thought of the alchemy furnace that he had obtained with great difficulty, he still forcefully endured it.","“Madam Li, let’s not beat around the bush. I’ve already consulted the elders in the clan who are proficient in ancient books. This pill furnace suddenly exploded. It’s clearly because someone placed a seal on it. Since this was brought by you, you must have a way to unseal it, right?”","Huang Yueli raised her brows. This time, she finally didn’t deny it. Instead, she said: ” I used the pill furnace to make a deal with you. Since you have already obtained the pill furnace, whether you can use it or not, what does it have to do with me? Take my Senior Brother for example. Since he has been rescued, I won’t find trouble with you even if he was poisoned.”"]},{"number":4889,"title":"Chapter 4889: What else do you want?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4889: What else do you want?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When An Zhenyu heard this, he almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","Huang Yueli’s words were already blatantly mocking him, just short of directly slapping his face.","However, her words were so reasonable.","This matter was because he had concealed the fact that Liu Buyan was poisoned first so no matter where he went, he absolutely wouldn’t be in the right.","According to An Zhenyu’s usual practice, since he couldn’t outtalk the other party, he could only snatch it by force.","However, Xuan Jiuling, the famous expert of the Black Tortoise Clan, was already aware of this matter. Moreover, this period of time was the critical moment for Divine Doctor Zhang to take in a disciple. He had some misgivings and did not want to make too much of a commotion and let everyone know.","An Zhenyu repeatedly told himself that he had to hold it in and finally managed to calm his breathing.","“This young lord was right. You were scheming! The seal on the pill furnace was deliberately left behind by you. You... How dare you!”","Huang Yueli smiled as her expression was relaxed,” Young Master An must be joking. If I hadn’t been careful in advance, my Senior Brother would probably be begging for death now. How can I compare to you in terms of scheming?”","An Zhenyu saw that his deeds had already been exposed and no matter what, he couldn’t scare Huang Yueli so he could only take a step back and ask for the next best thing,” What exactly do you want? I’ve already brought the antidote. As long as he takes it, his illness will be cured. Hand over the medicine on one hand and the secret technique to break the seal on the other!”","He had originally thought that when he said this, Huang Yueli would definitely nod her head in agreement impatiently.","Who knew that Huang Yueli actually shook her head,” That won’t do.”","“What else do you want? I’ve already taken out the antidote!” An Zhenyu said angrily.","Huang Yueli replied indifferently,” Who knows if the antidote you took out is real or fake. Who knows if it might not be an antidote but an even more powerful poison. If my Senior Brother were to suffer from any side effects, who would I go to reason with? Give me the medicine first. After my Senior Brother eats it, if there’s no problem, I’ll naturally send the secret technique to you.”","When An Zhenyu heard this, his expression changed slightly.","This damned little girl, who exactly was she? Why couldn’t anything escape her eyes!","She even guessed that he was going to use fake medicine to get away with it?","An Zhenyu was really unwilling to let go of these civilians who dared to go against him. However, when he thought of the alchemy furnace that was still at home...","If he had never seen such a top-grade item, it would be fine. However, he had already seen it and even obtained it, but he could not use it...","There was nothing more unbearable than this.","An Zhenyu gritted his teeth.” Alright, I’ll give you the antidote first. I’ll let you know how magnanimous our White Fen Clan is. All your malicious speculations about our clan earlier are all slander! Steward Meng, give them the medicine!”","Steward Meng’s eyes widened in disbelief.","He had been An Zhenyu’s Steward for thirty years, and he had only seen others kneel and beg for mercy. When had he ever seen their Young Master fall so ruthlessly?","Seeing that he wasn’t moving, An Zhenyu urged him sternly,” What are you standing there for? Where’s the antidote?”","Only then did Steward Meng react as he hurriedly took out a small medicine bottle from his bosom and held it in front of Huang Yueli with both hands.","“This is the antidote. There are seven pills in total. Take one pill a day. After seven days, the poison will be completely eliminated. This is definitely the real antidote. Go ahead and find someone to verify it.”","Huang Yueli stretched out two slender and fair fingers as she casually picked up the bottle,” I naturally trust the White Fen Clan’s medical skills. Thank you, Young Master An.”"]},{"number":4890,"title":"Chapter 4890: Young Master is Wise!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4890: Young Master is Wise!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli completely didn’t hide the smug smile on her face.","An Zhenyu suppressed his anger.” Then the secret technique to remove the seal...”","“Young Master An, don’t worry. I’m different from you big families. My husband and I are juniors who are adventuring outside. If we don’t keep our promises, how can we survive until today? Don’t worry, after seven days, my Senior Brother will recover and the secret technique will be delivered.”","“Alright, then I’ll wait!” An Zhenyu sneered. If you dare to mess with this Young Master again, don’t blame this Young Master for being impolite!”","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, looking like she had a good temper,” Take care Young Lord An. I still have to take care of my Senior Brother so I won’t send you off.”","It was as if she had directly ordered him to leave.","An Zhenyu gritted his teeth in anger and turned around to leave.","Because of his anger, he walked very fast. He only stopped when he rushed out of the inn’s door and slammed his palm heavily on the door frame.","The plaque on the door of the inn fell with a loud bang.","The passers-by were like birds startled by the twang of a bow, not even daring to look over.","“This is really too much! These two damned brats actually dared to play with me like this. When I get the secret technique, I will definitely...” He must capture them and make them beg for death for all the humiliation suffered today!","An Zhenyu gritted his teeth.","Steward Meng, who was beside him, mustered up his courage and went forward. He asked carefully,”Young Master, we’ll...” Was he leaving just like that? Since they refused a toast only to drink a forfeit, why not capture them now and interrogate them? If we give them the medicine first, what if they go back on their word...”","“Go back on your word? They dare!” An Zhenyu sneered as a cold glint flashed across his eyes.” They’re lucky. If it weren’t for the fact that Divine Doctor Zhang’s selection test is coming up soon, how could I let them off so easily? But for these little brats, if this matter blows up and Divine Doctor Zhang hears about it, then the gains will not make up for the losses.”","Steward Meng was stunned for a moment before he came to a realization.","An Zhenyu’s main purpose for coming to Snowflake City this time was to become Divine Doctor Zhang’s disciple and obtain the inheritance of the ancient mystic realm in his hands.","Even if he were to bring his fiancée Xuan Qingling back, it would just be on the way.","However, Divine Doctor Zhang’s philosophy was different from the White Fen Clan. He advocated benevolence, benevolence, and healing the world. What he hated the most was the behavior of using his medical skills to intimidate civilians.","At such a critical moment, if the scandal of An Zhenyu using poison to control his enemy was exposed, he would probably be the first to be eliminated.","In comparison, being tricked by Huang Yueli was just a small matter.","“Young Master is wise! To be able to endure what ordinary people can’t, you’re indeed a hero among the people!” Steward Meng hurriedly flattered him skillfully.","As expected, An Zhenyu was very pleased, and his anger subsided quite a bit.” When I become Divine Doctor Zhang’s disciple and obtain the inheritance, it will be time for these little brats to pay the price!”","After An Zhenyu left, Huang Yueli immediately passed the medicine in her hands to Liu Buyan.","“Here, can you tell if this antidote is real or fake?”","Liu Buyan opened the bottle cap and took a whiff,” It should be true. For the sake of a high grade pill refining furnace, An Zhenyu wouldn’t dare to lie to you! Junior Sister, I really didn’t expect you to have such a trick up your sleeve. As expected of you!”","Huang Yueli lifted her chin,” That goes without saying! Hurry up and take the antidote.”","Liu Buyan didn’t say anything as he poured out a pill and consumed it.","Huang Yueli saw that he had finished eating and didn’t seem to have any abnormal reaction so she was completely relieved."]},{"number":4891,"title":"Chapter 4891: Just Because Of This?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4891: Just Because Of This?","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Alright, Senior Brother, since you’re fine, we can continue our previous topic.” Huang Yueli supported her chin as she stared at Liu Buyan with a smile and a tinkle in her eyes.","Liu Buyan was stunned, “Our previous topic? What topic?”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes,” That’s right...The thing we talked about before An Zhenyu came! You and Xuan Qingling... What happened?”","Liu Buyan’s expression stiffened for a moment, apparently not expecting Huang Yueli to still remember the topic that was interrupted earlier.","He thought that he had managed to get away with it.","“Didn’t I... Didn’t I tell you everything? I don’t have that kind of relationship with Young Miss Xuan...”","“Alright, alright, alright. If you say it’s not, then it’s not.” Huang Yueli interrupted him,” But you two are at least good friends who have gone through a few life and death tribulations together, right? Are you really not going to save her? After all, you’re my Senior Brother. As long as you insist, it’s not like I can’t make an exception...”","She was just scaring Liu Buyan earlier, wanting to force out his true feelings.","She didn’t expect Liu Buyan to be so stubborn, but she...she couldn’t just leave him in the lurch.","It had been so many years since her Senior Brother fell in love with a girl. Regardless of whether he was willing to admit it or not, she could not let her Senior Brother regret it in the future.","” That’s right. As long as you say the word, Li ‘er and I will handle this matter. There’s no need to worry.” Li Moying took a step forward as he spoke in a low voice.","He couldn’t be bothered to care about the life and death of outsiders but if Liu Buyan could get married earlier and stay further away from his Li ‘er, then it would be alright for him to put in some effort.","Liu Buyan choked,” You guys...Sigh!”","He sighed heavily.” I appreciate your kindness, but it’s not that I don’t want to save her, but...It’s Young Miss Xuan herself. I’m afraid she won’t be willing to leave.”","“Why?” Huang Yueli frowned in confusion,” Could it be that a proud daughter like Xuan Qingling is willing to marry someone like An Zhenyu?”","Liu Buyan didn’t know whether to laugh or cry as he looked at her,” My dear Junior Sister, do you think that everyone is like you, relying on your own innate talent and strength to dominate the entire God Realm and no one can threaten you? Although Xuan Qingling’s talent is not bad, she’s still far from you. Moreover, she has been nurtured by her family since she was young, and her feelings for the Black Tortoise Clan are much deeper than mine. The Black Tortoise Clan’s Patriarch is still waiting for the White Fen Clan to save him. How can she run away from the marriage at this juncture?”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she became even more puzzled,” Just for this?!”","“Isn’t that enough?” Liu Buyan replied,” Back then An Zhenyu hadn’t come looking for me and I had already sent a letter to Young Miss Xuan, asking her to leave the city to hide outside but she refused to leave and insisted on fulfilling the engagement. What can I say? Besides...”","Liu Buyan went silent for a moment before continuing,”No matter how bad An Zhenyu’s character is, he’s still the White Fen Clan’s Young Master. His innate talent is not bad and his medical skills far exceed his peers. If Young Miss Xuan marries over, she would at least be the White Fen Clan’s Young Madam. It’s much better than following a penniless doctor around, right?”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was secretly shocked and couldn’t help but exchange a glance with her husband.","It seemed that her Senior Brother did not have any intentions towards Xuan Qingling, nor was he just being stubborn. Instead, he had so many concerns...","Speaking of which, ever since she arrived in the God Realm, her Senior Brother had been a little depressed.","Because, he was no longer the proud son of heaven who stood at the top of Soaring Heavens Continent.","But Huang Yueli felt that her Senior Brother’s innate talent had been seriously underestimated."]},{"number":4892,"title":"Chapter 4892: Unexpected Guest","paragraphs":["Chapter 4892: Unexpected Guest","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Among the practitioners in the Gods Race who were similar in age to Liu Buyan, there were indeed quite a number of them whose innate talent and strength were stronger than Liu Buyan.","But the resources they had obtained from the clan since young could not be mentioned in the same breath as Liu Buyan.","How could a cultivator who ascended from the lower realm compare to a native of the God Realm?","Furthermore, Liu Buyan was originally a pure-blooded human and it was because of some special experiences that he obtained a little bit of White Fen Divine Blood. But even so, he still had Heaven Grade innate talent.","If he could be like the Protoss, receiving family training from a young age and getting the opportunity to have the divine blood penetrate his body, his talent would definitely increase by a small level.","Not to mention Liu Buyan’s innate talent in medicine...","Medical skills relied entirely on comprehension and money.","Liu Buyan as an Spirit Medicine Master without any influential background, to be able to reach his current stage, his innate talent definitely far surpassed the various great Ancient God Clans’ geniuses.","Unfortunately, he never had the chance to clear his name...","No, there seemed to be a chance!","Huang Yueli suddenly thought of something and her eyes lit up as she slammed the table.","Liu Buyan was startled by her sudden agitated reaction,” Junior Sister, you.... What’s wrong with you? Is there something wrong?”","“It’s nothing.”","Huang Yueli thought for a moment and decided to wait until she was confident before voicing out her thoughts.","“Senior Brother, I understand the matter between you and Young Miss Xuan. I’ll try my best to think of a way. Don’t worry, rest well for a period of time and recover from your injuries.”","Liu Buyan nodded but his tightly knitted brows didn’t loosen up.","In the southern suburbs of Snowflower City.","After Xuan Jiuling finished dealing with Huang Yueli’s matters, he had just returned to the Black Tortoise Clan’s encampment when he received an unexpected piece of news.","“What is it? The Patriarch had arrived in Snowflake City? When did this happen?” Xuan Jiuling stopped in his tracks while he was changing his clothes.","“He just arrived in the afternoon and was looking for you just now,” the Deputy General reported in a low voice.","Xuan Jiuling frowned.” You didn’t tell the Patriarch where I went, did you?”","“No, no.” The Deputy General hurriedly shook his head.” I still know the severity of the matter. I don’t dare to say anything. I’ll just say that you were out visiting a friend.”","Only then did Xuan Jiuling’s brows relax.” Hmm,” he said,” You’re smart. Where’s the Patriarch now?”","“When the Patriarch heard that you weren’t around, he immediately called Young Miss Qingling over...”","“Then I’ll go and take a look too,” Xuan Jiuling said after a moment of silence.","With that, he put on his coat, turned around, and walked out.","The Deputy General quickly chased after him.” Lord Divine General, there’s one more thing...” The Patriarch did not come alone today. Elder Qingguang also came along. She even brought her granddaughter, Young Miss Jialing...”","“What did you say? Qingguang is here too?”","Hearing this name, Xuan Jiuling was slightly startled, and then a complicated expression appeared on his face.","Elder Qingguang had been his good friend for many years. They grew up together. Although they rarely interacted after he left the Black Tortoise Clan and went to the Military Department, he still regarded Elder Qingguang as his best friend.","However, Elder Qingguang was involved in Xuan Qingling’s matter.","Those Black Tortoise Clan practitioners who were chasing after Xuan Qingling and Liu Buyan, under his interrogation, told him that they were under Elder Qingguang’s instructions.","Xuan Qingling herself had also hinted.","Xuan Jiuling really didn’t know who to believe, so he could only put this matter aside.","Who knew that Elder Qingguang would actually come to Snowflake City personally..."]},{"number":4893,"title":"Chapter 4893: Losing Chastity Before Marriage","paragraphs":["Chapter 4893: Losing Chastity Before Marriage","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Jiuling was silent for a while before sighing. “I understand. Let’s go.”","When Xuan Jiuling arrived at the main hall, everyone had already arrived.","Xuan Yuze, the Black Tortoise Clan’s Patriarch, was sitting at the main seat. When he saw him, he immediately smiled and waved at him.","“Elder Jiuling, you’re finally here. Please take a seat. We’re discussing the marriage between Qingling and Young Master An of the White Fen Clan. You’ve been in Snowflake City for the longest time and have had a lot of contact with the White Fen Clan. What do you think about this marriage?”","Xuan Jiuling cupped his hands and bowed. He looked up and sighed in his heart.","Xuan Yuze was leaning on a huge recliner. Although he was trying his best to stay alert, his expression was still dispirited, and an unnatural purplish pallor on his face.","Ever since he was heavily injured by the Devils’ sneak attack during the training, Xuan Yuze’s injuries had not recovered.","Not only was his cultivation greatly affected, but his lifespan was also affected.","The two of them were clearly about the same age, but Xuan Jiuling’s hair was still black. After Xuan Yuze was injured, his entire head of hair was almost white.","For Xuan Yuze, who had been strong all his life, this was a huge blow. It was no wonder he was in a hurry to show goodwill to the White Fen Clan.","Xuan Yuze was very respectful to Xuan Jiuling, so he specially left a seat on his right side for him. He waited for him to sit down before continuing to ask for his opinion.","Xuan Jiuling didn’t comment.” I’ve been in the army for many years, so I don’t have much experience in clan affairs. If Patriarch has any plans, just tell me, and I’ll do as you say.”","Xuan Yuze nodded. Some time ago, they sent me a message, hoping to hold the wedding as soon as possible. It would be best if the two juniors could get married in Snowflake City. I’ve already prepared Qingling’s dowry for this trip.”","When Xuan Jiuling heard this, he couldn’t help but turn around and look at Xuan Qingling, who was sitting silently at the bottom of the steps.","Because they practiced water-attribute cultivation techniques, the Black Tortoise Clan’s cultivators, regardless of gender, all looked delicate and refined. Even if they were not good-looking, they would have a cold temperament that was different from outsiders.","However, Xuan Qingling’s coldness was different from usual.","She sat there without any expression or movement, as if everyone in the main hall was talking about someone else, not her own marriage.","Xuan Jiuling recalled Liu Buyan whom he had just met and his brows furrowed slightly.","“Why are you in such a hurry? After all, it was a marriage alliance between two great families. No matter what, the wedding banquet had to be held in White Fen Continent. How could it be held in this frontier fortress? It’s going to damage the reputation of the two families!”","Xuan Yuze was just about to speak when a foul air rushed up his throat and he could not help but cough.","The maid beside him hurriedly handed him tea. Xuan Yuze drank it and only recovered.","“You’ve seen my current situation. I can’t delay it for too long.” Moreover, the White Fen Clan seems to be even more anxious than us. They were the ones who suggested the early marriage.”","Xuan Jiuling’s heart sank.","It seemed that Xuan Qingling’s marriage to An Zhenyu was a foregone conclusion.","To be honest, he didn’t think it was worth it to exchange the most outstanding genius of the younger generation in the family for a pill. However, Xuan Yuze was the Patriarch after all, and Xuan Qingling herself had agreed to marry.","Just as Xuan Jiuling was sighing inwardly, Elder Qingguang, who had been silent all this while, suddenly spoke.","“Patriarch, I don’t think it’s appropriate for Xuan Qingling to marry into the White Fen Clan. As far as I know, Xuan Qingling has already lost her virginity before marriage and even eloped with her lover for several months...”"]},{"number":4894,"title":"Chapter 4894: Evidence","paragraphs":["Chapter 4894: Evidence","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Upon hearing this, Xuan Jiuling couldn’t help but turn to look at Elder Qingguang.","After finding Xuan Qingling and Liu Buyan, he originally wanted to report to Xuan Yuze but under Liu Buyan’s request, he chose to hide the news.","Since nothing had happened between Xuan Qingling and Liu Buyan and she had already agreed to marry into the White Fen Clan, Xuan Jiuling felt that there was no need for her to stir up more trouble.","After all, Xuan Qingling was a lady of the Black Tortoise Clan. If any gossip were to spread, it would damage the reputation of the entire Black Tortoise Clan.","Because of this, Xuan Jiuling even sent those practitioners who were chasing after Liu Buyan to the front line of Blessed City.","Who knew that Elder Qingguang, who was far away in the Black Tortoise Continent, still learned of this news.","Could it really be as Liu Buyan had guessed...Was this related to Elder Qingguang?","Xuan Jiuling was puzzled, but he didn’t say anything.","This was the first time Xuan Yuze had heard of this news, and he was shocked.” What? Elder Qingguang, what did you say? How could such a thing happen? Qingling has always known the severity of the situation. She would never do such a thing!”","Elder Qingguang had a calm expression. “Patriarch, I’m afraid you’ve misjudged the person. Now, this matter had reached the White Fen Clan, and Young Master An had even personally caught Xuan Qingling’s adulterer. Only you are kept in the dark. If you don’t believe me, you can ask her yourself.”","Xuan Yuze turned his head in surprise and looked at Xuan Qingling.","Xuan Qingling’s expression remained the same.” Patriarch,” she said, neither servile nor overbearing. ” What Elder Qingguang said is just a rumour. Junior and Young Master Liu are only good friends who got to know each other through training and he’s a doctor. I accidentally got poisoned, so Young Master Liu came with me for a period of time to save me. I have already explained all of these to Young Master An.”","Xuan Yuze knew that Xuan Qingling had always been straightforward and disdained to lie. When he heard this, he secretly heaved a sigh of relief, but his expression was still quite serious.","“You’re too reckless. After all, they were already engaged. Even if they were ordinary friends, they could not get too close. No wonder Young Master An misunderstood. In the future, after you get married, you must not make the same mistake again, understand?”","Xuan Qingling nodded.","When Elder Qingguang saw that Xuan Yuze did not have any intention of pursuing the matter seriously, she immediately became anxious, and her tone became more anxious.","“Wait, Patriarch, how can you believe Xuan Qingling’s one-sided words? She’s clearly trying to get away with it by deliberately hiding it! What accidental poisoning? She clearly ran away overnight because her adultery was exposed and she was afraid of being punished by the clan rules!”","“What? How is that possible?” Xuan Yuze’s expression changed drastically.” Elder Qingguang, do you have any evidence for your words?”","Elder Qingguang was waiting for him to say this. He nodded immediately.” Of course I have evidence.” Xuan Qingling was having an affair with that brat surnamed Liu in the inn. At that time, she was discovered by the servant girl and the steward. These two people... I brought them all today.”","After she finished speaking, she immediately waved her hand and gestured for the servants to bring the witness in.","Not long after, a young woman and a middle-aged man with a goatee walked in with trepidation and bowed to the people in the room.","“Don’t hide anything you saw that night,” said Elder Qingguang.”Just report it to the Patriarch.”","The middle-aged Steward kowtowed and said,” Miss Qingling checked into the inn that I’m in charge of five months ago. She has been locked up and claimed to be cultivating in seclusion. However, one night, a young man came to visit.”"]},{"number":4895,"title":"Chapter 4895: Elder Qingguang’s Purpose","paragraphs":["Chapter 4895: Elder Qingguang’s Purpose","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“That man is handsome and has an outstanding temperament. He is indeed good-looking. There was even a badge of the Spirit Medicine Master Guild on his chest. He was already an Earth Grade Spirit Medicine Master at such a young age. He was truly young and promising. I couldn’t help but take a few more glances.”","” After the Spirit Medicine Master entered Miss Qingling’s room, I went to do my own things. In the end, not long after, the servant girl came to find me in a panic.”","The middle-aged Steward turned to look at the servant girl beside him.","The servant girl hurriedly replied,” Yes, I passed by Miss Qingling’s room that night and heard strange sounds in the room. There were also screams of men and women from time to time. I...” I’m afraid that Miss Qingling will be harmed by someone with bad intentions, so I’ll quickly went to find the Steward.”","The Steward nodded and continued,”We rushed in with a few guards. As soon as we entered, we saw...we saw...”","As he spoke, he suddenly stopped and glanced in Xuan Qingling’s direction a few times.","“What are you afraid of?” Elder Qingguang asked coldly. Tell me the truth! Since some people are shameless, what reason do you have to cover for her?”","The Steward then lowered his head and said,”Yes, then I’ll be frank.” As soon as we rushed in, we saw Miss Qingling and the doctor hugging each other in a very ambiguous manner. Moreover, Miss Qingling’s face was flushed red...At that time, everyone was shocked. At that moment, the doctor suddenly picked up Miss Qingling and ran outside. By the time we reacted and wanted to chase after him, it was already too late...”","“I swear that everything I said just now is true.”","Everyone was stunned.","No one had expected that Xuan Qingling, who was known for being cold and indifferent in the family, would actually openly have fun with an unknown man in the inn...","When Xuan Yuze heard this, his face turned green with anger. His finger that was pointing at Xuan Qingling trembled slightly, and he could not speak for a long time.","” You heard it, Patriarch,” Elder Qingguang said slowly.” I didn’t accuse Xuan Qingling wrongly.” Before these two witnesses came, they had already sworn on the Heavenly Dao that if they lied, they would be struck by lightning. I don’t think they would dare to lie.”","Xuan Yuze was even more furious when he heard Elder Qingguang’s words. He glared at Xuan Qingling and said angrily,” As a branch disciple, you were able to enter the core of the family and achieve your current achievements because of the resources and connections provided by the family! I didn’t expect you to be so ungrateful and do such a thing. How am I supposed to explain this to the White Fen Clan?”","Originally, as one of the top geniuses in the family, it was not a big mistake to have an affair regardless of gender.","However, Xuan Qingling was different.","The reason why the White Fen Clan agreed to this marriage was because they saw Xuan Qingling’s talent and she was chaste. They hoped that after she cultivated together with An Zhenyu, she would be able to help the Young Master, who was not very talented in martial arts, achieve a breakthrough.","Among them, the benefits gained from the first joint cultivation were naturally the most.","Now that Xuan Qingling had caused such a scandal, the benefits that the White Fen Clan valued the most were greatly reduced. They might go back on their word.","Thinking of this, Xuan Yuze was furious.","Seeing how furious Xuan Yuze was, Elder Qingguang smiled imperceptibly. “Since things have come to this, even if we hide the truth and marry Xuan Qingling, the White Fen Clan will definitely find out. It’s better to tell the truth and punish Xuan Qingling severely. Cripple her cultivation and appease the White Fen Clan’s anger. At the same time, choose another suitable candidate to marry Young Master An.”"]},{"number":4896,"title":"Chapter 4896: Looking at the Big Picture","paragraphs":["Chapter 4896: Looking at the Big Picture","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","No one had expected Elder Qingguang to make such a suggestion.","Even the furious Xuan Yuze was stunned for a moment and frowned.","“This... I’m afraid it’s not appropriate, right? When the White Fen Clan came to propose marriage, they specifically asked for Xuan Qingling, saying that Young Master An had admired her for a long time. Now that there was a sudden change, how was White Fen going to explain it? Besides, who is suitable to replace Xuan Qingling?”","When Elder Qingguang heard this, he suddenly changed the topic and his tone became serious.","“Patriarch, you’re still so indecisive at a time like this. Do you really think that the White Fen Clan is that magnanimous? Are you really not worried that the White Fen Clan will be furious and refuse to fulfill the engagement? Then your injury... No one can treat it!”","Hearing Elder Qingguang mention his injuries, Xuan Yuze immediately hesitated.","He had outstanding talent. When he was young, he was a famous prodigy in the God Realm and was considered the person most likely to break through to the Profound Life Realm in the Black Tortoise Clan.","Now, he was only two hundred years old. To a cultivator, he was still in his prime.","If his cultivation plummeted because of an accidental injury, he would inevitably be forced to give up the position of Patriarch...Just thinking about it made him unwilling!","“But...As for Young Master An...” He began to waver.","“Patriarch, why don’t you understand?” Elder Qingguang asked anxiously. The White Fen Clan valued Xuan Qingling because they thought that she was still a virgin. Now that the news of her having a lover had reached Young Master An’s ears, how could he be willing to suffer such a loss? We took the initiative to cancel the substitution to show our sincerity. As for the replacement...”","She paused and waved at the corner.” Ling’er, come here.”","A petite and gentle girl slowly walked over from an inconspicuous corner and bowed to Elder Qingguang.” Grandmother, Ling’er is here.”","Elder Qingguang nodded, then looked at Xuan Yuze.” My granddaughter, Jialing, is also a Heaven Grade genius. Her cultivation has improved rapidly these few years, and she has already entered the Profound Heart realm. More importantly, she has always been pure and prudent. She will never do anything out of line. I think the White Fen Clan will be very satisfied with such a daughter-in-law.”","Xuan Yuze finally understood what Elder Qingguang meant. He frowned slightly and looked at Xuan Jialing.","Speaking of which, he had an impression of this Xuan Jialing.","Although she was not as talented as Xuan Qingling, she was still a mid-tier Heaven-level existence. In addition, she had a large amount of resources sponsored by her grandmother, Elder Qingguang. Therefore, her cultivation speed was very outstanding among the younger generation of the family, second only to Xuan Qingling.","If she were to replace Xuan Qingling...","It was a feasible solution.","However...","” If the White Fen Clan is unhappy, it’s a good idea to change people,” Xuan Yuze said.” But there’s no need to give Qingling’s cultivation to the White Fen Clan, right?” It’s not easy for the clan to produce such a genius...”","“Patriarch, why are you so muddle-headed!” Elder Qingguang frowned.” Between you and Xuan Qingling, who is more important to the family? If you can recover from your injuries and successfully break through to the Profound Life Realm, it will be a great help to the clan! In comparison, what was a young genius who was only in the Profound Heart Realm? You must take the big picture into account!”","Hearing this, Xuan Yuze was indeed shaken again.","Xuan Jiuling finally couldn’t stand it anymore and said,”Wait! Patriarch, I have something to say.”"]},{"number":4897,"title":"Chapter 4897: Who Is the Most Suspicious?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4897: Who Is the Most Suspicious?","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Yuze was stunned.” Elder Jiuling, what do you have in mind?”","Xuan Jiuling frowned and said,” I’ve also heard about the matter between Xuan Qingling and that physician. The truth seems to be different from what Elder Qingguang said.” I hope Patriarch can verify the truth. We can’t wrongly accuse the geniuses of the clan because of a misunderstanding.”","Elder Qingguang’s expression changed.” Elder Jiuling, what do you mean?”","She really didn’t expect that Xuan Jiuling, who had a deep friendship with her, would actually stand up against her at this time.","Back then, if Xuan Jiuling hadn’t suddenly gone to the military camp, the two of them would have almost become Dao companions.","All these years in the Elder Council, Xuan Jiuling had always supported her.","Xuan Jiuling sighed slightly.” I’m sorry, Qingguang, but this matter...” I think we should listen to Qingling’s own opinion.”","Xuan Yuze heard his implied meaning and asked curiously,”What exactly happened?” Qingling, tell me yourself!”","Elder Qingguang wanted to stop him, but he couldn’t find a reason. He glared fiercely at Xuan Jiuling.","Everyone in the main hall looked at Xuan Qingling.","Xuan Jiuling also realized at this moment that although the discussion was so heated that they had almost convicted Xuan Qingling, her expression was so calm from the beginning to the end, as if she didn’t care about the opinions of outsiders.","This determination was truly extraordinary.","This caused Xuan Jiuling to love talents even more.","Xuan Qingling calmly cupped her hands and bowed to Xuan Yuze. Then, she raised her head and said in a neither servile nor overbearing manner,” Elder Qingguang’s words are not true.”","“Oh? However, the two witnesses just now swore on the Heavenly Dao.” Xuan Yuze said.","” They are right,” Xuan Qingling said.” Young Master Liu did come to my room that day.” However, I didn’t invite him. That night, after I finished cultivating, I asked the waiter to send tea to my room. In the end, after drinking it, I felt my entire body heat up and sweat like rain. At that moment, Young Master Liu suddenly came...”","Xuan Qingling quickly recounted the situation.","This was the first time Xuan Yuze had heard of such a thing. His brows furrowed even more tightly.” How preposterous! Are you implying that someone poisoned the tea and framed you? But how was this possible? At that time, you were already Young Master An’s fiancée. Who in the family didn’t know that your identity was important? Who would dare to do such a thing?”","Xuan Qingling’s expression did not change.” I don’t know about that. However, not everyone in the family would be happy to see me marry into the White Fen Clan. Whoever is most anxious to make their junior the young madam of the White Fen Clan would be the most suspicious.”","Although she did not mention Elder Qingguang, anyone could tell who she was referring to.","For a moment, everyone present gasped.","Xuan Yuze’s expression also changed slightly.","Elder Qingguang was immediately enraged. With a sudden force, he smashed the short table beside his hand into pieces.","“Damned girl, you’ve made a huge mistake, disregarding the interests of the entire clan. Even now, you still don’t admit your mistake and dare to slander this elder? It was simply incurable! Our Black Tortoise clan has always been low-key and pure. How could there be such a shameless thing like you!”","Xuan Jialing covered her face, looking like she was about to cry.","“Sister Qingling, your words hurt my heart. I agreed to help you clean up this mess for the sake of the family, but you actually... How dare you say that about me...”"]},{"number":4898,"title":"Chapter 4898: Flurry Of Footsteps","paragraphs":["Chapter 4898: Flurry Of Footsteps","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Elder Qingguang and Xuan Jialing reacted very quickly. They echoed each other and started to pour dirty water on Xuan Qingling.","If Xuan Yuze suspected them, things would be terrible.","The crime of murdering a top genius of the family was a serious crime that was difficult to bear even for an elder.","When Xuan Yuze heard the explanations from both sides, his brows furrowed even more tightly, feeling that his head was hurting.","Both sides insisted on their own words and blamed each other for their mistakes. However, both of them sounded very reasonable.","“Enough, quiet down!”","Xuan Yuze couldn’t take it anymore. He slammed the table, and the room fell silent again.","“Elder Jiuling, this matter...What do you think?” Xuan Yuze was silent for a moment before turning his gaze to Xuan Jiuling, the only neutral person present, to ask for his opinion.","” The two witnesses invited by Elder Qingguang shouldn’t be lying,” Xuan Jiuling said.” But what Xuan Qingling said should be true.” To tell you the truth, this old man has already met that doctor, Young Master Liu, while I was in Snowflake City. Young Master Liu’s testimony is exactly the same as Xuan Qingling’s. Every detail can be verified...”","“What’s so strange about that? This pair of lovers have been together for so long. I’m afraid they have already matched their words. How can you hear the flaws?” Elder Qingguang interrupted.","Xuan Jiuling’s expression was calm as he nodded.” Elder Qingguang is right. However, I have a friend in the military who vouched for Young Master Liu. With her strength and status, it’s impossible for me not to believe her words.”","“Ha, what a joke! What friends from the military? What power and status?” Elder Qingguang sneered. Elder Jiuling, why don’t you tell me the name? I want to see what she has to convince the Patriarch!”","Xuan Jiuling frowned slightly when he heard this.","When Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s names were announced, even Xuan Yuze had to be respectful but Huang Yueli wasn’t willing to reveal her identity.","Xuan Jiuling thought for a moment, but still didn’t reveal her name.","Elder Qingguang thought that he was feeling guilty, so he curled his lips coldly and turned back to Xuan Yuze.","” It’s very clear now. No matter how Xuan Qingling quibbles, it’s a fact that she lost her virginity before marriage. Patriarch, please put the interests of the family first. You can’t be soft-hearted!”","Xuan Yuze frowned and thought for a while before gritting his teeth.” In that case, let’s first let Xuan Qingling...”","Before he could finish speaking, there was a sudden rush of footsteps at the door.","“Patriarch,” the Steward came in and reported.” The White Fen Clan has sent someone to give Miss Qingling a betrothal gift.”","Upon hearing this, Xuan Yuze was stunned for a long while before he reacted.” Hurry up and invite them in,” he hurriedly said.","He didn’t understand what was going on. Didn’t they say that the White Fen Clan already knew about Xuan Qingling and the doctor? Why was he not here to break off the engagement, but to deliver the betrothal gifts?","Soon, boxes of gifts were delivered to the main hall and piled up into a small mountain.","Steward Meng of the White Fen Clan followed the last box in and bowed to Xuan Yuze. Before the other party could speak, he stood up straight.","” Patriarch Xuan, our Young Master asked me to come over and ask. I wonder how Miss Qingling’s preparations are going?”","His tone and attitude were truly disrespectful.","However, Xuan Yuze was already used to the White Fen Clan’s behavior. He coughed lightly.” Steward, you’ve worked hard. Please sit down and drink some tea.”","Steward Meng waved his hand and said,”I still have something to do. I have to go back and report.” Our Young Master asked me to bring a message. There was a blind lecher harassing Miss Qingling, and he has already dealt with it on her behalf. Please don’t worry about the Patriarch and Miss Qingling. Just prepare for the wedding.”","After he finished speaking, he did not stay any longer and left.","Xuan Yuze’s worried heart finally relaxed.","“Alright, let’s end today’s meeting here. Since the White Fen Clan already knew about this matter, Young Master An didn’t mind. He just carried out the original plan. Prepare more dowry for Young Miss Qingling as compensation to the An family.”","Hearing this, Elder Qingguang and Xuan Jialing’s faces turned green."]},{"number":4899,"title":"Chapter 4899: News of Liu Buyan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4899: News of Liu Buyan","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","An Zhenyu actually didn’t care about Xuan Qingling’s scandals and even planned to marry her according to the original plan!","How could such a thing happen?","Elder Qingguang almost couldn’t hold it in anymore. He never thought that after putting in so much effort in secret, it actually didn’t have any effect.","Was An Zhenyu a fool? He was even willing to marry a woman who had lost her virginity?","Or could it be...Was Xuan Qingling telling the truth? She really didn’t tell that doctor...","However, this was even more illogical.","How strong the Spring Fragrance Powder’s medicinal properties were, she was clear as day. Back then, the person who sold this medicine to her was a famous poison master. He promised her before that as long as she came into contact with a little, no matter what kind of chaste and heroic woman, as long as they did not have Dao Profound Realm cultivation, they absolutely could not resist.","Not to mention, she had personally picked that Liu brat back then because she had taken a fancy to his outstanding appearance.","With these two factors intertwined, how could Xuan Qingling not lose her virginity?","The two of them were puzzled. However, things had come to this point, and Xuan Yuze had clearly made the final decision.","With that said, Xuan Yuze summoned the Steward and was supported out of the main hall.","Xuan Jialing was extremely anxious and begged,”Grandmother, this time...” What should he do now? Why did Young Master An...Must he have that little vixen Xuan Qingling? How am I worse than her?","The Patriarch is also old and muddle-headed...”","“Jialing, watch your words!”","Elder Qingguang frowned and stopped her in a low voice.","“Patriarch naturally has his considerations, but you don’t have to be anxious. As long as this marriage isn’t completed, you still have a chance. Don’t be impatient.”","On the other side.","As soon as the meeting ended, Xuan Qingling walked out of the door and went to her room.","The gazes of the people in the main hall fell on her. Along the way, the discussions around her were endless.","This was the first time many people had heard about Xuan Qingling’s possible loss of virginity before marriage. For a moment, they couldn’t control their curiosity and started discussing.","Originally, in such a family, the trifling matter of a top-notch genius could become a hot topic of conversation among the clansmen.","Moreover, this was a matter of utmost importance regarding the marriage alliance with the White Fen Clan.","However, no matter what others said, Xuan Qingling acted as if she hadn’t heard anything. There was no expression on her face, and even her pace didn’t change at all.","Just as she turned the corner, a familiar voice came from behind her.","“Qingling, wait a moment.”","Xuan Qingling stopped in her tracks, turned around, and bowed to the person.” Lord Divine General.”","During this period of time, she was extremely disappointed with her family and clansmen.","If it was anyone else, she would not bother but Xuan Jiuling had done her and Liu Buyan a favor so she couldn’t ignore him.","Xuan Jiuling lowered his head and glanced at her, sighing inwardly.","This was originally the future hope of the clan. Not only was his talent outstanding, but he also had a friendship with that Sacred Phoenix Race...Unfortunately, the Patriarch was short-sighted, and he had no right to interfere.","“Qingling, I came here with only one thing to tell you.” Xuan Jiuling used his Divine Awareness to transmit his voice.” Patriarch Huang and Young Lord Li have already arrived at Snowflake City. I’ve already gone to see them earlier. The two of them rescued Young Master Liu from An Zhenyu. You don’t have to worry too much.”","Xuan Qingling was slightly startled, and her calm eyes finally revealed a trace of surprise.","“This...is this true? That was great. Lord Divine General, thank you for informing me of this matter.”"]},{"number":4900,"title":"Chapter 4900: Who’s Your Friend?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4900: Who’s Your Friend?","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Jiuling nodded, but he didn’t leave immediately. Instead, he hesitated for a moment.","Qingling, if you have anything to tell Matriarch Huang, I can pass it on to her.”","Xuan Qingling was stunned for a moment. She looked at the ground and shook her head.” Thank you, Lord Divine General, but... But there is no need. Although Elder Qingguang is biased against me, the matter has been resolved smoothly. There is no need for Matriarch Huang to worry about this small matter of mine.”","Xuan Jiuling knew that she had made up her mind to marry into the White Fen Clan to repay the clan’s kindness, so he could only nod his head.","“Alright, be careful.”","After Xuan Jiuling left, Xuan Qingling stayed in the corridor for a while, looking at the flowers and plants that had just sprouted in the courtyard. After a while, she turned around and prepared to return to her room.","But at this moment, someone called out to her.","“Xuan Qingling, so you were hiding here! Why, are you missing your lover here?” A cold laugh rang out.","Xuan Qingling furrowed her brows, but she soon relaxed and turned to look at the person who had just arrived.","“Xuan Jialing, I really didn’t expect that you would attack me in order to marry into the White Fen Clan. I originally thought that even if we weren’t sisters, we could still be considered friends.”","As a genius selected by a branch of the family, Xuan Qingling was brought to the main family for training at a very young age.","However, the pure-blooded cultivators of the main family couldn’t stand the fact that a little girl from a branch enjoyed better treatment than them, so they had been bullying Xuan Qingling openly and secretly.","At that time, Xuan Jialing was the granddaughter of an elder and was a few years older than Xuan Qingling, so she often protected her.","It wasn’t until later on, when Xuan Qingling’s talent was gradually revealed, and her cultivation became higher and higher, even surpassing Xuan Jialing, that the two of them gradually drifted apart.","When Xuan Jialing heard Xuan Qingling mention the past, her face stiffened slightly, but it soon became even more gloomy.","“You’re so funny. Who’s your friend? Stop pretending to be pitiful. If you treat me as a friend, would you steal my place in the trial? Would he snatch away the qualifications to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet? Would you beat me every time and make me a joke?","Not to mention this time...You clearly know that I have admired Young Master An for a long time, but you still insist on snatching this marriage!”","Xuan Qingling’s expression was originally solemn, but after hearing her words, she calmed down.” So, you’ve always thought of me this way? The clan’s resources were originally given to the strongest. Everyone competed fairly. What did I do wrong to you? As for Young Master An...I have no intention of marrying him. It’s the White Fen Clan that insists on...”","“Enough, shut up! Don’t act like you’ve gotten a bargain here!” Xuan Jialing interrupted her sternly.","She originally had a delicate and refined appearance, but now because of jealousy and hatred, she looked even more ferocious.","“Since you feel that you have nothing to do with me, then I have nothing to do with you! Not only have you become the number one genius of the family, but you’re also about to become the young madam of the White Fen Clan. Are you looking at me as a joke?”","Xuan Qingling looked at her expressionlessly and didn’t say anything.","“Don’t think that I don’t know that you’re still thinking about that Young Master Liu, right?” Xuan Jialing sneered. I really don’t know if you’re being despicable or something. You don’t like a proud son of heaven with a prestigious family background like Young Master An, but you insist on liking a lowly human doctor. It’s ridiculous!”","” I heard that Young Master An has already fed him a Wight Pill and plans to refine him into a medicine man. In the future, when you marry into the White Fen Clan, you might even be able to meet him again!”"]}]);
